          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=UTF-8",
            "text": "[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/w8-dancercise-with-anna-wicks\\/\",\"id\":\"404\",\"name\":\"Dancercise with Anna Wicks\",\"title\":\"Dancercise with Anna Wicks\",\"duration\":\"50 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Wellness\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1767744000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\",\"59\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/34001\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1767810600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1768348800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\",\"59\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/34002\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768415400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1768953600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\",\"59\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/34003\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769020200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1769558400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\",\"59\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/34004\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769625000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1767744000,1768348800,1768953600,1769558400],\"start_date\":\"1767810600\",\"end_date\":\"1769625000\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"Z3RjVXpMTVhWRmwxSFVWY1A3WTRMUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Wed 7 - Wed 28 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"After a tough three years of intense professional training and work in the dance and musical theatre industry, Anna Wicks rediscovered the joy of moving&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.jpeg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"Anna Wickes NEW\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/bd\\/cbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx260\\/cw1879\\/ch1875\\/images\\/uploads\\/bdcbec49089ac0f550724f46d0422d9e.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"After a tough three years of intense professional training and work in the dance and musical theatre industry, Anna Wicks rediscovered the joy of moving simply to feel good. No competing for that job, no professional pressure, just dancing because it\\u2019s good for the soul!Anna\\u2019s classes are a safe space where you\\u2019re encouraged to lose your inhibitions and strip exercise back to that freeing feeling of dancing when no one is watching. These classes involve plenty of Anna making a fool out of herself with air guitars, shimmying, sweating and sensational playlists (if she does say so herself) and so much heart.Let\\u2019s recognise the importance of enjoying judgement free exercise and dance together - please come along for an hour of boogying. Absolutely no previous dance experience is required!\\u00a0\\u00a0For more info, follow\\u00a0@dancercisewithanna\\u00a0on Instagram!This class is open to all ages.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"72\",\"59\"],\"search\":\"Dancercise with Anna Wicks Dancercise with Anna Wicks Wellness  <p>After a tough three years of intense professional training and work in the dance and musical theatre industry, Anna Wicks rediscovered the joy of moving simply to feel good. No competing for that job, no professional pressure, just dancing because it\\u2019s good for the soul!<\\/p><p>Anna\\u2019s classes are a safe space where you\\u2019re encouraged to lose your inhibitions and strip exercise back to that freeing feeling of dancing when no one is watching. These classes involve plenty of Anna making a fool out of herself with air guitars, shimmying, sweating and sensational playlists (if she does say so herself) and so much heart.<\\/p><p>Let\\u2019s recognise the importance of enjoying judgement free exercise and dance together - please come along for an hour of boogying. Absolutely no previous dance experience is required!&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>For more info, follow&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/dancercisewithanna\\/?igshid=MzRlODBiNWFlZA%3D%3D\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">@dancercisewithanna<\\/a>&nbsp;on Instagram!<\\/p><p>This class is open to all ages.<\\/p> Dancercise with Anna Wicks  After a tough three years of intense professional training and work in the dance and musical theatre industry, Anna Wicks rediscovered the joy of moving simply to feel good. No competing for that job, no professional pressure, just dancing because it\\u2019s good for the soul!Anna\\u2019s classes are a safe space where you\\u2019re encouraged to lose your inhibitions and strip exercise back to that freeing feeling of dancing when no one is watching. These classes involve plenty of Anna making a fool out of herself with air guitars, shimmying, sweating and sensational playlists (if she does say so herself) and so much heart.Let\\u2019s recognise the importance of enjoying judgement free exercise and dance together - please come along for an hour of boogying. Absolutely no previous dance experience is required!\\u00a0\\u00a0For more info, follow\\u00a0@dancercisewithanna\\u00a0on Instagram!This class is open to all ages. Workshops & Classes Wellness\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/tf-west-london-free-school-alumni-exhibition-2025-championing-creativity\\/\",\"id\":\"1046\",\"name\":\"WEST LONDON FREE SCHOOL ALUMNI EXHIBITION 2025\",\"title\":\"WEST LONDON FREE SCHOOL ALUMNI EXHIBITION 2025 'CHAMPIONING CREATIVITY'\",\"duration\":\"\",\"slot_tag\":\"Art & Exhibitions\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"0\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"55\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[],\"start_date\":\"1765962000\",\"end_date\":\"1767657300\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"SUZxRk5RQmNPVU8zUkx4ZjBpZEh3QT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Wed 17 Dec 2025 - Mon 5 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"3 NOVEMBER 2025 - 5 JANUARY 2026November sees the launch of the first ever exhibition of works by alumni and staff of the West London Free School at Riverside&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b9\\/7c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx528\\/cw883\\/ch885\\/images\\/uploads\\/b97c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b9\\/7c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx528\\/cw883\\/ch885\\/images\\/uploads\\/b97c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b9\\/7c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx528\\/cw883\\/ch885\\/images\\/uploads\\/b97c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b9\\/7c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx528\\/cw883\\/ch885\\/images\\/uploads\\/b97c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b9\\/7c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx528\\/cw883\\/ch885\\/images\\/uploads\\/b97c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b9\\/7c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx528\\/cw883\\/ch885\\/images\\/uploads\\/b97c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b9\\/7c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431\\/w1920\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx528\\/cw883\\/ch885\\/images\\/uploads\\/b97c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b9\\/7c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431\\/w1920\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx528\\/cw883\\/ch885\\/images\\/uploads\\/b97c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b9\\/7c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx528\\/cw883\\/ch885\\/images\\/uploads\\/b97c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b9\\/7c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx528\\/cw883\\/ch885\\/images\\/uploads\\/b97c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b9\\/7c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx528\\/cw883\\/ch885\\/images\\/uploads\\/b97c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b9\\/7c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx528\\/cw883\\/ch885\\/images\\/uploads\\/b97c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b9\\/7c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx528\\/cw883\\/ch885\\/images\\/uploads\\/b97c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b9\\/7c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431\\/w1920\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx528\\/cw883\\/ch885\\/images\\/uploads\\/b97c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b9\\/7c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431\\/w1920\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx528\\/cw883\\/ch885\\/images\\/uploads\\/b97c437b787d5f68e0fe09dd4628c431.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"3 NOVEMBER 2025 - 5 JANUARY 2026November sees the launch of the first ever exhibition of works by alumni and staff of the West London Free School at Riverside Studios to celebrate the achievements of all the students who have gone on to follow exciting and innovative pathways. \\u00a0Fostering creativity has been one of the key elements of the West London Free School since its inception in 2011. The exhibition brings together a selection of works by ex-WLFS students and past and present staff and includes printmaking, film, fashion photography, painting and architectural drawings. With this multi-disciplinary showcase, we seek to highlight the continuing relevance of the arts in the curriculum and the importance of championing an appreciation of visual culture through engaging creatively with the world around us.\\u00a0\\u00a0The Creative Industries are a cornerstone of the British economy, and their continued importance and growth must be supported. Art education in schools provides the foundation for this and encourages curiosity, experimentation and collaboration. \\u00a0Head of Art and History of Art at WLFS Mr James Bacchi-Andreoli states,\\u00a0 \\u2018Here at WLFS we harness the talents of young artists from an early age, and we want to equip pupils for the future by giving them the independence and confidence to challenge the obvious and find innovative solutions to any creative problem\\u2019.\\u00a0Our past students have gone on to world-renowned institutions at home and abroad from The Bartlett School of Architecture, London College Fashion, University of the Arts London, Universities of Cambridge, Leeds, Goldsmiths and IFM Paris to name but a few\\u2019.\\u00a0With more than 30 creative practitioners in this show it demonstrates that a specialisation in the arts can lead to many interesting and sustainable careers in diverse fields from fashion, advertising and animation to film, teaching and architecture. It is therefore vital to keep the arts and the fulfilment of creative endeavour in the spotlight, for as the well-known art activist Bob and Roberta Smith said: \\u2018Art Makes People Powerful.\\u2019\\u00a0\\u00a0Participating Creatives (39):\\u00a0Afiya Paice, Alexis Allan, Alise Andzane, Amber Bruckmann, Anduena Sherifi, Annabel Barrett, Augustin Gougeon, Barbara Cserny, Benjamin Salmon, Bethany Mather, Bibi Delafield Wright, Calista Larkin, Clementine Knight, Coco Stephens, Dahlia Abbassy-Robeikheh, David Robinson, Gwendoline Leprince,\\u00a0 Hansi Pirra, Haruna Pearson, Hugo Hamper-Potts, J & Skye Palmer-Jones, Jack Hunter, James Bacchi-Andreoli, Jemima Stern, Joseph Critchley, Joseph Tamborini, Kira Bacchio-Panic, Lily Stephens, Lolita lamele, Lydia Lott, Martha Phibbs, Marwa Semar, Monty Hunt, Nancy Thomas, Neo Chatwin, Nicola Hepworth, Rose Osborn, Sasha Lazarevic \\u2013 Mulhern and Xii Don Lim.\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0Additional information:The West London Free School\\u00a0is co-educational free school established\\u00a0in 2011, located\\u00a0in Hammersmith, West London. In 2025 the school was named the Comprehensive Secondary School of the Year in London by The Times.\\u00a0 The school has a distinct and very clear\\u00a0ethos, which is to provide an ambitious and rigorous education for pupils of all backgrounds, emphasising scholarship and academic excellence. The school\\u00a0has a thriving Art Department and is one of the few state Schools\\u00a0in the country to offer History of Art A Level.Www.wlfs.org@wlfsartgallery\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":\"no-link\",\"event_type\":[\"55\"],\"search\":\"WEST LONDON FREE SCHOOL ALUMNI EXHIBITION 2025 WEST LONDON FREE SCHOOL ALUMNI EXHIBITION 2025 'CHAMPIONING CREATIVITY' Art & Exhibitions  <p><strong>3 NOVEMBER 2025 - 5 JANUARY 2026<\\/strong><\\/p><p>November sees the launch of the first ever exhibition of works by alumni and staff of the West London Free School at Riverside Studios to celebrate the achievements of all the students who have gone on to follow exciting and innovative pathways. &nbsp;<br><br>Fostering creativity has been one of the key elements of the West London Free School since its inception in 2011. The exhibition brings together a selection of works by ex-WLFS students and past and present staff and<strong> includes printmaking, film, fashion photography, painting and architectural drawings.<\\/strong> With this multi-disciplinary showcase, we seek to highlight the continuing relevance of the arts in the curriculum and the importance of championing an appreciation of visual culture through engaging creatively with the world around us.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p><p>The Creative Industries are a cornerstone of the British economy, and their continued importance and growth must be supported. Art education in schools provides the foundation for this and encourages curiosity, experimentation and collaboration. &nbsp;<br><br>Head of Art and History of Art at WLFS Mr James Bacchi-Andreoli states,&nbsp; <i>\\u2018Here at WLFS we harness the talents of young artists from an early age, and we want to equip pupils for the future by giving them the independence and confidence to challenge the obvious and find innovative solutions to any creative problem\\u2019<\\/i>.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i>Our past students have gone on to world-renowned institutions at home and abroad from The Bartlett School of Architecture, London College Fashion, University of the Arts London, Universities of Cambridge, Leeds, Goldsmiths and IFM Paris to name but a few\\u2019.&nbsp;<\\/i><\\/p><p>With more than 30 creative practitioners in this show it demonstrates that a specialisation in the arts can lead to many interesting and sustainable careers in diverse fields from fashion, advertising and animation to film, teaching and architecture. It is therefore vital to keep the arts and the fulfilment of creative endeavour in the spotlight, for as the well-known art activist Bob and Roberta Smith said: \\u2018Art Makes People Powerful.\\u2019&nbsp;<\\/p><p><br>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Participating Creatives (39):&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Afiya Paice, Alexis Allan, Alise Andzane, Amber Bruckmann, Anduena Sherifi, Annabel Barrett, Augustin Gougeon, Barbara Cserny, Benjamin Salmon, Bethany Mather, Bibi Delafield Wright, Calista Larkin, Clementine Knight, Coco Stephens, Dahlia Abbassy-Robeikheh, David Robinson, Gwendoline Leprince,&nbsp; Hansi Pirra, Haruna Pearson, Hugo Hamper-Potts, J &amp; Skye Palmer-Jones, Jack Hunter, James Bacchi-Andreoli, Jemima Stern, Joseph Critchley, Joseph Tamborini, Kira Bacchio-Panic, Lily Stephens, Lolita lamele, Lydia Lott, Martha Phibbs, Marwa Semar, Monty Hunt, Nancy Thomas, Neo Chatwin, Nicola Hepworth, Rose Osborn, Sasha Lazarevic \\u2013 Mulhern and Xii Don Lim.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p><p><br>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Additional information:<\\/strong><\\/p><p>The West London Free School&nbsp;is co-educational free school established&nbsp;in 2011, located&nbsp;in Hammersmith, West London. <strong>In 2025 the school was named the Comprehensive Secondary School of the Year in London by The Times<\\/strong>.&nbsp; The school has a distinct and very clear&nbsp;ethos, which is to provide an ambitious and rigorous education for pupils of all backgrounds, emphasising scholarship and academic excellence. The school&nbsp;has a thriving Art Department and is one of the few state Schools&nbsp;in the country to offer History of Art A Level.<\\/p><p><a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.wlfs.org\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Www.wlfs.org<\\/a><\\/p><p>@wlfsartgallery&nbsp;<\\/p>   3 NOVEMBER 2025 - 5 JANUARY 2026November sees the launch of the first ever exhibition of works by alumni and staff of the West London Free School at Riverside Studios to celebrate the achievements of all the students who have gone on to follow exciting and innovative pathways. \\u00a0Fostering creativity has been one of the key elements of the West London Free School since its inception in 2011. The exhibition brings together a selection of works by ex-WLFS students and past and present staff and includes printmaking, film, fashion photography, painting and architectural drawings. With this multi-disciplinary showcase, we seek to highlight the continuing relevance of the arts in the curriculum and the importance of championing an appreciation of visual culture through engaging creatively with the world around us.\\u00a0\\u00a0The Creative Industries are a cornerstone of the British economy, and their continued importance and growth must be supported. Art education in schools provides the foundation for this and encourages curiosity, experimentation and collaboration. \\u00a0Head of Art and History of Art at WLFS Mr James Bacchi-Andreoli states,\\u00a0 \\u2018Here at WLFS we harness the talents of young artists from an early age, and we want to equip pupils for the future by giving them the independence and confidence to challenge the obvious and find innovative solutions to any creative problem\\u2019.\\u00a0Our past students have gone on to world-renowned institutions at home and abroad from The Bartlett School of Architecture, London College Fashion, University of the Arts London, Universities of Cambridge, Leeds, Goldsmiths and IFM Paris to name but a few\\u2019.\\u00a0With more than 30 creative practitioners in this show it demonstrates that a specialisation in the arts can lead to many interesting and sustainable careers in diverse fields from fashion, advertising and animation to film, teaching and architecture. It is therefore vital to keep the arts and the fulfilment of creative endeavour in the spotlight, for as the well-known art activist Bob and Roberta Smith said: \\u2018Art Makes People Powerful.\\u2019\\u00a0\\u00a0Participating Creatives (39):\\u00a0Afiya Paice, Alexis Allan, Alise Andzane, Amber Bruckmann, Anduena Sherifi, Annabel Barrett, Augustin Gougeon, Barbara Cserny, Benjamin Salmon, Bethany Mather, Bibi Delafield Wright, Calista Larkin, Clementine Knight, Coco Stephens, Dahlia Abbassy-Robeikheh, David Robinson, Gwendoline Leprince,\\u00a0 Hansi Pirra, Haruna Pearson, Hugo Hamper-Potts, J & Skye Palmer-Jones, Jack Hunter, James Bacchi-Andreoli, Jemima Stern, Joseph Critchley, Joseph Tamborini, Kira Bacchio-Panic, Lily Stephens, Lolita lamele, Lydia Lott, Martha Phibbs, Marwa Semar, Monty Hunt, Nancy Thomas, Neo Chatwin, Nicola Hepworth, Rose Osborn, Sasha Lazarevic \\u2013 Mulhern and Xii Don Lim.\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0Additional information:The West London Free School\\u00a0is co-educational free school established\\u00a0in 2011, located\\u00a0in Hammersmith, West London. In 2025 the school was named the Comprehensive Secondary School of the Year in London by The Times.\\u00a0 The school has a distinct and very clear\\u00a0ethos, which is to provide an ambitious and rigorous education for pupils of all backgrounds, emphasising scholarship and academic excellence. The school\\u00a0has a thriving Art Department and is one of the few state Schools\\u00a0in the country to offer History of Art A Level.Www.wlfs.org@wlfsartgallery\\u00a0 Art & Exhibitions\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-o