ddac04ff.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Don\\u2019t panic! A new live version of Douglas Adams\\u2019 mind-blowingly imaginative comedy (mis)adventure, The Hitchhiker\\u2019s Guide to The Galaxy, lands at Riverside Studios this November.Join Arthur Dent, Zaphod Beeblebrox, Fenchurch and many more as you escape the destruction of Earth with seconds to spare and begin a search for answers to the mystery of Life, the Universe and Everything, armed only with a towel and one VERY depressed robot.The night begins in a rather unusual pub as you settle in, drink in hand, for an evening of storytelling and spectacle. From there, the story lifts off \\u2013 quite literally \\u2013 as you hitch a ride on a passing spaceship, discover the meaning of life, and join a quest to persuade a group of inter-dimensional mice to give the Earth a second chance.Brought to life by an award-winning creative team, and featuring a multi-talented company of actors, this inventive take on Douglas Adams\\u2019 classic draws from the best examples of immersive, musical theatre, dance and magic to deliver a truly out of this world experience and a complete night out.Warning: Side effects may include sudden existential dread, unexpected hyperspatial detours and a burning desire for a really good cup of tea.BOOK NOW \\u2013 before the end of the Earth! | Tickets from \\u00a342 | Riverside Studios\\u00a0Feeling improbably important? You might be a Person of Galactic Significance. Why not upgrade to a VIP ticket to enjoy:\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Priority entry\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Reserved seating\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 1x Pan Galactic Gargle Blaster (choose your level of lucidity: alcoholic or non-alcoholic)*\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 1x collectible \\u2018Infinite Improbability Deck\\u2019 of cards* Or choose from something marginally less mind-altering: beer, house wine, or soft drink.\\u00a0AccessibilityFor access enquiries\\/bookings, please call our Box Office team directly on 0208 237 1010, or email boxoffice@old.riversidestudios.co.uk and we will be happy to help with your needs.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"3\"],\"event_age_ratings\":[\"81002\"],\"search\":\"The Hitchhiker\\u2019s Guide to The Galaxy The Hitchhiker\\u2019s Guide to The Galaxy Theatre  <h3>Don\\u2019t panic! A new live version of Douglas Adams\\u2019 mind-blowingly imaginative comedy (mis)adventure, The Hitchhiker\\u2019s Guide to The Galaxy, lands at Riverside Studios this November.<\\/h3><p>Join Arthur Dent, Zaphod Beeblebrox, Fenchurch and many more as you escape the destruction of Earth with seconds to spare and begin a search for answers to the mystery of Life, the Universe and Everything, armed only with a towel and one VERY depressed robot.<\\/p><p>The night begins in a rather unusual pub as you settle in, drink in hand, for an evening of storytelling and spectacle. From there, the story lifts off \\u2013 quite literally \\u2013 as you hitch a ride on a passing spaceship, discover the meaning of life, and join a quest to persuade a group of inter-dimensional mice to give the Earth a second chance.<\\/p><p>Brought to life by an award-winning creative team, and featuring a multi-talented company of actors, this inventive take on Douglas Adams\\u2019 classic draws from the best examples of immersive, musical theatre, dance and magic to deliver a truly out of this world experience and a complete night out.<\\/p><p><i>Warning: Side effects may include sudden existential dread, unexpected hyperspatial detours and a burning desire for a really good cup of tea.<\\/i><\\/p><p><strong>BOOK NOW \\u2013 before the end of the Earth! | Tickets from \\u00a342 | Riverside Studios<\\/strong><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Feeling improbably important? You might be a Person of Galactic Significance. Why not upgrade to a VIP ticket to enjoy:<\\/p><p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Priority entry<\\/p><p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Reserved seating<\\/p><p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1x Pan Galactic Gargle Blaster (choose your level of lucidity: alcoholic or non-alcoholic)*<\\/p><p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1x collectible \\u2018Infinite Improbability Deck\\u2019 of cards<\\/p><p><i>* Or choose from something marginally less mind-altering: beer, house wine, or soft drink.<\\/i><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Accessibility<\\/strong><\\/p><p>For access enquiries\\/bookings, please call our Box Office team directly on <strong>0208 237 1010<\\/strong>, or email <a href=\\\"mailto:boxoffice@old.riversidestudios.co.uk\\\"><strong>boxoffice@old.riversidestudios.co.uk<\\/strong><\\/a> and we will be happy to help with your needs.<\\/p> The Hitchhiker\\u2019s Guide to The Galaxy  Don\\u2019t panic! A new live version of Douglas Adams\\u2019 mind-blowingly imaginative comedy (mis)adventure, The Hitchhiker\\u2019s Guide to The Galaxy, lands at Riverside Studios this November.Join Arthur Dent, Zaphod Beeblebrox, Fenchurch and many more as you escape the destruction of Earth with seconds to spare and begin a search for answers to the mystery of Life, the Universe and Everything, armed only with a towel and one VERY depressed robot.The night begins in a rather unusual pub as you settle in, drink in hand, for an evening of storytelling and spectacle. From there, the story lifts off \\u2013 quite literally \\u2013 as you hitch a ride on a passing spaceship, discover the meaning of life, and join a quest to persuade a group of inter-dimensional mice to give the Earth a second chance.Brought to life by an award-winning creative team, and featuring a multi-talented company of actors, this inventive take on Douglas Adams\\u2019 classic draws from the best examples of immersive, musical theatre, dance and magic to deliver a truly out of this world experience and a complete night out.Warning: Side effects may include sudden existential dread, unexpected hyperspatial detours and a burning desire for a really good cup of tea.BOOK NOW \\u2013 before the end of the Earth! | Tickets from \\u00a342 | Riverside Studios\\u00a0Feeling improbably important? You might be a Person of Galactic Significance. Why not upgrade to a VIP ticket to enjoy:\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Priority entry\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Reserved seating\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 1x Pan Galactic Gargle Blaster (choose your level of lucidity: alcoholic or non-alcoholic)*\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 1x collectible \\u2018Infinite Improbability Deck\\u2019 of cards* Or choose from something marginally less mind-altering: beer, house wine, or soft drink.\\u00a0AccessibilityFor access enquiries\\/bookings, please call our Box Office team directly on 0208 237 1010, or email boxoffice@old.riversidestudios.co.uk and we will be happy to help with your needs. Theatre PG\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/cB-live-next-to-the-apollo\\/\",\"id\":\"463\",\"name\":\"Live Next To The Apollo\",\"title\":\"Live Next To The Apollo\",\"duration\":\"120 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Comedy\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1766448000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"313\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14257\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1766516400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1767139200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"313\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios