0,1778713200,1778799600,1779318000,1779404400,1779922800,1780009200,1780527600,1780614000,1781132400,1781218800,1781737200,1781823600,1782342000,1782428400],\"start_date\":\"1766516400\",\"end_date\":\"1782496800\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"aVdXTHI1ZHBUZTVQZXA3SlI2NnhLQT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Tue 23 Dec 2025 - Fri 26 Jun 2026\",\"text\":\"See the best acts from the circuit at the legendary Riverside Studios before they get their own Netflix special.ABOUTLive Next To The Apollo is a premier&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c6\\/8ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/c68ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c6\\/8ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747\\/w288\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c68ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c6\\/8ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747\\/w288\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c68ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c6\\/8ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747\\/w288\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c68ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c6\\/8ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747\\/w288\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c68ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c6\\/8ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747\\/w288\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c68ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c6\\/8ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747\\/w288\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c68ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c6\\/8ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747\\/w288\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c68ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c6\\/8ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747\\/w288\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c68ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c6\\/8ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747\\/w288\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c68ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c6\\/8ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747\\/w288\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c68ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c6\\/8ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747\\/w288\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c68ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c6\\/8ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747\\/w288\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c68ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c6\\/8ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747\\/w288\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c68ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c6\\/8ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747\\/w288\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/c68ae718af7c2cdca3fe14ae04f8c747.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"See the best acts from the circuit at the legendary Riverside Studios before they get their own Netflix special.ABOUTLive Next To The Apollo is a premier stand-up comedy club which has been packing out it's intimate 100-seater venue at the iconic Riverside Studios since it was founded in 2023 by TV Producer Jonathan Stadlen.\\u00a0Known for its high-quality line-ups, affordable ticket prices, and commitment to supporting comedians via transparent profit share, Live Next To The Apollo has become a staple of the London comedy scene.\\u00a0Each show features a specially selected line-up of the UK\\u2019s best comedians, ready to make you laugh for the price of a pint on a Tuesday and two pints and a packet of crisps on a Friday.\\u00a0Come and see why the show has built a\\u00a0reputation as being a friendly and joyful comedy night with a strong local community audience in West London.\\u00a0\\u00a0Fridays - \\u00a314 including booking and credit card\\u00a0fees\\u00a0Tuesdays - \\u00a38.50 including booking and credit card feesPREVIOUS ACTSSara Pascoe (Taskmaster, Last One Laughing), Stephen K Amos (Live at the Apollo, Have I Got News For You), Marcus Brigstocke (Mock The Week, Have I Got News For You), Jen Brister (Live AT The Apollo, Mock The Week), Ian Stone (Mock The Week, Never Mind the Buzzcocks), Laura Smyth (8 Out of 10 Cats Does Countdown, Live at the Apollo), Desiree Burch (Taskmaster, Live at the Apollo), Nabil Abulrashid (Have I Got News For You, 8 Out of 10 Cats Does Countdown)\\u00a0and Jeff Innocent (British Comedian Of The Year).\\u00a0REVIEWSAwesome comedy club! Great bill of curated comedians and a packed out,\\u00a0up for it audience!\\u00a0 \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50 James W, June 2025A comedy show that feels like comedy home & line-ups packed with top-class comedians delivering laugh after laugh after laugh!!\\u00a0 The atmosphere is always friendly, welcoming and simultaneously electric.\\u00a0Get yourself a ticket, it\\u2019s cheaper than a pint... Your future self will thank you!!\\u00a0 \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u00a0Emma, June 2025Was not at all happy, my wife said afterwards that Jonathan the MC is handsome and funny, two things she's never said about me. The comedy is always EXCELLENT though, so I'll go by myself in future.\\u00a0 \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50 S May, 2025\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"313\"],\"search\":\"Live Next To The Apollo Live Next To The Apollo Comedy  <h3><strong>See the best acts from the circuit at the legendary Riverside Studios before they get their own Netflix special.<\\/strong><\\/h3><p><strong>ABOUT<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Live Next To The Apollo is a premier stand-up comedy club which has been packing out it's intimate 100-seater venue at the iconic Riverside Studios since it was founded in 2023 by TV Producer Jonathan Stadlen.&nbsp;Known for its high-quality line-ups, affordable ticket prices, and commitment to supporting comedians via transparent profit share, Live Next To The Apollo has become a staple of the London comedy scene.&nbsp;Each show features a specially selected line-up of the UK\\u2019s best comedians, ready to make you laugh for the price of a pint on a Tuesday and two pints and a packet of crisps on a Friday.&nbsp;Come and see why the show has built a&nbsp;reputation as being a friendly and joyful comedy night with a strong local community audience in West London.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Fridays - \\u00a314 including booking and credit card&nbsp;fees&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p><i><strong>Tuesdays - \\u00a38.50 including booking and credit card fees<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p><br><strong>PREVIOUS ACTS<\\/strong><br><strong>Sara Pascoe<\\/strong> (Taskmaster, Last One Laughing), <strong>Stephen K Amos<\\/strong> (Live at the Apollo, Have I Got News For You), <strong>Marcus Brigstocke<\\/strong> (Mock The Week, Have I Got News For You), <strong>Jen Brister<\\/strong> (Live AT The Apollo, Mock The Week), <strong>Ian Stone<\\/strong> (Mock The Week, Never Mind the Buzzcocks), <strong>Laura Smyth<\\/strong> (8 Out of 10 Cats Does Countdown, Live at the Apollo), <strong>Desiree Burch<\\/strong> (Taskmaster, Live at the Apollo), <strong>Nabil Abulrashid<\\/strong> (Have I Got News For You, 8 Out of 10 Cats Does Countdown)&nbsp;and <strong>Jeff Innocent<\\/strong> (British Comedian Of The Year).&nbsp;<\\/p><p><br><strong>REVIEWS<\\/strong><br><i>Awesome comedy club! Great bill of curated comedians and a packed out,&nbsp;up for it audience!&nbsp;<\\/i> \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50 James W, June 2025<br><br><i>A comedy show that feels like comedy home &amp; line-ups packed with top-class comedians delivering laugh after laugh after laugh!!&nbsp; The atmosphere is always friendly, welcoming and simultaneously electric.&nbsp;Get yourself a ticket, it\\u2019s cheaper than a pint... Your future self will thank you!!<\\/i>&nbsp; \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50&nbsp;Emma, June 2025<br><br><i>Was not at all happy, my wife said afterwards that Jonathan the MC is handsome and funny, two things she's never said about me. The comedy is always EXCELLENT though, so I'll go by myself in future.&nbsp;<\\/i> \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50 S May, 2025<\\/p> Live Next To The Apollo  See the best acts from the circuit at the legendary Riverside Studios before they get their own Netflix special.ABOUTLive Next To The Apollo is a premier stand-up comedy club which has been packing out it's intimate 100-seater venue at the iconic Riverside Studios since it was founded in 2023 by TV Producer Jonathan Stadlen.\\u00a0Known for its high-quality line-ups, affordable ticket prices, and commitment to supporting comedians via transparent profit share, Live Next To The Apollo has become a staple of the London comedy scene.\\u00a0Each show features a specially selected line-up of the UK\\u2019s best comedians, ready to make you laugh for the price of a pint on a Tuesday and two pints and a packet of crisps on a Friday.\\u00a0Come and see why the show has built a\\u00a0reputation as being a friendly and joyful comedy night with a strong local community audience in West London.\\u00a0\\u00a0Fridays - \\u00a314 including booking and credit card\\u00a0fees\\u00a0Tuesdays - \\u00a38.50 including booking and credit card feesPREVIOUS ACTSSara Pascoe (Taskmaster, Last One Laughing), Stephen K Amos (Live at the Apollo, Have I Got News For You), Marcus Brigstocke (Mock The Week, Have I Got News For You), Jen Brister (Live AT The Apollo, Mock The Week), Ian Stone (Mock The Week, Never Mind the Buzzcocks), Laura Smyth (8 Out of 10 Cats Does Countdown, Live at the Apollo), Desiree Burch (Taskmaster, Live at the Apollo), Nabil Abulrashid (Have I Got News For You, 8 Out of 10 Cats Does Countdown)\\u00a0and Jeff Innocent (British Comedian Of The Year).\\u00a0REVIEWSAwesome comedy club! Great bill of curated comedians and a packed out,\\u00a0up for it audience!\\u00a0 \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50 James W, June 2025A comedy show that feels like comedy home & line-ups packed with top-class comedians delivering laugh after laugh after laugh!!\\u00a0 The atmosphere is always friendly, welcoming and simultaneously electric.\\u00a0Get yourself a ticket, it\\u2019s cheaper than a pint... Your future self will thank you!!\\u00a0 \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u00a0Emma, June 2025Was not at all happy, my wife said afterwards that Jonathan the MC is handsome and funny, two things she's never said about me. The comedy is always EXCELLENT though, so I'll go by myself in future.\\u00a0 \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50 S May, 2025 Comedy\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/NO-sentimental-value\\/\",\"id\":\"694\",\"name\":\"Sentimental Value\",\"title\":\"Sentimental Value\",\"duration\":\"133 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Cinema\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1766793600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"101\",\"81000\",\"80879\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/43201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">11:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1766835900\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[\"101\",\"81000\",\"80879\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/43401\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">17:40<\\/div>\\n    