026\",\"text\":\"Whether you're brand new to yoga or a seasoned practitioner, this class is for you!&nbsp; Join us to move, breath and connect with fellow local yogis.&nbsp;&nbsp;The&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Whether you're brand new to yoga or a seasoned practitioner, this class is for you!\\u00a0 Join us to move, breath and connect with fellow local yogis.\\u00a0\\u00a0The class will help you build strength and flexibility while creating space for your mind to quieten.\\u00a0 Expect to leave feeling revitalised, energised and filled with a sense of possibility.Please bring your own mat if you can.\\u00a0 A limited number are available to borrow at Riverside Studios.\\u00a0 This class can also be done using a chair for support.\\u00a0Your teacher will be from Lumi Foundation with proceeds from the class going towards raising funds for Lumi Foundation.\\u00a0 Thank you for helping us bring yoga to all!\\u00a0About Lumi FoundationLumi Foundation is an award-winning charity with a simple belief - yoga is for everyone!Founded in 2017, we offer classes to a wide and varied audience. We work with adults and children with disabilities, elderly groups, refugees, those in recovery from addiction, survivors of domestic abuse, low-income communities and individuals undergoing cancer treatment.Our teachers are highly qualified and able to adapt classes to suit the needs of different groups. Typical classes blend mat and chair\\u2011based practices, focusing on movement, breathwork and meditation.Most importantly, these classes are also a way for people to come together and practice as a community.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"72\",\"59\"],\"search\":\"Yoga for all from Lumi Foundation Yoga for all from Lumi Foundation Wellness  <p>Whether you're brand new to yoga or a seasoned practitioner, this class is for you!&nbsp; Join us to move, breath and connect with fellow local yogis.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p><p>The class will help you build strength and flexibility while creating space for your mind to quieten.&nbsp; Expect to leave feeling revitalised, energised and filled with a sense of possibility.<\\/p><p>Please bring your own mat if you can.&nbsp; A limited number are available to borrow at Riverside Studios.&nbsp; This class can also be done using a chair for support.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Your teacher will be from <strong>Lumi Foundation<\\/strong> with proceeds from the class going towards raising funds for Lumi Foundation.&nbsp; Thank you for helping us bring yoga to all!<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>About Lumi Foundation<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Lumi Foundation is an award-winning charity with a simple belief - yoga is for everyone!<\\/p><p>Founded in 2017, we offer classes to a wide and varied audience. We work with adults and children with disabilities, elderly groups, refugees, those in recovery from addiction, survivors of domestic abuse, low-income communities and individuals undergoing cancer treatment.<\\/p><p>Our teachers are highly qualified and able to adapt classes to suit the needs of different groups. Typical classes blend mat and chair\\u2011based practices, focusing on movement, breathwork and meditation.<\\/p><p>Most importantly, these classes are also a way for people to come together and practice as a community.<\\/p> Not-For-Profit Yoga,Yoga for all from Lumi Foundation  Whether you're brand new to yoga or a seasoned practitioner, this class is for you!\\u00a0 Join us to move, breath and connect with fellow local yogis.\\u00a0\\u00a0The class will help you build strength and flexibility while creating space for your mind to quieten.\\u00a0 Expect to leave feeling revitalised, energised and filled with a sense of possibility.Please bring your own mat if you can.\\u00a0 A limited number are available to borrow at Riverside Studios.\\u00a0 This class can also be done using a chair for support.\\u00a0Your teacher will be from Lumi Foundation with proceeds from the class going towards raising funds for Lumi Foundation.\\u00a0 Thank you for helping us bring yoga to all!\\u00a0About Lumi FoundationLumi Foundation is an award-winning charity with a simple belief - yoga is for everyone!Founded in 2017, we offer classes to a wide and varied audience. We work with adults and children with disabilities, elderly groups, refugees, those in recovery from addiction, survivors of domestic abuse, low-income communities and individuals undergoing cancer treatment.Our teachers are highly qualified and able to adapt classes to suit the needs of different groups. Typical classes blend mat and chair\\u2011based practices, focusing on movement, breathwork and meditation.Most importantly, these classes are also a way for people to come together and practice as a community. Workshops & Classes Wellness\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/bO-monkeyface\\/\",\"id\":\"632\",\"name\":\"Monkeyface\",\"title\":\"Monkeyface\",\"duration\":\"70 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Theatre\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1767830400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14563\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1767899700\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1768003200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14625\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768072500\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1767830400,1768003200],\"start_date\":\"1767899700\",\"end_date\":\"1768072500\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"L0tjR0VrcXd3bjlCTDg5end4NXQvQT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Thu 8 - Sat 10 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Trapped within the four walls of a university bedroom, our title character navigates the euphoric highs and crushing lows of Freshers week, toxic friendships,&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/57\\/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx110\\/cy13\\/cw414\\/ch414\\/images\\/uploads\\/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.jpeg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/57\\/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e\\/w640\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx110\\/cy13\\/cw414\\/ch414\\/images\\/uploads\\/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/57\\/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e\\/w640\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx110\\/cy13\\/cw414\\/ch414\\/images\\/uploads\\/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/57\\/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e\\/w640\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx110\\/cy13\\/cw414\\/ch414\\/images\\/uploads\\/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/57\\/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e\\/w640\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx110\\/cy13\\/cw414\\/ch414\\/images\\/uploads\\/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/57\\/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e\\/w640\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx110\\/cy13\\/cw414\\/ch414\\/images\\/uploads\\/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/57\\/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e\\/w640\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx110\\/cy13\\/cw414\\/ch414\\/images\\/uploads\\/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/57\\/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e\\/w640\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx110\\/cy13\\/cw414\\/ch414\\/images\\/uploads\\/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/57\\/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e\\/w640\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx110\\/cy13\\/cw414\\/ch414\\/images\\/uploads\\/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/57\\/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e\\/w640\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx110\\/cy13\\/cw414\\/ch414\\/images\\/uploads\\/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/57\\/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e\\/w640\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx110\\/cy13\\/cw414\\/ch414\\/images\\/uploads\\/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/57\\/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e\\/w640\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx110\\/cy13\\/cw414\\/ch414\\/images\\/uploads\\/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/57\\/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e\\/w640\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx110\\/cy13\\/cw414\\/ch414\\/images\\/uploads\\/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/57\\/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e\\/w640\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx110\\/cy13\\/cw414\\/ch414\\/images\\/uploads\\/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/57\\/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e\\/w640\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx110\\/cy13\\/cw414\\/ch414\\/images\\/uploads\\/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Trapped within the four walls of a university bedroom, our title character navigates the euphoric highs and crushing lows of Freshers week, toxic friendships, club culture, and the aching need for connection.\\u00a0Monkeyface is the bold, debut play by writer-performer Raphael Phillips, that journeys through the themes of racism, mental health, and loneliness.\\u00a0\\u00a0Content warnings\\u00a0This show contains strong language and references to drug use, as well as themes of mental health, racism, and sexual content throughout.\\u00a0People under the age of 16 are not permitted for this show.\\u00a0Latecomers will not be admitted for this show.\\u00a0Director - Mojola AkinyemiStage Manager & Lighting Designer: Jessica SpellerSound Designer: Joe HarringtonProducer: Emmanuel Akwafo\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"3\"],\"search\":\"Monkeyface Monkeyface Theatre  <p>Trapped within the four walls of a university bedroom, our title character navigates the euphoric highs and crushing lows of Freshers week, toxic friendships, club culture, and the aching need for connection.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Monkeyface <\\/strong><\\/i>is the bold, debut play by writer-performer Raphael Phillips, that journeys through the themes of racism, mental health, and loneliness.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Content warnings&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p><p>This show contains strong language and references to drug use, as well as themes of mental health, racism, and sexual content throughout.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>People under the age of 16 are not permitted for this show.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Latecomers will not be admitted for this show.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><br><strong>Director<\\/strong> - Mojola Akinyemi<br><br><strong>Stage Manager &amp; Lighting Designer<\\/strong>: Jessica Speller<br><br><strong>Sound Designer: <\\/strong>Joe Harrington<br><br><strong>Producer: <\\/strong>Emmanuel Akwafo<\\/p> Monkeyface  Trapped within the four walls of a university bedroom, our title character navigates the euphoric highs and crushing lows of Freshers week, toxic friendships, club culture, and the aching need for connection.\\u00a0Monkeyface is the bold, debut play by writer-performer Raphael Phillips, that journeys through the themes of racism, mental health, and loneliness.\\u00a0\\u00a0Content warnings\\u00a0This show contains strong language and references to drug use, as well as themes of mental health, racism, and sexual content throughout.\\u00a0People under the age of 16 are not permitted for this show.\\u00a0Latecomers will not be admitted for this show.\\u00a0Director - Mojola AkinyemiStage Manager & Lighting Designer: Jessica SpellerSound Designer: Joe HarringtonProducer: Emmanuel Akwafo Theatre\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/9f-third-age-on-stage-acting-workshops-for-the-over-50s\\/\",\"id\":\"922\",\"name\":\"Third Age on Stage: Acting Workshops for the Over 50s\",\"title\":\"Third Age on Stage: Acting Workshops for the Over 50s\",\"duration\":\"120 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Workshops & Classes\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1767916800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/33601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <d