03\\/images\\/uploads\\/77527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/77\\/527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f\\/w1337\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx736\\/cw601\\/ch603\\/images\\/uploads\\/77527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/77\\/527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f\\/w1337\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx736\\/cw601\\/ch603\\/images\\/uploads\\/77527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/77\\/527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f\\/w1337\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx736\\/cw601\\/ch603\\/images\\/uploads\\/77527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/77\\/527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx736\\/cw601\\/ch603\\/images\\/uploads\\/77527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/77\\/527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx736\\/cw601\\/ch603\\/images\\/uploads\\/77527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/77\\/527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f\\/w1337\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx736\\/cw601\\/ch603\\/images\\/uploads\\/77527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/77\\/527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f\\/w1337\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx736\\/cw601\\/ch603\\/images\\/uploads\\/77527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/77\\/527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f\\/w1337\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx736\\/cw601\\/ch603\\/images\\/uploads\\/77527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/77\\/527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f\\/w1337\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx736\\/cw601\\/ch603\\/images\\/uploads\\/77527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/77\\/527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f\\/w1337\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx736\\/cw601\\/ch603\\/images\\/uploads\\/77527ed9fb5946f324f18b5b32419c4f.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Step into the world of ballroom with DanceWest \\u2013 a joyful way to boost fitness and support wellbeing.\\u00a0Why join in?\\u2013 Learn iconic styles like the waltz, tango and cha-cha \\u2013 no partner needed\\u2013 Get active, build confidence, and boost coordination\\u2013 Enjoy expert-led sessions in a relaxed, social settingWhether you\\u2019re stepping onto the dance floor for the first time or simply curious to give it a go, this is your moment. Come as you are and leave energised.\\u00a0DanceWest & Riverside Studios \\u2013 Ballroom ClassesDay: SaturdaysTime: 12.00\\u201313.00Dates: Saturday 27 September \\u2013 Saturday 6 December 2025Ages: Open to adults aged 18+ \\u2013 we're expanding this to welcome a wider audience on Saturday mornings.Suggested Fee Structure:Drop-in rate: \\u00a312 per class (payable on the day)Half-term block (5 weeks): \\u00a355 (\\u00a311.00 per class)Full-term block (10 weeks): \\u00a395 (\\u00a39.50 per class)Concession rate (drop-in): \\u00a310 per class\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"72\"],\"search\":\"Ballroom Dancing Ballroom Dancing Workshops & Classes  <p>Step into the world of ballroom with DanceWest \\u2013 a joyful way to boost fitness and support wellbeing.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Why join in?<\\/strong><br>\\u2013 Learn iconic styles like the waltz, tango and cha-cha \\u2013 no partner needed<br>\\u2013 Get active, build confidence, and boost coordination<br>\\u2013 Enjoy expert-led sessions in a relaxed, social setting<\\/p><p>Whether you\\u2019re stepping onto the dance floor for the first time or simply curious to give it a go, this is your moment. Come as you are and leave energised.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>DanceWest &amp; Riverside Studios \\u2013 Ballroom Classes<\\/strong><br><strong>Day:<\\/strong> Saturdays<br><strong>Time:<\\/strong> 12.00\\u201313.00<br><strong>Dates:<\\/strong> Saturday 27 September \\u2013 Saturday 6 December 2025<br><strong>Ages:<\\/strong> Open to adults aged 18+ \\u2013 we're expanding this to welcome a wider audience on Saturday mornings.<\\/p><p><strong>Suggested Fee Structure:<\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li><strong>Drop-in rate:<\\/strong> \\u00a312 per class (payable on the day)<\\/li><li><strong>Half-term block (5 weeks):<\\/strong> \\u00a355 (\\u00a311.00 per class)<\\/li><li><strong>Full-term block (10 weeks):<\\/strong> \\u00a395 (\\u00a39.50 per class)<\\/li><li><strong>Concession rate (drop-in):<\\/strong> \\u00a310 per class<br>&nbsp;<\\/li><\\/ul> Ballroom Dancing  Step into the world of ballroom with DanceWest \\u2013 a joyful way to boost fitness and support wellbeing.\\u00a0Why join in?\\u2013 Learn iconic styles like the waltz, tango and cha-cha \\u2013 no partner needed\\u2013 Get active, build confidence, and boost coordination\\u2013 Enjoy expert-led sessions in a relaxed, social settingWhether you\\u2019re stepping onto the dance floor for the first time or simply curious to give it a go, this is your moment. Come as you are and leave energised.\\u00a0DanceWest & Riverside Studios \\u2013 Ballroom ClassesDay: SaturdaysTime: 12.00\\u201313.00Dates: Saturday 27 September \\u2013 Saturday 6 December 2025Ages: Open to adults aged 18+ \\u2013 we're expanding this to welcome a wider audience on Saturday mornings.Suggested Fee Structure:Drop-in rate: \\u00a312 per class (payable on the day)Half-term block (5 weeks): \\u00a355 (\\u00a311.00 per class)Full-term block (10 weeks): \\u00a395 (\\u00a39.50 per class)Concession rate (drop-in): \\u00a310 per class\\u00a0 Workshops & Classes\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/1k-kill-bill-the-whole-bloody-affair\\/\",\"id\":\"597\",\"name\":\"Kill Bill: The Whole Bloody Affair\",\"title\":\"Kill Bill: The Whole Bloody Affair\",\"d