o.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b3\\/96fb3869d6cca05c3b5ad90eafe25f\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx869\\/cy13\\/cw1049\\/ch1045\\/images\\/uploads\\/b396fb3869d6cca05c3b5ad90eafe25f.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b3\\/96fb3869d6cca05c3b5ad90eafe25f\\/w1920\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx869\\/cy13\\/cw1049\\/ch1045\\/images\\/uploads\\/b396fb3869d6cca05c3b5ad90eafe25f.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b3\\/96fb3869d6cca05c3b5ad90eafe25f\\/w1920\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx869\\/cy13\\/cw1049\\/ch1045\\/images\\/uploads\\/b396fb3869d6cca05c3b5ad90eafe25f.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"For our Quentin Tarantino Weekender on 10-11 January you can enjoy 20% off the adult price if you buy a ticket for ONE UPON A TIME IN HOLLYWOOD + Q&A on 10 Jan and a ticket to one of the KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR screenings on the same weekend!Get ready to return to the grindhouse \\u2014 Lionsgate is bringing Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s legendary revenge saga back to the big screen with KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR.For the first time, experience Volumes 1 & 2 seamlessly united in one epic cinematic event \\u2014 featuring a never-before-seen scene that makes this the ultimate Tarantino cut.\\u00a0Includes a 15 minute intermission.\",\"book_link\":false,\"accessibility\":[\"80879\"],\"event_age_ratings\":[\"80998\"],\"event_type\":[\"101\"],\"search\":\"Kill Bill: The Whole Bloody Affair Kill Bill: The Whole Bloody Affair Cinema  <h3><strong>For our Quentin Tarantino Weekender on 10-11 January you can enjoy 20% off the adult price if you buy a ticket for ONE UPON A TIME IN HOLLYWOOD + Q&amp;A on 10 Jan and a ticket to one of the KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR screenings on the same weekend!<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>Get ready to return to the grindhouse \\u2014 Lionsgate is bringing Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s legendary revenge saga back to the big screen with <i><strong>KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR<\\/strong><\\/i>.<\\/p><p>For the first time, experience <strong>Volumes 1 &amp; 2 <\\/strong>seamlessly united in one epic cinematic event \\u2014 featuring a never-before-seen scene that makes this the ultimate Tarantino cut.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Includes a 15 minute intermission.<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p> Kill Bill: The Whole Bloody Affair  For our Quentin Tarantino Weekender on 10-11 January you can enjoy 20% off the adult price if you buy a ticket for ONE UPON A TIME IN HOLLYWOOD + Q&A on 10 Jan and a ticket to one of the KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR screenings on the same weekend!Get ready to return to the grindhouse \\u2014 Lionsgate is bringing Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s legendary revenge saga back to the big screen with KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR.For the first time, experience Volumes 1 & 2 seamlessly united in one epic cinematic event \\u2014 featuring a never-before-seen scene that makes this the ultimate Tarantino cut.\\u00a0Includes a 15 minute intermission. Audio Described 18 Cinema\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/NZ-sound-bath-total-relaxation\\/\",\"id\":\"699\",\"name\":\"Sound Bath: Total Relaxation\",\"title\":\"Sound Bath: Total Relaxation\",\"duration\":\"70 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Wellness\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768003200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"59\",\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/23002\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">15:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768057200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[\"59\",\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14610\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">16:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768062600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768003200,1768003200],\"start_date\":\"1768057200\",\"end_date\":\"1768062600\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"M0pRRWhHM3MzWU5zdlhITnhXa2lCQT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 10 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Indulge in the ultimate relaxation experience at our upcoming 70min Sound Bath!Immerse yourself in a peaceful atmosphere where the soothing sounds of&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/8b\\/4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx545\\/cy231\\/cw1976\\/ch1972\\/images\\/uploads\\/8b4220cb71ca091697272f7fe4f0def2.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Indulge in the ultimate relaxation experience at our upcoming 70min Sound Bath!Immerse yourself in a peaceful atmosphere where the soothing sounds of singing bowls, drums, and chimes will wash over you.\\u00a0As the harmonic vibrations resonate through your body, stress and tension will melt away, leaving you with a profound sense of calm and inner balance.\\u00a0\\u00a0No prior experience is required.\\u00a0This event is capped at 20 people and we have 12 yoga mats available on site to borrow. Therefore, participants should ideally:bring their own yoga matwear comfortable and warm clothesbring a blanket\\u00a0Please note: this event is NOT suitable if you're pregnant (first trimester), experience epilepsy, severe heart conditions or severe mental disorder (i.e.\\u00a0schizophrenia).\\u00a0BioConsuelo Cogrossi is an Holistic Wellbeing Expert who helps people managing the early signs of anxiety with confidence and ease.\\u00a0As a working mum who recovered from an eating disorder and postnatal anxiety, she understands the struggle of mentally counting calories\\u00a0while perusing restaurant menus and the exhaustion of a never-ending to do list brimming of responsibilities.Consuelo blends the best modalities from the Wellbeing industry - including yoga, meditation, sound healing, breathwork and plant medicine through Cacao Ceremonies - to offer you an holistic approach to Wellbeing. These practices are designed to help you release tension in your body, enhance your vitality and sharpen your mental clarity. With Consuelo's guidance\\u00a0you'll learn the tools to confidently navigate the demands of modern life, so you can feel more balanced and energised.\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"72\",\"59\"],\"search\":\"Sound Bath: Total Relaxation Sound Bath: Total Relaxation Wellness  <h2>Indulge in the ultimate relaxation experience at our upcoming 70min Sound Bath!<\\/h2><p>Immerse yourself in a peaceful atmosphere where the soothing sounds of singing bowls, drums, and chimes will wash over you.&nbsp;As the harmonic vibrations resonate through your body, stress and tension will melt away, leaving you with a profound sense of calm and inner balance.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>No prior experience is required.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>This event is capped at 20 people and we have <strong>12 yoga mats<\\/strong> available on site to borrow. Therefore, participants should ideally:<\\/p><ul><li>bring their own yoga mat<\\/li><li>wear comfortable and warm clothes<\\/li><li>bring a blanket<\\/li><\\/ul><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Please note: this event is NOT suitable if you're pregnant (first trimester), experience epilepsy, severe heart conditions or severe mental disorder (i.e.&nbsp;schizophrenia).<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Bio<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Consuelo Cogrossi is an Holistic Wellbeing Expert who helps people managing the early signs of anxiety with confidence and ease.&nbsp;As a working mum who recovered from an eating disorder and postnatal anxiety, she understands the struggle of mentally counting calories&nbsp;while perusing restaurant menus and the exhaustion of a never-ending to do list brimming of responsibilities.<\\/p><p>Consuelo blends the best modalities from the Wellbeing industry - including yoga, meditation, sound healing, breathwork and plant medicine through Cacao Ceremonies - to offer you an holistic approach to Wellbeing. These practices are designed to help you release tension in your body, enhance your vitality and sharpen your mental clarity. With Consuelo's guidance&nbsp;you'll learn the tools to confidently navigate the demands of modern life, so you can feel more balanced and energised.&nbsp;<\\/p> Sound Bath: Total Relaxation  Indulge in the ultimate relaxation experience at our upcoming 70min Sound Bath!Immerse yourself in a peaceful atmosphere where the soothing sounds of singing bowls, drums, and chimes will wash over you.\\u00a0As the harmonic vibrations resonate through your body, stress and tension will melt away, leaving you with a profound sense of calm and inner balance.\\u00a0\\u00a0No prior experience is required.\\u00a0This event is capped at 20 people and we have 12 yoga mats available on site to borrow. Therefore, participants should ideally:bring their own yoga matwear comfortable and warm clothesbring a blanket\\u00a0Please note: this event is NOT suitable if you're pregnant (first trimester), experience epilepsy, severe heart conditions or severe mental disorder (i.e.\\u00a0schizophrenia).\\u00a0BioConsuelo Cogrossi is an Holistic Wellbeing Expert who helps people managing the early signs of anxiety with confidence and ease.\\u00a0As a working mum who recovered from an eating disorder and postnatal anxiety, she understands the struggle of mentally counting calories\\u00a0while perusing restaurant menus and the exhaustion of a never-ending to do list brimming of responsibilities.Consuelo blends the best modalities from the Wellbeing industry - including yoga, meditation, sound healing, breathwork and plant medicine through Cacao Ceremonies - to offer you an holistic approach to Wellbeing. These practices are designed to help you release tension in your body, enhance your vitality and sharpen your mental clarity. With Consuelo's guidance\\u00a0you'll learn the tools to confidently navigate the demands of modern life, so you can feel more balanced and energised.\\u00a0 Workshops & Classes Wellness\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/bJ-once-upon-a-time-in-hollywood-qa\\/\",\"id\":\"644\",\"name\":\"Once Upon a Time in Hollywood + Q&A\",\"title\":\"Once Upon a Time in Hollywood + Q&A\",\"duration\":\"155 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Cinema\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768003200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"101\",\"80998\",\"80879\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14615\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">17:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768064400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768003200],\"start_date\":\"1768064400\",\"end_date\":\"1768064400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"18\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"d3BYcHZUbnBnNC9DMUhwWW1MWG9LQT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 10 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"We are delighted to welcome author Jay Glennie to Riverside to discuss his new book - The Making of Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s Once Upon a Time in Hollywood&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"We are delighted to welcome author Jay Glennie to Riverside to discuss his new book - The Making of Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s Once Upon a Time in Hollywood - following a screening of the acclaimed film from director Quentin Tarantino. Copies of the book will be available in the cinema foyer during the event.For our Quentin Tarantino Weekender on 10-11 January you can enjoy 20% off the adult price if you buy a ticket for ONE UPON A TIME IN HOLLYWOOD + Q&A \\u00a0on 10 Jan and a ticket to one of the KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR screenings on the same weekend!\\u00a0The Making of Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s Once Upon a Time in Hollywood by JAY GLENNIE, OUT NOW FROM TITAN BOOKSFor the first time ever Academy Award-winning filmmaker Quentin Tarantino has granted renowned and respected journalist and author Jay Glennie (One Shot: The Making of Deer Hunter, Raging Bull: The Making of) unique access revealing the never-before-told behind-the-scenes making of one of the most iconic films of all time, Once Upon a Time... in Hollywood.Jay Glennie brings his expertise, experience, and incisive writing to this unique volume, pulling back the curtain on the visionary writer\\/director\\/producer\\u2019s ninth film, with unprecedented access to the filmmaker, cast, and crew. This epic tome is a stunning and faithful deep dive into the mind of a masterful auteur and a must-have book for all film lovers and Quentin Tarantino fans.\\u00a0Quentin Tarantino personally introduces the volume, as well as providing hundreds of behind-the-scenes photographs, along with production memos, concept art, and costume and production design sketches. There are also exclusive reproductions of letters, studio documents and film ephemera. The result is an official record of how it was achieved, from inception to the world premiere and on to ten Academy Award nominations, resulting in two Oscars.The book includes new and exclusive interviews undertaken by Jay Glennie with key cast and crew members, including Oscar winning actors Leonardo DiCaprio and Brad Pitt, Oscar nominee Margot Robbie, and the brilliant supporting cast including Oscar winner Mikey Madison, Margaret Qualley, Oscar nominee Austin Butler, Lena Dunham, Kurt Russell, Dakota Fanning, Emile Hirsch, Damian Lewis, Maya Hawke, and Sydney Sweeney.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14615\\/\",\"accessibility\":[\"80879\"],\"event_age_ratings\":[\"80998\"],\"event_type\":[\"101\"],\"search\":\"Once Upon a Time in Hollywood + Q&A Once Upon a Time in Hollywood + Q&A Cinema  <p><strong>We are delighted to welcome author Jay Glennie to Riverside to discuss his new book - The Making of Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s Once Upon a Time in Hollywood - following a screening of the acclaimed film from director Quentin Tarantino. Copies of the book will be available in the cinema foyer during the event.<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>For our Quentin Tarantino Weekender on 10-11 January you can enjoy 20% off the adult price if you buy a ticket for ONE UPON A TIME IN HOLLYWOOD + Q&amp;A &nbsp;on 10 Jan and a ticket to one of the KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR screenings on the same weekend!<\\/strong><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>The Making of Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s Once Upon a Time in Hollywood<\\/strong><\\/i> by JAY GLENNIE, OUT NOW FROM <strong>TITAN BOOKS<\\/strong><\\/p><p>For the first time ever Academy Award-winning filmmaker Quentin Tarantino has granted renowned and respected journalist and author Jay Glennie (<i>One Shot: The Making of Deer Hunter<\\/i>, <i>Raging Bull: The Making of<\\/i>) unique access revealing the never-before-told behind-the-scenes making of one of the most iconic films of all time, Once Upon a Time... in Hollywood.<\\/p><p>Jay Glennie brings his expertise, experience, and incisive writing to this unique volume, pulling back the curtain on the visionary writer\\/director\\/producer\\u2019s ninth film, with unprecedented access to the filmmaker, cast, and crew. This epic tome is a stunning and faithful deep dive into the mind of a masterful auteur and a must-have book for all film lovers and Quentin Tarantino fans.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Quentin Tarantino personally introduces the volume, as well as providing hundreds of behind-the-scenes photographs, along with production memos, concept art, and costume and production design sketches. There are also exclusive reproductions of letters, studio documents and film ephemera. The result is an official record of how it was achieved, from inception to the world premiere and on to ten Academy Award nominations, resulting in two Oscars.<\\/p><p>The book includes new and exclusive interviews undertaken by Jay Glennie with key cast and crew members, including Oscar winning actors Leonardo DiCaprio and Brad Pitt, Oscar nominee Margot Robbie, and the brilliant supporting cast including Oscar winner Mikey Madison, Margaret Qualley, Oscar nominee Austin Butler, Lena Dunham, Kurt Russell, Dakota Fanning, Emile Hirsch, Damian Lewis, Maya Hawke, and Sydney Sweeney.<\\/p> Once Upon a Time in Hollywood + Q&A  We are delighted to welcome author Jay Glennie to Riverside to discuss his new book - The Making of Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s Once Upon a Time in Hollywood - following a screening of the acclaimed film from director Quentin Tarantino. Copies of the book will be available in the cinema foyer during the event.For our Quentin Tarantino Weekender on 10-11 January you can enjoy 20% off the adult price if you buy a ticket for ONE UPON A TIME IN HOLLYWOOD + Q&A \\u00a0on 10 Jan and a ticket to one of the KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR screenings on the same weekend!\\u00a0The Making of Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s Once Upon a Time in Hollywood by JAY GLENNIE, OUT NOW FROM TITAN BOOKSFor the first time ever Academy Award-winning filmmaker Quentin Tarantino has granted renowned and respected journalist and author Jay Glennie (One Shot: The Making of Deer Hunter, Raging Bull: The Making of) unique access revealing the never-before-told behind-the-scenes making of one of the most iconic films of all time, Once Upon a Time... in Hollywood.Jay Glennie brings his expertise, experience, and incisive writing to this unique volume, pulling back the curtain on the visionary writer\\/director\\/producer\\u2019s ninth film, with unprecedented access to the filmmaker, cast, and crew. This epic tome is a stunning and faithful deep dive into the mind of a masterful auteur and a must-have book for all film lovers and Quentin Tarantino fans.\\u00a0Quentin Tarantino personally introduces the volume, as well as providing hundreds of behind-the-scenes photographs, along with production memos, concept art, and costume and production design sketches. There are also exclusive reproductions of letters, studio documents and film ephemera. The result is an official record of how it was achieved, from inception to the world premiere and on to ten Academy Award nominations, resulting in two Oscars.The book includes new and exclusive interviews undertaken by Jay Glennie with key cast and crew members, including Oscar winning actors Leonardo DiCaprio and Brad Pitt, Oscar nominee Margot Robbie, and the brilliant supporting cast including Oscar winner Mikey Madison, Margaret Qualley, Oscar nominee Austin Butler, Lena Dunham, Kurt Russell, Dakota Fanning, Emile Hirsch, Damian Lewis, Maya Hawke, and Sydney Sweeney. Audio Described 18 Cinema\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/tg-fight-performance-for-theatre\\/\",\"id\":\"1007\",\"name\":\"Fight Performance for Theatre\",\"title\":\"Fight Performance for Theatre\",\"duration\":\"90 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Workshops & Classes\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768089600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/33401\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">13:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768136400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768089600],\"start_date\":\"1768136400\",\"end_date\":\"1768136400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"RXQ1RWZWWWFIZnNBcGVSUkR5OE5qZz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sun 11 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Led by Lucy WordsworthJoin Lucy for a dynamic and engaging introduction to Basic Unarmed Stage Combat, perfect for performers of all levels. This workshop&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/85\\/2de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx478\\/cy7\\/cw587\\/ch588\\/images\\/uploads\\/852de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/85\\/2de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx478\\/cy7\\/cw587\\/ch588\\/images\\/uploads\\/852de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/85\\/2de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx478\\/cy7\\/cw587\\/ch588\\/images\\/uploads\\/852de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/85\\/2de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx478\\/cy7\\/cw587\\/ch588\\/images\\/uploads\\/852de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/85\\/2de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx478\\/cy7\\/cw587\\/ch588\\/images\\/uploads\\/852de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/85\\/2de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx478\\/cy7\\/cw587\\/ch588\\/images\\/uploads\\/852de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/85\\/2de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx478\\/cy7\\/cw587\\/ch588\\/images\\/uploads\\/852de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/85\\/2de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx478\\/cy7\\/cw587\\/ch588\\/images\\/uploads\\/852de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/85\\/2de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx478\\/cy7\\/cw587\\/ch588\\/images\\/uploads\\/852de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/85\\/2de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx478\\/cy7\\/cw587\\/ch588\\/images\\/uploads\\/852de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/85\\/2de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx478\\/cy7\\/cw587\\/ch588\\/images\\/uploads\\/852de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/85\\/2de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx478\\/cy7\\/cw587\\/ch588\\/images\\/uploads\\/852de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/85\\/2de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx478\\/cy7\\/cw587\\/ch588\\/images\\/uploads\\/852de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/85\\/2de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx478\\/cy7\\/cw587\\/ch588\\/images\\/uploads\\/852de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/85\\/2de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx478\\/cy7\\/cw587\\/ch588\\/images\\/uploads\\/852de5423c597bd0ddcbca732d2af58a.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Led by Lucy WordsworthJoin Lucy for a dynamic and engaging introduction to Basic Unarmed Stage Combat, perfect for performers of all levels. This workshop will cover essential techniques including pushes, slaps and knaps, punches, kicks, falls, strangles, and hair pulls, all taught in a safe, supportive, and informal environment.\\u00a0The session begins with fun warm-up games and movement exercises to help everyone relax and get physically ready. You'll then learn fundamental combat principles such as distance, eye contact, and clear partner communication. Techniques are explored through partner work, with staggered breaks to keep energy levels high. Participants may also work with short theatrical texts to give the movements dramatic context, and the workshop wraps up with a creative choreography challenge, crafting short fight scenes in small groups. An informal showing is optional for those who\\u2019d like to share their work.\\u00a0\\u00a0Since graduating from East 15 Acting School with First Class Honours in BA Acting & Stage Combat, Lucy Wordsworth has worked across Acting, Fight\\/Action Performing, Fight Directing, and Teaching. A highly physical performer with a background in Dance, Musical Theatre, and Movement, she combines these skills with a strong focus on storytelling. Her work includes projects with Box Clever Theatre, Stink Films, Marvel Studios, HBO, and Netflix.\\u00a0Lucy\\u2019s Fight Directing credits span theatre and film, including Poltergeist Theatre\\u2019s Offie-nominated Alice in Wonderland (Brixton House), Don\\u2019t Smoke In Bed (VAULT Festival), and projects for Met Film School, Ginger Whisker, and Fusion Media House. Passionate about accessibility in stage and screen combat, Lucy regularly leads workshops for youth-focused companies such as Zoo Co Theatre, Full House Theatre, West End On Demand, and Good Wolf People, and has assisted for Box Clever Theatre and Master At Arms.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/33401\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"72\"],\"search\":\"Fight Performance for Theatre Fight Performance for Theatre Workshops & Classes  <p><i><strong>Led by Lucy Wordsworth<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Join Lucy for a dynamic and engaging introduction to <strong>Basic Unarmed Stage Combat<\\/strong>, perfect for performers of all levels. This workshop will cover essential techniques including pushes, slaps and knaps, punches, kicks, falls, strangles, and hair pulls, all taught in a safe, supportive, and informal environment.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>The session begins with fun warm-up games and movement exercises to help everyone relax and get physically ready. You'll then learn fundamental combat principles such as distance, eye contact, and clear partner communication. Techniques are explored through partner work, with staggered breaks to keep energy levels high. Participants may also work with short theatrical texts to give the movements dramatic context, and the workshop wraps up with a creative choreography challenge, crafting short fight scenes in small groups. An informal showing is optional for those who\\u2019d like to share their work.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Since graduating from East 15 Acting School with First Class Honours in BA Acting &amp; Stage Combat, <strong>Lucy Wordsworth<\\/strong> has worked across Acting, Fight\\/Action Performing, Fight Directing, and Teaching. A highly physical performer with a background in Dance, Musical Theatre, and Movement, she combines these skills with a strong focus on storytelling. Her work includes projects with Box Clever Theatre, Stink Films, Marvel Studios, HBO, and Netflix.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Lucy\\u2019s Fight Directing credits span theatre and film, including Poltergeist Theatre\\u2019s Offie-nominated Alice in Wonderland (Brixton House), Don\\u2019t Smoke In Bed (VAULT Festival), and projects for Met Film School, Ginger Whisker, and Fusion Media House. Passionate about accessibility in stage and screen combat, Lucy regularly leads workshops for youth-focused companies such as Zoo Co Theatre, Full House Theatre, West End On Demand, and Good Wolf People, and has assisted for Box Clever Theatre and Master At Arms.<\\/p> Fight Performance for Theatre  Led by Lucy WordsworthJoin Lucy for a dynamic and engaging introduction to Basic Unarmed Stage Combat, perfect for performers of all levels. This workshop will cover essential techniques including pushes, slaps and knaps, punches, kicks, falls, strangles, and hair pulls, all taught in a safe, supportive, and informal environment.\\u00a0The session begins with fun warm-up games and movement exercises to help everyone relax and get physically ready. You'll then learn fundamental combat principles such as distance, eye contact, and clear partner communication. Techniques are explored through partner work, with staggered breaks to keep energy levels high. Participants may also work with short theatrical texts to give the movements dramatic context, and the workshop wraps up with a creative choreography challenge, crafting short fight scenes in small groups. An informal showing is optional for those who\\u2019d like to share their work.\\u00a0\\u00a0Since graduating from East 15 Acting School with First Class Honours in BA Acting & Stage Combat, Lucy Wordsworth has worked across Acting, Fight\\/Action Performing, Fight Directing, and Teaching. A highly physical performer with a background in Dance, Musical Theatre, and Movement, she combines these skills with a strong focus on storytelling. Her work includes projects with Box Clever Theatre, Stink Films, Marvel Studios, HBO, and Netflix.\\u00a0Lucy\\u2019s Fight Directing credits span theatre and film, including Poltergeist Theatre\\u2019s Offie-nominated Alice in Wonderland (Brixton House), Don\\u2019t Smoke In Bed (VAULT Festival), and projects for Met Film School, Ginger Whisker, and Fusion Media House. Passionate about accessibility in stage and screen combat, Lucy regularly leads workshops for youth-focused companies such as Zoo Co Theatre, Full House Theatre, West End On Demand, and Good Wolf People, and has assisted for Box Clever Theatre and Master At Arms. Workshops & Classes\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/tr-move-better-dance-foundations-for-everybody\\/\",\"id\":\"1010\",\"name\":\"Move Better: Dance Foundations for Everybody\",\"title\":\"Move Better: Dance Foundations for Everybody\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Wellness\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768089600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"59\",\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/33202\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">13:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768136400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1769299200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"59\",\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/33203\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">13:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769346000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768089600,1769299200],\"start_date\":\"1768136400\",\"end_date\":\"1769346000\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"ZFNRYndCVk9JNDhobG9rTVFrQU5hdz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sun 11 - Sun 25 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"This class is about feeling good in your body while learning to move better. With a relaxed atmosphere, good music, clear guidance, and enough repetition&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/31\\/befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx399\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1359\\/images\\/uploads\\/31befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8.jpeg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/31\\/befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx399\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1359\\/images\\/uploads\\/31befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/31\\/befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx399\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1359\\/images\\/uploads\\/31befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/31\\/befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx399\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1359\\/images\\/uploads\\/31befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/31\\/befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx399\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1359\\/images\\/uploads\\/31befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/31\\/befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx399\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1359\\/images\\/uploads\\/31befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/31\\/befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx399\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1359\\/images\\/uploads\\/31befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/31\\/befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx399\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1359\\/images\\/uploads\\/31befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/31\\/befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx399\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1359\\/images\\/uploads\\/31befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/31\\/befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx399\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1359\\/images\\/uploads\\/31befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/31\\/befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx399\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1359\\/images\\/uploads\\/31befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/31\\/befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx399\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1359\\/images\\/uploads\\/31befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/31\\/befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx399\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1359\\/images\\/uploads\\/31befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/31\\/befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx399\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1359\\/images\\/uploads\\/31befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/31\\/befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx399\\/cy7\\/cw1361\\/ch1359\\/images\\/uploads\\/31befcc026d36d93b482bc65fb6cf3a8.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"This class is about feeling good in your body while learning to move better. With a relaxed atmosphere, good music, clear guidance, and enough repetition to get you active and \\u2018get\\u2019 the moves, you\\u2019ll leave feeling energised, more confident, and connected to your body.Whether you\\u2019re new to dance or have some experience, this class meets you where you\\u2019re at. We\\u2019ll cover foundational movement principles as well as more advanced ones and break things down in a way that makes sense, building up progressively. It\\u2019s about building skill without the pressure.We draw from contemporary dance, street styles, hip hop, and improvisation elements to help you improve body awareness and move with more ease and skill - both in class and in everyday life.\\u00a0What to expect:\\u00b7 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0Foundations:\\u00a0Posture, alignment, stability and musicality\\u00b7 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0Holistic approach:\\u00a0finding organic movement and using your body\\u2019s natural dynamics\\u00b7 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0All levels welcome:\\u00a0build confidence and skill, or refine your craft\\u00b7 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0Room to grow:\\u00a0this is a space to try, mess up, ask questions, and improve\\u00a0\\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 Let\\u2019s get moving!\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"72\",\"59\"],\"search\":\"Move Better: Dance Foundations for Everybody Move Better: Dance Foundations for Everybody Wellness  <p>This class is about feeling good in your body while learning to move better. With a relaxed atmosphere, good music, clear guidance, and enough repetition to get you active and \\u2018get\\u2019 the moves, you\\u2019ll leave feeling energised, more confident, and connected to your body.<\\/p><p>Whether you\\u2019re new to dance or have some experience, this class meets you where you\\u2019re at. We\\u2019ll cover foundational movement principles as well as more advanced ones and break things down in a way that makes sense, building up progressively. It\\u2019s about building skill without the pressure.<\\/p><p>We draw from<strong> contemporary dance<\\/strong>, <strong>street styles<\\/strong>, <strong>hip hop<\\/strong>, and <strong>improvisation elements<\\/strong> to help you improve body awareness and move with more ease and skill - both in class and in everyday life.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>What to expect:<\\/strong><\\/p><p>\\u00b7 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Foundations:<\\/strong>&nbsp;Posture, alignment, stability and musicality<\\/p><p>\\u00b7 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Holistic approach:<\\/strong>&nbsp;finding organic movement and using your body\\u2019s natural dynamics<\\/p><p>\\u00b7 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;All levels welcome:<\\/strong>&nbsp;build confidence and skill, or refine your craft<\\/p><p>\\u00b7 &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<strong>&nbsp;Room to grow:&nbsp;<\\/strong>this is a space to try, mess up, ask questions, and improve<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Let\\u2019s get moving!<\\/strong><\\/p><p><br>&nbsp;<\\/p> Move Better: Dance Foundations for Everybody  This class is about feeling good in your body while learning to move better. With a relaxed atmosphere, good music, clear guidance, and enough repetition to get you active and \\u2018get\\u2019 the moves, you\\u2019ll leave feeling energised, more confident, and connected to your body.Whether you\\u2019re new to dance or have some experience, this class meets you where you\\u2019re at. We\\u2019ll cover foundational movement principles as well as more advanced ones and break things down in a way that makes sense, building up progressively. It\\u2019s about building skill without the pressure.We draw from contemporary dance, street styles, hip hop, and improvisation elements to help you improve body awareness and move with more ease and skill - both in class and in everyday life.\\u00a0What to expect:\\u00b7 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0Foundations:\\u00a0Posture, alignment, stability and musicality\\u00b7 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0Holistic approach:\\u00a0finding organic movement and using your body\\u2019s natural dynamics\\u00b7 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0All levels welcome:\\u00a0build confidence and skill, or refine your craft\\u00b7 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0\\u00a0Room to grow:\\u00a0this is a space to try, mess up, ask questions, and improve\\u00a0\\u00a0 \\u00a0 \\u00a0 Let\\u2019s get moving!\\u00a0 Workshops & Classes Wellness\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/LY-beaded-jewellery-workshop\\/\",\"id\":\"556\",\"name\":\"Beaded Jewellery Workshop\",\"title\":\"Beaded Jewellery Workshop\",\"duration\":\"120 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Workshops & Classes\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768089600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14667\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768140000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1768694400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/25003\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768744800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768089600,1768694400],\"start_date\":\"1768140000\",\"end_date\":\"1768744800\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"NFhiZC8wdTZuTzN1elpwdktsTzEvUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sun 11 - Sun 18 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Do you have loose beads from treasured jewellery items rolling around in a box?&nbsp;Have you ever wanted to re-create a sentimental piece and claim back&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Do you have loose beads from treasured jewellery items rolling around in a box?\\u00a0Have you ever wanted to re-create a sentimental piece and claim back a special item which holds cherished memories?\\u00a0This could be the workshop for you.\\u00a0This beaded jewellery workshop encourages participants to bring their broken beaded items along and learn the skills to create a final piece, either the same as before or a new re-imagined design.\\u00a0Our workshop leader, Clair, provides all the necessary tools and materials to fix and re-build items along with a selection of beads and other components for participants to add into their items or create something completely new. Participants will not only leave with an item they can wear but with new skills to use in the future!\\u00a0About Clair GreenClair, a third-generation vintage dealer, has been brought up surrounded by vintage beads and various vintage\\/antique curios. She learned to string beads almost by osmosis while she watched her mother create timeless pieces on the kitchen table, ready to sell at Portobello Market each Saturday.\\u00a0Having run her own business for over 20 years, nestled in the heart of Portobello Market, Clair has worked with a variety of projects including styling and creating period accessories for film and TV, fashion shoots and stocking vintage boutiques worldwide.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"72\"],\"search\":\"Beaded Jewellery Workshop Beaded Jewellery Workshop Workshops & Classes  <p><i>Do you have loose beads from treasured jewellery items rolling around in a box?&nbsp;<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>Have you ever wanted to re-create a sentimental piece and claim back a special item which holds cherished memories?&nbsp;<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>This could be the workshop for you.<\\/i><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>This beaded jewellery workshop encourages participants to bring their broken beaded items along and learn the skills to create a final piece, either the same as before or a new re-imagined design.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Our workshop leader, Clair, provides all the necessary tools and materials to fix and re-build items along with a selection of beads and other components for participants to add into their items or create something completely new. Participants will not only leave with an item they can wear but with new skills to use in the future!<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>About Clair Green<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Clair, a third-generation vintage dealer, has been brought up surrounded by vintage beads and various vintage\\/antique curios. She learned to string beads almost by osmosis while she watched her mother create timeless pieces on the kitchen table, ready to sell at Portobello Market each Saturday.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Having run her own business for over 20 years, nestled in the heart of <strong>Portobello Market<\\/strong>, Clair has worked with a variety of projects including styling and creating period accessories for film and TV, fashion shoots and stocking vintage boutiques worldwide.<\\/p> Beaded Jewellery Workshop  Do you have loose beads from treasured jewellery items rolling around in a box?\\u00a0Have you ever wanted to re-create a sentimental piece and claim back a special item which holds cherished memories?\\u00a0This could be the workshop for you.\\u00a0This beaded jewellery workshop encourages participants to bring their broken beaded items along and learn the skills to create a final piece, either the same as before or a new re-imagined design.\\u00a0Our workshop leader, Clair, provides all the necessary tools and materials to fix and re-build items along with a selection of beads and other components for participants to add into their items or create something completely new. Participants will not only leave with an item they can wear but with new skills to use in the future!\\u00a0About Clair GreenClair, a third-generation vintage dealer, has been brought up surrounded by vintage beads and various vintage\\/antique curios. She learned to string beads almost by osmosis while she watched her mother create timeless pieces on the kitchen table, ready to sell at Portobello Market each Saturday.\\u00a0Having run her own business for over 20 years, nestled in the heart of Portobello Market, Clair has worked with a variety of projects including styling and creating period accessories for film and TV, fashion shoots and stocking vintage boutiques worldwide. Workshops & Classes\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/gW-the-seat-of-me\\/\",\"id\":\"955\",\"name\":\"The Seat of Me\",\"title\":\"The Seat of Me\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Theatre\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768262400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\",\"80983\",\"227\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/29401\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768331700\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1768348800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\",\"80983\",\"227\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/29601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768418100\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768262400,1768348800],\"start_date\":\"1768331700\",\"end_date\":\"1768418100\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"RFVtUWhNMWpLS1RHTjFXcVhmQWJmdz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Tue 13 - Wed 14 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"The Seat of Me is an intimate, poetic solo show about memory, identity, and the moments that shape us.Through stories of Rome, New York, and Los Angeles,&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1587\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1587\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1587\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1587\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1587\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1587\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1587\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1587\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"The Seat of Me is an intimate, poetic solo show about memory, identity, and the moments that shape us.Through stories of Rome, New York, and Los Angeles, Giulia retraces the memories, mentors, and loves she has carried\\u2014unpacking each one through the simple, grounding presence of a single chair.Guided by the ghost of Edith Piaf, the scars of ballet, an unexpected love story, and the silence left by those who disappeared, she confronts the question that has followed her all her life: Am I enough?Blending storytelling, physicality, humour, and live fragments of Piaf\\u2019s music, The Seat of Me reveals what it means to sit with our past, let it rest, and finally rise as the person we choose to become.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"3\"],\"age_rating\":[\"227\",\"80983\"],\"search\":\"The Seat of Me The Seat of Me Theatre  <p><i>The Seat of Me <\\/i>is an intimate, poetic solo show about memory, identity, and the moments that shape us.<\\/p><p>Through stories of Rome, New York, and Los Angeles, Giulia retraces the memories, mentors, and loves she has carried\\u2014unpacking each one through the simple, grounding presence of a single chair.<\\/p><p>Guided by the ghost of Edith Piaf, the scars of ballet, an unexpected love story, and the silence left by those who disappeared, she confronts the question that has followed her all her life: <i>Am I enough?<\\/i><\\/p><p>Blending storytelling, physicality, humour, and live fragments of Piaf\\u2019s music, <i>The Seat of Me <\\/i>reveals what it means to sit with our past, let it rest, and finally rise as the person we choose to become.<\\/p> The Seat of Me  The Seat of Me is an intimate, poetic solo show about memory, identity, and the moments that shape us.Through stories of Rome, New York, and Los Angeles, Giulia retraces the memories, mentors, and loves she has carried\\u2014unpacking each one through the simple, grounding presence of a single chair.Guided by the ghost of Edith Piaf, the scars of ballet, an unexpected love story, and the silence left by those who disappeared, she confronts the question that has followed her all her life: Am I enough?Blending storytelling, physicality, humour, and live fragments of Piaf\\u2019s music, The Seat of Me reveals what it means to sit with our past, let it rest, and finally rise as the person we choose to become. Theatre 15 Recommended 15+\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/gQ-for-us-by-us-workshop-series\\/\",\"id\":\"970\",\"name\":\"For Us, By Us: Workshop Series\",\"title\":\"For Us, By Us: Workshop Series\",\"duration\":\"180 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Workshops & Classes\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768435200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/31601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768500000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1772668800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/31801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1772733600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1775689200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/31202\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1775754000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1778194800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/32001\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1778259600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768435200,1772668800,1775689200,1778194800],\"start_date\":\"1768500000\",\"end_date\":\"1778259600\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"Sm9lUkxkejZzcW8rVk9BWTZDQnZ3dz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Thu 15 Jan - Fri 8 May 2026\",\"text\":\"Created by young people, for young people. 100% youth-led.&nbsp;\\u201cBurnt Orange Theatre is quite right in their assertion that these sorts of stories aren\\u2019t&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Created by young people, for young people. 100% youth-led.\\u00a0\\u201cBurnt Orange Theatre is quite right in their assertion that these sorts of stories aren\\u2019t told often enough.\\u201d \\u2013 LondonTheatre1 on STORIES\\u00a0For Us, By Us is a bold new programme of 12 youth-led workshops for creatives aged 14\\u201321, designed and curated by the Burnt Orange Youth Board. This is young people taking the lead, creating the space, skills, and conversations they know are most needed right now.\\u00a0Every session has been imagined by young creatives themselves, their questions, their challenges, and their ambitions; making the programme unlike anything else available. It\\u2019s not adults telling you what to do. It\\u2019s peers and near-peers building a toolkit for the next generation of artists.\\u00a0\\u00a0What to expect\\u00a0The workshops are wide-ranging, covering both artistic and personal development. Together, you\\u2019ll explore:\\u00a0\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Creative skills \\u2013 from movement and voice to writing, devising, and self-taping.\\u00a0\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Industry know-how \\u2013 producing your own work, navigating auditions, and understanding the business side of creativity.\\u00a0\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Wellbeing and resilience \\u2013 tackling the pressures of being a young artist, overcoming creative block, and finding sustainable ways to thrive.\\u00a0\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Collaboration \\u2013 learning how to work across disciplines, share ideas, and spark new projects with your peers.\\u00a0Each session stands alone, so you can pick and choose the topics that excite you most. But if you commit to multiple workshops, you\\u2019ll benefit from a joined-up journey, building a stronger skillset, deeper confidence, and lasting creative friendships.\\u00a0\\u00a0Why youth-led matters\\u00a0The Burnt Orange Youth Board created this series because they know what\\u2019s missing for young people in the arts. They\\u2019ve been through the hurdles of auditioning, studying, and trying to access opportunities, and they want to pass on what they wish they\\u2019d had when starting out. This makes For Us, By Us immediately relevant, practical, and rooted in lived experience.\\u00a0Burnt Orange Theatre is a multi-award-winning Community Interest Company (CIC) that creates professional-level opportunities tailored for young people. We work to industry standard while ensuring accessibility, so every young creative has a fair chance to take the next step in their journey.\\u00a0\\u201cWhat a pleasure to have such a free, fast-paced, fulfilling environment to experiment and grow as a young actor. Burnt Orange are incredible facilitators and craft such a freeing atmosphere for young people.\\u201d \\u2013 Participant Feedback 2025\\u00a0Don\\u2019t miss out - join For Us, By Us and experience a workshop series shaped by young people, for young people. Book your sessions now and be part of the movement.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"72\"],\"search\":\"For Us, By Us: Workshop Series For Us, By Us: Workshop Series Workshops & Classes  <p>Created by young people, for young people. 100% youth-led.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i>\\u201cBurnt Orange Theatre is quite right in their assertion that these sorts of stories aren\\u2019t told often enough.\\u201d<\\/i> \\u2013 LondonTheatre1 on STORIES&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>For Us, By Us<\\/strong> is a bold new programme of 12 youth-led workshops for creatives aged 14\\u201321, designed and curated by the <strong>Burnt Orange Youth Board<\\/strong>. This is young people taking the lead, creating the space, skills, and conversations they know are most needed right now.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Every session has been imagined by young creatives themselves, their questions, their challenges, and their ambitions; making the programme unlike anything else available. It\\u2019s not adults telling you what to do. It\\u2019s peers and near-peers building a toolkit for the next generation of artists.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>What to expect&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p><p>The workshops are wide-ranging, covering both artistic and personal development. Together, you\\u2019ll explore:&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Creative skills \\u2013 from movement and voice to writing, devising, and self-taping.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Industry know-how \\u2013 producing your own work, navigating auditions, and understanding the business side of creativity.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Wellbeing and resilience \\u2013 tackling the pressures of being a young artist, overcoming creative block, and finding sustainable ways to thrive.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Collaboration \\u2013 learning how to work across disciplines, share ideas, and spark new projects with your peers.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Each session stands alone, so you can pick and choose the topics that excite you most. But if you commit to multiple workshops, you\\u2019ll benefit from a joined-up journey, building a stronger skillset, deeper confidence, and lasting creative friendships.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Why youth-led matters&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p><p>The Burnt Orange Youth Board created this series because they know what\\u2019s missing for young people in the arts. They\\u2019ve been through the hurdles of auditioning, studying, and trying to access opportunities, and they want to pass on what they wish they\\u2019d had when starting out. This makes <strong>For Us, By Us<\\/strong> immediately relevant, practical, and rooted in lived experience.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Burnt Orange Theatre<\\/strong> is a multi-award-winning Community Interest Company (CIC) that creates professional-level opportunities tailored for young people. We work to industry standard while ensuring accessibility, so every young creative has a fair chance to take the next step in their journey.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i>\\u201cWhat a pleasure to have such a free, fast-paced, fulfilling environment to experiment and grow as a young actor. Burnt Orange are incredible facilitators and craft such a freeing atmosphere for young people.\\u201d<\\/i> \\u2013 Participant Feedback 2025&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Don\\u2019t miss out - join <strong>For Us, By Us<\\/strong> and experience a workshop series shaped by young people, for young people. Book your sessions now and be part of the movement.<\\/p> For Us, By Us: Workshop Series,For Us, By Us: Workshop Series  Created by young people, for young people. 100% youth-led.\\u00a0\\u201cBurnt Orange Theatre is quite right in their assertion that these sorts of stories aren\\u2019t told often enough.\\u201d \\u2013 LondonTheatre1 on STORIES\\u00a0For Us, By Us is a bold new programme of 12 youth-led workshops for creatives aged 14\\u201321, designed and curated by the Burnt Orange Youth Board. This is young people taking the lead, creating the space, skills, and conversations they know are most needed right now.\\u00a0Every session has been imagined by young creatives themselves, their questions, their challenges, and their ambitions; making the programme unlike anything else available. It\\u2019s not adults telling you what to do. It\\u2019s peers and near-peers building a toolkit for the next generation of artists.\\u00a0\\u00a0What to expect\\u00a0The workshops are wide-ranging, covering both artistic and personal development. Together, you\\u2019ll explore:\\u00a0\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Creative skills \\u2013 from movement and voice to writing, devising, and self-taping.\\u00a0\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Industry know-how \\u2013 producing your own work, navigating auditions, and understanding the business side of creativity.\\u00a0\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Wellbeing and resilience \\u2013 tackling the pressures of being a young artist, overcoming creative block, and finding sustainable ways to thrive.\\u00a0\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Collaboration \\u2013 learning how to work across disciplines, share ideas, and spark new projects with your peers.\\u00a0Each session stands alone, so you can pick and choose the topics that excite you most. But if you commit to multiple workshops, you\\u2019ll benefit from a joined-up journey, building a stronger skillset, deeper confidence, and lasting creative friendships.\\u00a0\\u00a0Why youth-led matters\\u00a0The Burnt Orange Youth Board created this series because they know what\\u2019s missing for young people in the arts. They\\u2019ve been through the hurdles of auditioning, studying, and trying to access opportunities, and they want to pass on what they wish they\\u2019d had when starting out. This makes For Us, By Us immediately relevant, practical, and rooted in lived experience.\\u00a0Burnt Orange Theatre is a multi-award-winning Community Interest Company (CIC) that creates professional-level opportunities tailored for young people. We work to industry standard while ensuring accessibility, so every young creative has a fair chance to take the next step in their journey.\\u00a0\\u201cWhat a pleasure to have such a free, fast-paced, fulfilling environment to experiment and grow as a young actor. Burnt Orange are incredible facilitators and craft such a freeing atmosphere for young people.\\u201d \\u2013 Participant Feedback 2025\\u00a0Don\\u2019t miss out - join For Us, By Us and experience a workshop series shaped by young people, for young people. Book your sessions now and be part of the movement. Workshops & Classes\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/go-ceili-cois-abhann\\/\",\"id\":\"987\",\"name\":\"C\\u00e9il\\u00ed Cois Abhann\",\"title\":\"C\\u00e9il\\u00ed Cois Abhann\",\"duration\":\"180 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Music\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768435200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"113\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/33201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768505400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768435200],\"start_date\":\"1768505400\",\"end_date\":\"1768505400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"RzNLVXVTV0VDdTBueHRRRktNUzlDUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Thu 15 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"C\\u00e9il\\u00ed Cois Abhann is back! Come to Riverside Studios to enjoy a night of beginners Irish c\\u00e9il\\u00ed dancing, live music and craic. No experience is needed&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/99\\/abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/99abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/99\\/abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/99abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/99\\/abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/99abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/99\\/abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/99abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/99\\/abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/99abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/99\\/abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/99abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/99\\/abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1\\/w1920\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/99abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/99\\/abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1\\/w1920\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/99abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/99\\/abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/99abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/99\\/abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/99abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/99\\/abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/99abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/99\\/abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/99abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/99\\/abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/99abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/99\\/abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1\\/w1920\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/99abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/99\\/abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1\\/w1920\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/99abf7ee6f03dfacf83053963f2c2ca1.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"C\\u00e9il\\u00ed Cois Abhann is back! Come to Riverside Studios to enjoy a night of beginners Irish c\\u00e9il\\u00ed dancing, live music and craic. No experience is needed and everyone (Irish, Irish-ish or not at all!)is welcome to take part, or watch and enjoy from the sidelines.\\u00a0This time round we'll be raising funds for Medical Aid Palestine, who work to provide aid and support for humanitarian emergencies in the West Bank, Lebanon, East Jerusalem and Gaza. Ticket proceeds will be going to the charity and further donations on the night are welcome and sincerely appreciated!\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/33201\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"113\"],\"search\":\"C\\u00e9il\\u00ed Cois Abhann C\\u00e9il\\u00ed Cois Abhann Music  <p><strong>C\\u00e9il\\u00ed Cois Abhann<\\/strong> is back! Come to Riverside Studios to enjoy a night of beginners Irish c\\u00e9il\\u00ed dancing, live music and craic. No experience is needed and everyone (Irish, Irish-ish or not at all!)is welcome to take part, or watch and enjoy from the sidelines.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>This time round we'll be raising funds for <strong>Medical Aid Palestine<\\/strong>, who work to provide aid and support for humanitarian emergencies in the West Bank, Lebanon, East Jerusalem and Gaza. Ticket proceeds will be going to the charity and further donations on the night are welcome and sincerely appreciated!<\\/p> C\\u00e9il\\u00ed Cois Abhann  C\\u00e9il\\u00ed Cois Abhann is back! Come to Riverside Studios to enjoy a night of beginners Irish c\\u00e9il\\u00ed dancing, live music and craic. No experience is needed and everyone (Irish, Irish-ish or not at all!)is welcome to take part, or watch and enjoy from the sidelines.\\u00a0This time round we'll be raising funds for Medical Aid Palestine, who work to provide aid and support for humanitarian emergencies in the West Bank, Lebanon, East Jerusalem and Gaza. Ticket proceeds will be going to the charity and further donations on the night are welcome and sincerely appreciated! Music\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/gp-hanging-plant-holder-workshop\\/\",\"id\":\"972\",\"name\":\"Hanging Plant Holder Workshop\",\"title\":\"Hanging Plant Holder Workshop\",\"duration\":\"120 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Workshops & Classes\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768608000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/31001\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">11:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768647600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768608000],\"start_date\":\"1768647600\",\"end_date\":\"1768647600\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"UkJiWXdmNStnSHRiU2tGVkhyWTRmZz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 17 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"What better way to start the new year than to get creative, try something new and feel good whilst doing it!In this workshop, you\\u2019ll design and make a&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"What better way to start the new year than to get creative, try something new and feel good whilst doing it!In this workshop, you\\u2019ll design and make a beautiful one-off hanging plant holder to display your plants and celebrate all things new!\\u00a0 Plants are calming and energising and your hanging plant holder will most certainly live up to this brief \\u2013 whilst adding something special to your interiors.\\u00a0 Your plant holder design will elevate any plant and take it to new heights, whilst enhancing its visibility and creating a charming focal point.\\u00a0This workshop includes guidance from a trained creative eye - all the materials you\\u2019ll need to create a unique piece, and lots of inspiration, tips, tricks and conversation along the way!\\u00a0 No experience is necessary just the desire to try something new and get creative!\\u00a0 Book your place to join us and make an item you\\u2019ll enjoy for many years to come!\\u00a0\\u00a0About CURATE & MORE\\u00a0Curate & More design and facilitate creative experiences and events \\u2013 with an emphasis on art, design, fashion and interiors.\\u00a0 Workshops encourage, engage and inspire participants in their collaborative and individual creative stories whilst promoting creative processes and the joy of making by hand!\\u00a0To find out more about CURATE & MORE events and services visit our website here\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/31001\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"72\"],\"search\":\"Hanging Plant Holder Workshop Hanging Plant Holder Workshop Workshops & Classes  <p>What better way to start the new year than to get creative, try something new and feel good whilst doing it!<\\/p><p>In this workshop, you\\u2019ll design and make a beautiful one-off hanging plant holder to display your plants and celebrate all things new!&nbsp; Plants are calming and energising and your hanging plant holder will most certainly live up to this brief \\u2013 whilst adding something special to your interiors.&nbsp; Your plant holder design will elevate any plant and take it to new heights, whilst enhancing its visibility and creating a charming focal point.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;This workshop includes guidance from a trained creative eye - all the materials you\\u2019ll need to create a unique piece, and lots of inspiration, tips, tricks and conversation along the way!&nbsp; No experience is necessary just the desire to try something new and get creative!&nbsp; Book your place to join us and make an item you\\u2019ll enjoy for many years to come!<\\/p><p><strong>&nbsp;<\\/strong>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>About CURATE &amp; MORE&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Curate &amp; More design and facilitate creative experiences and events \\u2013 with an emphasis on art, design, fashion and interiors.&nbsp; Workshops encourage, engage and inspire participants in their collaborative and individual creative stories whilst promoting creative processes and the joy of making by hand!<\\/p><p>&nbsp;To find out more about CURATE &amp; MORE events and services visit our website <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.curateandmore.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><strong>here&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/a><\\/p> Hanging Plant Holder Workshop  What better way to start the new year than to get creative, try something new and feel good whilst doing it!In this workshop, you\\u2019ll design and make a beautiful one-off hanging plant holder to display your plants and celebrate all things new!\\u00a0 Plants are calming and energising and your hanging plant holder will most certainly live up to this brief \\u2013 whilst adding something special to your interiors.\\u00a0 Your plant holder design will elevate any plant and take it to new heights, whilst enhancing its visibility and creating a charming focal point.\\u00a0This workshop includes guidance from a trained creative eye - all the materials you\\u2019ll need to create a unique piece, and lots of inspiration, tips, tricks and conversation along the way!\\u00a0 No experience is necessary just the desire to try something new and get creative!\\u00a0 Book your place to join us and make an item you\\u2019ll enjoy for many years to come!\\u00a0\\u00a0About CURATE & MORE\\u00a0Curate & More design and facilitate creative experiences and events \\u2013 with an emphasis on art, design, fashion and interiors.\\u00a0 Workshops encourage, engage and inspire participants in their collaborative and individual creative stories whilst promoting creative processes and the joy of making by hand!\\u00a0To find out more about CURATE & MORE events and services visit our website here\\u00a0 Workshops & Classes\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/Zn-intro-to-acting-for-theatre-directors\\/\",\"id\":\"1067\",\"name\":\"Intro to Acting for Theatre Directors\",\"title\":\"Intro to Acting for Theatre Directors\",\"duration\":\"90 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":false,\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768608000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/37601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768658400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768608000],\"start_date\":\"1768658400\",\"end_date\":\"1768658400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"VXV1MVhxVGNuMVZvcW1XejIzUUx6UT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 17 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Intro to Acting for Theatre Directors: Honing their Empathetic Communication, facilitated by Maiya PascoucheAre you a director interested in expanding&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e0\\/a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx198\\/cw842\\/ch840\\/images\\/uploads\\/e0a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e0\\/a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx198\\/cw842\\/ch840\\/images\\/uploads\\/e0a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e0\\/a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx198\\/cw842\\/ch840\\/images\\/uploads\\/e0a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e0\\/a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx198\\/cw842\\/ch840\\/images\\/uploads\\/e0a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e0\\/a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx198\\/cw842\\/ch840\\/images\\/uploads\\/e0a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e0\\/a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx198\\/cw842\\/ch840\\/images\\/uploads\\/e0a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e0\\/a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx198\\/cw842\\/ch840\\/images\\/uploads\\/e0a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e0\\/a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx198\\/cw842\\/ch840\\/images\\/uploads\\/e0a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e0\\/a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx198\\/cw842\\/ch840\\/images\\/uploads\\/e0a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e0\\/a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx198\\/cw842\\/ch840\\/images\\/uploads\\/e0a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e0\\/a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx198\\/cw842\\/ch840\\/images\\/uploads\\/e0a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e0\\/a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx198\\/cw842\\/ch840\\/images\\/uploads\\/e0a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e0\\/a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx198\\/cw842\\/ch840\\/images\\/uploads\\/e0a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e0\\/a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx198\\/cw842\\/ch840\\/images\\/uploads\\/e0a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/e0\\/a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx198\\/cw842\\/ch840\\/images\\/uploads\\/e0a05f111dffb064d5d1b690d22e0d4c.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Intro to Acting for Theatre Directors: Honing their Empathetic Communication, facilitated by Maiya PascoucheAre you a director interested in expanding and developing your communication with actors? Do you desire to understand the actor\\u2019s process as a way to collaborate more empathetically and effectively?\\u00a0The job of a director is as much about facilitation, collaboration, and discovery as it is about leading a team and conveying a central vision. In this directing workshop, we\\u2019ll play with physical acting techniques \\u2013 Laban movement, Viewpoints, guided contact improvisation \\u2013 as an entry point into the mind and body of an actor. Afterwards, we\\u2019ll put that exploration into practice through a short scene study. This workshop will be an openhearted, generous, and safe environment. We will ask ourselves and each other to embrace failure and take risks as we hone our collaborative communication, creativity, and conflict resolution skills.\\u00a0What to ExpectPlayground vibes! We\\u2019re here to play, discover, and develop directing skills rather than get something correct or do something perfectlyVulnerability! You will be asked to be vulnerable with fellow participants through movement exercises, scene work, and open conversationsGenerosity! The space we\\u2019ll be cultivating is one where risk is encouraged and you\\u2019ll be expected to show fellow participants respect, care, and supportActing! Surprise \\u2013 this is a chance to leave your director hat at the door and try on a new one that will potentially influence your practice or teach you something about the rigorous work of an actorMovement! Please wear comfortable clothes and bring a bottle of water with you\\u00a0About Maiya PascoucheMaiya Pascouche is a queer theatre director-producer-composer-writer-facilitator based between London and New York. Her work has been seen at The Glitch, Union Theatre, King\\u2019s Head Theatre, Spark Theatre Festival, New Ohio Theatre, The Center at West Park, The Tank, and Playwrights Downtown. Her multi-media production company, Missing Rib Collective, produced the 5-star, award-winning new play 4 girls the first letter e by maguire wilder at the 2024 Edinburgh Fringe Festival, described by critics as \\u201ca revelation\\u201d (Binge Fringe) and a \\u201cpatiently paced\\u2026sunlit horror\\u201d (The Scotsman). Her folk horror music theatre piece, untitled mermaid project, was recently developed at Fresh Ground Pepper\\u2019s BRB Retreat.\\u00a0maiyatorenpascouche.comHer passion is creating stories about young queer people that are challenging, breathtaking, and bold. She craves spaces that dream of big, impossible stories and has an insatiable appetite for process. She upholds collaboration first and foremost, cultivating teams of creatives from all walks of life who center truth and empathy. She is interested in the juxtaposition of safety and discomfort and how to explore this sensitively and empathetically. It is the vulnerable act of making theatre that keeps her alive.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/37601\\/\",\"search\":\"Intro to Acting for Theatre Directors Intro to Acting for Theatre Directors   <p><i><strong>Intro to Acting for Theatre Directors: Honing their Empathetic Communication, facilitated by Maiya Pascouche<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Are you a director interested in expanding and developing your communication with actors? Do you desire to understand the actor\\u2019s process as a way to collaborate more empathetically and effectively?<\\/p><p>&nbsp;The job of a director is as much about facilitation, collaboration, and discovery as it is about leading a team and conveying a central vision. In this directing workshop, we\\u2019ll play with physical acting techniques \\u2013 Laban movement, Viewpoints, guided contact improvisation \\u2013 as an entry point into the mind and body of an actor. Afterwards, we\\u2019ll put that exploration into practice through a short scene study. This workshop will be an openhearted, generous, and safe environment. We will ask ourselves and each other to embrace failure and take risks as we hone our collaborative communication, creativity, and conflict resolution skills.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>What to Expect<\\/strong><\\/p><ul><li>Playground vibes! We\\u2019re here to play, discover, and develop directing skills rather than get something correct or do something perfectly<\\/li><li>Vulnerability! You will be asked to be vulnerable with fellow participants through movement exercises, scene work, and open conversations<\\/li><li>Generosity! The space we\\u2019ll be cultivating is one where risk is encouraged and you\\u2019ll be expected to show fellow participants respect, care, and support<\\/li><li>Acting! Surprise \\u2013 this is a chance to leave your director hat at the door and try on a new one that will potentially influence your practice or teach you something about the rigorous work of an actor<\\/li><li>Movement! Please wear comfortable clothes and bring a bottle of water with you<\\/li><\\/ul><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>About Maiya Pascouche<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Maiya Pascouche is a queer theatre director-producer-composer-writer-facilitator based between London and New York. Her work has been seen at The Glitch, Union Theatre, King\\u2019s Head Theatre, Spark Theatre Festival, New Ohio Theatre, The Center at West Park, The Tank, and Playwrights Downtown. Her multi-media production company, Missing Rib Collective, produced the 5-star, award-winning new play 4 girls the first letter e by maguire wilder at the 2024 Edinburgh Fringe Festival, described by critics as \\u201ca revelation\\u201d (Binge Fringe) and a \\u201cpatiently paced\\u2026sunlit horror\\u201d (The Scotsman). Her folk horror music theatre piece, untitled mermaid project, was recently developed at Fresh Ground Pepper\\u2019s BRB Retreat.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><a href=\\\"maiyatorenpascouche.com\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">maiyatorenpascouche.com<\\/a><\\/p><p>Her passion is creating stories about young queer people that are challenging, breathtaking, and bold. She craves spaces that dream of big, impossible stories and has an insatiable appetite for process. She upholds collaboration first and foremost, cultivating teams of creatives from all walks of life who center truth and empathy. She is interested in the juxtaposition of safety and discomfort and how to explore this sensitively and empathetically. It is the vulnerable act of making theatre that keeps her alive.<\\/p> Intro to Acting for Theatre Directors  Intro to Acting for Theatre Directors: Honing their Empathetic Communication, facilitated by Maiya PascoucheAre you a director interested in expanding and developing your communication with actors? Do you desire to understand the actor\\u2019s process as a way to collaborate more empathetically and effectively?\\u00a0The job of a director is as much about facilitation, collaboration, and discovery as it is about leading a team and conveying a central vision. In this directing workshop, we\\u2019ll play with physical acting techniques \\u2013 Laban movement, Viewpoints, guided contact improvisation \\u2013 as an entry point into the mind and body of an actor. Afterwards, we\\u2019ll put that exploration into practice through a short scene study. This workshop will be an openhearted, generous, and safe environment. We will ask ourselves and each other to embrace failure and take risks as we hone our collaborative communication, creativity, and conflict resolution skills.\\u00a0What to ExpectPlayground vibes! We\\u2019re here to play, discover, and develop directing skills rather than get something correct or do something perfectlyVulnerability! You will be asked to be vulnerable with fellow participants through movement exercises, scene work, and open conversationsGenerosity! The space we\\u2019ll be cultivating is one where risk is encouraged and you\\u2019ll be expected to show fellow participants respect, care, and supportActing! Surprise \\u2013 this is a chance to leave your director hat at the door and try on a new one that will potentially influence your practice or teach you something about the rigorous work of an actorMovement! Please wear comfortable clothes and bring a bottle of water with you\\u00a0About Maiya PascoucheMaiya Pascouche is a queer theatre director-producer-composer-writer-facilitator based between London and New York. Her work has been seen at The Glitch, Union Theatre, King\\u2019s Head Theatre, Spark Theatre Festival, New Ohio Theatre, The Center at West Park, The Tank, and Playwrights Downtown. Her multi-media production company, Missing Rib Collective, produced the 5-star, award-winning new play 4 girls the first letter e by maguire wilder at the 2024 Edinburgh Fringe Festival, described by critics as \\u201ca revelation\\u201d (Binge Fringe) and a \\u201cpatiently paced\\u2026sunlit horror\\u201d (The Scotsman). Her folk horror music theatre piece, untitled mermaid project, was recently developed at Fresh Ground Pepper\\u2019s BRB Retreat.\\u00a0maiyatorenpascouche.comHer passion is creating stories about young queer people that are challenging, breathtaking, and bold. She craves spaces that dream of big, impossible stories and has an insatiable appetite for process. She upholds collaboration first and foremost, cultivating teams of creatives from all walks of life who center truth and empathy. She is interested in the juxtaposition of safety and discomfort and how to explore this sensitively and empathetically. It is the vulnerable act of making theatre that keeps her alive.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/LE-amore-jazz-world-music-night\\/\",\"id\":\"551\",\"name\":\"Amore: Jazz & World Music Night\",\"title\":\"Amore: Jazz & World Music Night\",\"duration\":\"150 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Music\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768608000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"113\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14810\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768676400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1770422400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"113\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/21201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1770490800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1772236800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"113\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/21401\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1772305200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1774051200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"113\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/21601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1774119600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1776466800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"113\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/21801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1776535200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1780095600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"113\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/21802\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1780164000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1782514800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"113\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/22001\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1782583200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768608000,1770422400,1772236800,1774051200,1776466800,1780095600,1782514800],\"start_date\":\"1768676400\",\"end_date\":\"1782583200\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"YjlIN2pvSHdvNHNoOFR4VEthT0IxQT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 17 Jan - Sat 27 Jun 2026\",\"text\":\"An always-eclectic line-up of jazz, funk and soul bands, singer-songwriters, poets and spoken word artists.Sunday 21 DecemberCHRISTMAS EXTRAVAGANZA BLEGGAE&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w2157\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w2157\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"An always-eclectic line-up of jazz, funk and soul bands, singer-songwriters, poets and spoken word artists.Sunday 21 DecemberCHRISTMAS EXTRAVAGANZA BLEGGAE NIGHT!!!!!!!!!\\u201c The Popular and hugely entertaining Riverside regular Tim Hain aka \\u201cthe King of Bleggae\\u201d ( blues reggae ) joins forces with the dynamic songstress and Mick Fleetwood protege Tallulah Bardens for a Christmas extravaganza. They will each perform and support each other \\u2018s original songs and meaningful covers from ballads to blues and boogie. It will be an evening of serious fun.\\u00a0https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=J_txt8ZymhQ\\u00a0With Tim Hain\\u201cTimeless\\u201d\\u00a0 Tim\\u00a0 Hain is one of the UK\\u2019s finest \\u201cold school\\u201d blues guitarists, but he can\\u2019t\\u00a0 resist a bit of reggae. He is also a\\u00a0 compelling communicator and singer-songwriter. He has been called \\u201cThe Van Morrison of Blues-Reggae\\u201d by legendary producer Chris KIMSEY\\u00a0 who mixed Tim\\u2019s latest album \\u201cTales Of Timeless Tim\\u201d and produced both the Rolling Stones and reggae icons Peter Tosh and\\u00a0 Jimmy Cliff.Tim has performed at Riverside several times, always to a rousing reception. With powerhouse Chris Belshaw on Bass, and Tansay Omar ( Bjork, Boy George, Stereo MCs) on drums, this will be a stripped down, up-front\\u00a0 performance; \\u201cback to the roots\\u201d,\\u00a0 as Tim puts it, but all the more powerful for it.His single \\u201cSister Rosetta \\u201c was voted \\u201crecord of the week\\u201d on New Dawn Radio\\u2019s \\u201cJukebox Judgment\\u201d by top industry pros, , and made Mile Read\\u2019s Heritage Chart..Tim has played with the best on both sides of the Atlantic, touring and recording with reggae greats Tyrone Taylor, Winston Reedy, and Carroll Thompson, performing with Zakiya ( daughter of John Lee) Hooker and\\u00a0 even\\u00a0 jammed with Jeff Beck. He honed his craft fronting\\u00a0 2000 gigs since the turn of the century and is a natural performer, mixing songs and rhythms with which\\u00a0 you will be familiar, with his own stellar tunes\\u00a0Tallulah BardensKnown for her raw, electrifying energy across genres, from early blues to minimal techno, Tallulah Bardens\\u2019s style brings soulful storytelling to every stage she graces. With recent releases including Armada and Tomorrowland, her current writing and performance collaborations include jazz-house project with Chicago house legend Joe Smooth, trip-hop projects with her music collective Porcelain, and a starring contribution on official Fleetwood Mac tribute album Legacy, alongside Elton John and The Corrs among others.\\u00a0\\u00a0Tallulah continues to push creative boundaries through live blues collaborations with Tim Hain and new songwriting with Mick Fleetwood.Support ActSolur Jazz\\/Worldmusic Band Trio:with Peter Garvey(PHD Composer\\/Pianist),Henry Knudsen(Alto Sax) & Hide Takemoto(Guitar, UK Ambassador for Yamaha Music Corporation 2024 )\\u00a0World Music, Jazz, Latin Jazz\\u00a0 Solur Jazz Band presents a wide flavour of eclectic styles, showcasing the wide proliferation of Jazz and World Music.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"113\"],\"search\":\"Amore: Jazz & World Music Night Amore: Jazz & World Music Night Music  <p><strong>An always-eclectic line-up of jazz, funk and soul bands, singer-songwriters, poets and spoken word artists.<\\/strong><\\/p><h2><strong>Sunday 21 December<\\/strong><\\/h2><h3>CHRISTMAS EXTRAVAGANZA BLEGGAE NIGHT!!!!!!!!!<\\/h3><p>\\u201c The Popular and hugely entertaining Riverside regular Tim Hain aka \\u201cthe King of Bleggae\\u201d ( blues reggae ) joins forces with the dynamic songstress and Mick Fleetwood protege Tallulah Bardens for a Christmas extravaganza. They will each perform and support each other \\u2018s original songs and meaningful covers from ballads to blues and boogie. It will be an evening of serious fun.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=J_txt8ZymhQ\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><strong>https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=J_txt8ZymhQ<\\/strong><\\/a><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>With Tim Hain<\\/strong><\\/p><p>\\u201cTimeless\\u201d&nbsp; Tim&nbsp; Hain is one of the UK\\u2019s finest \\u201cold school\\u201d blues guitarists, but he can\\u2019t&nbsp; resist a bit of reggae. He is also a&nbsp; compelling communicator and singer-songwriter. He has been called \\u201cThe Van Morrison of Blues-Reggae\\u201d by legendary producer Chris KIMSEY&nbsp; who mixed Tim\\u2019s latest album \\u201cTales Of Timeless Tim\\u201d and produced both the Rolling Stones and reggae icons Peter Tosh and&nbsp; Jimmy Cliff.<\\/p><p>Tim has performed at Riverside several times, always to a rousing reception. With powerhouse Chris Belshaw on Bass, and Tansay Omar ( Bjork, Boy George, Stereo MCs) on drums, this will be a stripped down, up-front&nbsp; performance; \\u201cback to the roots\\u201d,&nbsp; as Tim puts it, but all the more powerful for it.<\\/p><p>His single \\u201cSister Rosetta \\u201c was voted \\u201crecord of the week\\u201d on New Dawn Radio\\u2019s \\u201cJukebox Judgment\\u201d by top industry pros, , and made Mile Read\\u2019s Heritage Chart..<\\/p><p>Tim has played with the best on both sides of the Atlantic, touring and recording with reggae greats Tyrone Taylor, Winston Reedy, and Carroll Thompson, performing with Zakiya ( daughter of John Lee) Hooker and&nbsp; even&nbsp; jammed with Jeff Beck. He honed his craft fronting&nbsp; 2000 gigs since the turn of the century and is a natural performer, mixing songs and rhythms with which&nbsp; you will be familiar, with his own stellar tunes<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Tallulah Bardens<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Known for her raw, electrifying energy across genres, from early blues to minimal techno, Tallulah Bardens\\u2019s style brings soulful storytelling to every stage she graces. With recent releases including Armada and Tomorrowland, her current writing and performance collaborations include jazz-house project with Chicago house legend Joe Smooth, trip-hop projects with her music collective Porcelain, and a starring contribution on official Fleetwood Mac tribute album Legacy, alongside Elton John and The Corrs among others.&nbsp;&nbsp;Tallulah continues to push creative boundaries through live blues collaborations with Tim Hain and new songwriting with Mick Fleetwood.<\\/p><p><strong>Support Act<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>Solur Jazz\\/Worldmusic Band Trio<\\/strong>:with Peter Garvey(PHD Composer\\/Pianist),Henry Knudsen(Alto Sax) &amp; Hide Takemoto(Guitar, UK Ambassador for Yamaha Music Corporation 2024 )<\\/p><p>&nbsp;World Music, Jazz, Latin Jazz&nbsp; Solur Jazz Band presents a wide flavour of eclectic styles, showcasing the wide proliferation of Jazz and World Music.<\\/p> Amore: Jazz & World Music Night  An always-eclectic line-up of jazz, funk and soul bands, singer-songwriters, poets and spoken word artists.Sunday 21 DecemberCHRISTMAS EXTRAVAGANZA BLEGGAE NIGHT!!!!!!!!!\\u201c The Popular and hugely entertaining Riverside regular Tim Hain aka \\u201cthe King of Bleggae\\u201d ( blues reggae ) joins forces with the dynamic songstress and Mick Fleetwood protege Tallulah Bardens for a Christmas extravaganza. They will each perform and support each other \\u2018s original songs and meaningful covers from ballads to blues and boogie. It will be an evening of serious fun.\\u00a0https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=J_txt8ZymhQ\\u00a0With Tim Hain\\u201cTimeless\\u201d\\u00a0 Tim\\u00a0 Hain is one of the UK\\u2019s finest \\u201cold school\\u201d blues guitarists, but he can\\u2019t\\u00a0 resist a bit of reggae. He is also a\\u00a0 compelling communicator and singer-songwriter. He has been called \\u201cThe Van Morrison of Blues-Reggae\\u201d by legendary producer Chris KIMSEY\\u00a0 who mixed Tim\\u2019s latest album \\u201cTales Of Timeless Tim\\u201d and produced both the Rolling Stones and reggae icons Peter Tosh and\\u00a0 Jimmy Cliff.Tim has performed at Riverside several times, always to a rousing reception. With powerhouse Chris Belshaw on Bass, and Tansay Omar ( Bjork, Boy George, Stereo MCs) on drums, this will be a stripped down, up-front\\u00a0 performance; \\u201cback to the roots\\u201d,\\u00a0 as Tim puts it, but all the more powerful for it.His single \\u201cSister Rosetta \\u201c was voted \\u201crecord of the week\\u201d on New Dawn Radio\\u2019s \\u201cJukebox Judgment\\u201d by top industry pros, , and made Mile Read\\u2019s Heritage Chart..Tim has played with the best on both sides of the Atlantic, touring and recording with reggae greats Tyrone Taylor, Winston Reedy, and Carroll Thompson, performing with Zakiya ( daughter of John Lee) Hooker and\\u00a0 even\\u00a0 jammed with Jeff Beck. He honed his craft fronting\\u00a0 2000 gigs since the turn of the century and is a natural performer, mixing songs and rhythms with which\\u00a0 you will be familiar, with his own stellar tunes\\u00a0Tallulah BardensKnown for her raw, electrifying energy across genres, from early blues to minimal techno, Tallulah Bardens\\u2019s style brings soulful storytelling to every stage she graces. With recent releases including Armada and Tomorrowland, her current writing and performance collaborations include jazz-house project with Chicago house legend Joe Smooth, trip-hop projects with her music collective Porcelain, and a starring contribution on official Fleetwood Mac tribute album Legacy, alongside Elton John and The Corrs among others.\\u00a0\\u00a0Tallulah continues to push creative boundaries through live blues collaborations with Tim Hain and new songwriting with Mick Fleetwood.Support ActSolur Jazz\\/Worldmusic Band Trio:with Peter Garvey(PHD Composer\\/Pianist),Henry Knudsen(Alto Sax) & Hide Takemoto(Guitar, UK Ambassador for Yamaha Music Corporation 2024 )\\u00a0World Music, Jazz, Latin Jazz\\u00a0 Solur Jazz Band presents a wide flavour of eclectic styles, showcasing the wide proliferation of Jazz and World Music. Music\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/gn-young-riverscribes\\/\",\"id\":\"943\",\"name\":\"Young Riverscribes\",\"title\":\"Young Riverscribes\",\"duration\":\"180 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Workshops & Classes\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768694400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14826\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">11:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768734000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1769904000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/15076\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">11:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769943600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1771113600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/22205\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">11:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1771153200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1772323200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/22004\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">11:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1772362800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1773532800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/23417\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">11:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1773572400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1774742400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/24202\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">11:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1774778400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768694400,1769904000,1771113600,1772323200,1773532800,1774742400],\"start_date\":\"1768734000\",\"end_date\":\"1774778400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"OEM3ZG90QlVDVVUxWE1XRnlPK1hWdz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sun 18 Jan - Sun 29 Mar 2026\",\"text\":\"Join Burnt Orange Theatre\\u2019s brand-new Young Riverscribes project, created in partnership with Riverside Studios.\\u201cBurnt Orange are a vital cog in the mad&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Join Burnt Orange Theatre\\u2019s brand-new Young Riverscribes project, created in partnership with Riverside Studios.\\u201cBurnt Orange are a vital cog in the mad machine that is the world of theatre: a world where chances are dwindling away for all but the very lucky who can afford it.\\u201d \\u2013 Everything Theatre\\u00a0Young Riverscribes is more than a youth theatre, it's a revolutionary creative platform designed with and for young people aged 14\\u201321. Over a series of dynamic workshops, you\\u2019ll gain the skills and confidence to collaborate, create, and perform both as an individual artist and as part of a thriving ensemble.\\u00a0At the heart of the project is Demystify, our unique built-in support system offering insider industry knowledge every step of the way. Expect Q&As, networking opportunities, guest professionals, and practical guidance that will help you navigate the creative industries with clarity and confidence.\\u00a0Each fortnightly session is led by the Burnt Orange team alongside special guests such as casting assistants, agents, drama school tutors, and working artists. Every workshop is tailored to the passions and needs of the group, covering:\\u00a0\\u25cf Performing scripted work\\u00a0\\u25cf Writing and devising\\u00a0\\u25cf Directing and creative leadership\\u00a0\\u25cf Screen acting skills\\u00a0\\u25cf Scratch night opportunities\\u00a0\\u25cf And any other creative roles you\\u2019re eager to explore\\u00a0\\u00a0Young Riverscribes is designed to grow with you; the more sessions you attend, the more your skills and creative relationships will develop. We encourage participants to commit to multiple sessions to build a collaborative ensemble, and discounted booking is available when you sign up for more than one.\\u00a0If cost is a barrier, free places are available. Just contact us directly at burntorange.theatre@gmail.com.\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u201cIt is evident to me that Burnt Orange Theatre understand young people, their context and what motivates them.\\u201d \\u2013 Workshop Feedback 2024\\u00a0Ready to take the leap? Book your place in Young Riverscribes today and start building your creative future.\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"72\"],\"search\":\"Young Riverscribes Young Riverscribes Workshops & Classes  <h3>Join Burnt Orange Theatre\\u2019s brand-new Young Riverscribes project, created in partnership with Riverside Studios.<\\/h3><blockquote><p>\\u201cBurnt Orange are a vital cog in the mad machine that is the world of theatre: a world where chances are dwindling away for all but the very lucky who can afford it.\\u201d \\u2013 Everything Theatre&nbsp;<\\/p><\\/blockquote><p><strong>Young Riverscribes <\\/strong>is more than a youth theatre, it's a revolutionary creative platform designed with and for young people aged 14\\u201321. Over a series of dynamic workshops, you\\u2019ll gain the skills and confidence to collaborate, create, and perform both as an individual artist and as part of a thriving ensemble.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>At the heart of the project is <strong>Demystify<\\/strong>, our unique built-in support system offering insider industry knowledge every step of the way. Expect Q&amp;As, networking opportunities, guest professionals, and practical guidance that will help you navigate the creative industries with clarity and confidence.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Each fortnightly session is led by the Burnt Orange team alongside special guests such as casting assistants, agents, drama school tutors, and working artists. Every workshop is tailored to the passions and needs of the group, covering:&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u25cf Performing scripted work&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u25cf Writing and devising&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u25cf Directing and creative leadership&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u25cf Screen acting skills&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u25cf Scratch night opportunities&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u25cf And any other creative roles you\\u2019re eager to explore&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Young Riverscribes is designed to grow with you; the more sessions you attend, the more your skills and creative relationships will develop. We encourage participants to commit to multiple sessions to build a collaborative ensemble, and discounted booking is available when you sign up for more than one.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>If cost is a barrier, free places are available. Just contact us directly at <a href=\\\"mailto:burntorange.theatre@gmail.com\\\"><strong>burntorange.theatre@gmail.com<\\/strong><\\/a>.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i>\\u201cIt is evident to me that Burnt Orange Theatre understand young people, their context and what motivates them.\\u201d<\\/i> \\u2013 Workshop Feedback 2024&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Ready to take the leap? Book your place in <strong>Young Riverscribes <\\/strong>today and start building your creative future.&nbsp;<\\/p> Young Riverscribes  Join Burnt Orange Theatre\\u2019s brand-new Young Riverscribes project, created in partnership with Riverside Studios.\\u201cBurnt Orange are a vital cog in the mad machine that is the world of theatre: a world where chances are dwindling away for all but the very lucky who can afford it.\\u201d \\u2013 Everything Theatre\\u00a0Young Riverscribes is more than a youth theatre, it's a revolutionary creative platform designed with and for young people aged 14\\u201321. Over a series of dynamic workshops, you\\u2019ll gain the skills and confidence to collaborate, create, and perform both as an individual artist and as part of a thriving ensemble.\\u00a0At the heart of the project is Demystify, our unique built-in support system offering insider industry knowledge every step of the way. Expect Q&As, networking opportunities, guest professionals, and practical guidance that will help you navigate the creative industries with clarity and confidence.\\u00a0Each fortnightly session is led by the Burnt Orange team alongside special guests such as casting assistants, agents, drama school tutors, and working artists. Every workshop is tailored to the passions and needs of the group, covering:\\u00a0\\u25cf Performing scripted work\\u00a0\\u25cf Writing and devising\\u00a0\\u25cf Directing and creative leadership\\u00a0\\u25cf Screen acting skills\\u00a0\\u25cf Scratch night opportunities\\u00a0\\u25cf And any other creative roles you\\u2019re eager to explore\\u00a0\\u00a0Young Riverscribes is designed to grow with you; the more sessions you attend, the more your skills and creative relationships will develop. We encourage participants to commit to multiple sessions to build a collaborative ensemble, and discounted booking is available when you sign up for more than one.\\u00a0If cost is a barrier, free places are available. Just contact us directly at burntorange.theatre@gmail.com.\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u201cIt is evident to me that Burnt Orange Theatre understand young people, their context and what motivates them.\\u201d \\u2013 Workshop Feedback 2024\\u00a0Ready to take the leap? Book your place in Young Riverscribes today and start building your creative future.\\u00a0 Workshops & Classes\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/g6-writing-dialogue\\/\",\"id\":\"977\",\"name\":\"Writing Dialogue\",\"title\":\"Writing Dialogue\",\"duration\":\"90 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Workshops & Classes\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768694400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/31201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">13:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768741200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768694400],\"start_date\":\"1768741200\",\"end_date\":\"1768741200\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"emM3RTF3bWhuUzRlWHZHRXJ2b2haZz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sun 18 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Led by Nick DawkinsThis workshop is an in-depth dive into dialogue - a crucial element of storytelling. We will look at how you can use dialogue to express&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.jpeg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Led by Nick DawkinsThis workshop is an in-depth dive into dialogue - a crucial element of storytelling. We will look at how you can use dialogue to express character, themes as well as subtle techniques to bury your exposition. What makes dialogue natural verses stylised, as well as how certain trends in dialogue have gone in and out of fashion over the years.All levels of experience are welcome, whether you're a writer for theatre, film, television, radio, or any other form of storytelling, we aim to help you discover and refine your own style of writing over the course of this workshop.\\u00a0Nick Dawkins is a writer and dramaturg whose last play, A Manchester Anthem, won multiple awards including Pleasance Pick of the VAULT Festival, Show of the Week VAULT Festival and Broadway Baby's Bobby Award, as well as being nominated twice for an Off West End Award and having a 3 week run at Riverside Studios. He has a MA in Writing for Stage and Broadcast Media from The Royal Central School of Speech and Drama and his work has been performed at Southwark Playhouse, The Space, The Vaults and The Pleasance Theatre.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/31201\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"72\"],\"search\":\"Writing Dialogue Writing Dialogue Workshops & Classes  <p><i><strong>Led by Nick Dawkins<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>This workshop is an in-depth dive into dialogue - a crucial element of storytelling. We will look at how you can use dialogue to express character, themes as well as subtle techniques to bury your exposition. What makes dialogue natural verses stylised, as well as how certain trends in dialogue have gone in and out of fashion over the years.<\\/p><p>All levels of experience are welcome, whether you're a writer for theatre, film, television, radio, or any other form of storytelling, we aim to help you discover and refine your own style of writing over the course of this workshop.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Nick Dawkins is a writer and dramaturg whose last play, <i><strong>A Manchester Anthem<\\/strong><\\/i>, won multiple awards including Pleasance Pick of the VAULT Festival, Show of the Week VAULT Festival and Broadway Baby's Bobby Award, as well as being nominated twice for an Off West End Award and having a 3 week run at Riverside Studios. He has a MA in Writing for Stage and Broadcast Media from The Royal Central School of Speech and Drama and his work has been performed at Southwark Playhouse, The Space, The Vaults and The Pleasance Theatre.<\\/p> Writing Dialogue  Led by Nick DawkinsThis workshop is an in-depth dive into dialogue - a crucial element of storytelling. We will look at how you can use dialogue to express character, themes as well as subtle techniques to bury your exposition. What makes dialogue natural verses stylised, as well as how certain trends in dialogue have gone in and out of fashion over the years.All levels of experience are welcome, whether you're a writer for theatre, film, television, radio, or any other form of storytelling, we aim to help you discover and refine your own style of writing over the course of this workshop.\\u00a0Nick Dawkins is a writer and dramaturg whose last play, A Manchester Anthem, won multiple awards including Pleasance Pick of the VAULT Festival, Show of the Week VAULT Festival and Broadway Baby's Bobby Award, as well as being nominated twice for an Off West End Award and having a 3 week run at Riverside Studios. He has a MA in Writing for Stage and Broadcast Media from The Royal Central School of Speech and Drama and his work has been performed at Southwark Playhouse, The Space, The Vaults and The Pleasance Theatre. Workshops & Classes\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/tH-pitchblack-mixtapes-40-witchy-winter\\/\",\"id\":\"1044\",\"name\":\"Pitchblack Mixtapes #40: Witchy Winter\",\"title\":\"Pitchblack Mixtapes #40: Witchy Winter\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Music\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768867200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"113\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/34601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768939200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768867200],\"start_date\":\"1768939200\",\"end_date\":\"1768939200\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"S2h3UW1EWGQxU3p4Vkc3YklzQ3liUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Tue 20 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Please arrive by event start time as latecomers will not be admitted&nbsp;It's Pitchblack Playback, only it's a themed mixtape instead of an album. AND&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/e58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/7ce58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/e58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7ce58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/e58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7ce58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/e58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7ce58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/e58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7ce58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/e58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7ce58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/e58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7ce58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/e58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7ce58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/e58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7ce58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/e58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7ce58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/e58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7ce58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/e58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7ce58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/e58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7ce58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/e58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7ce58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/e58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/7ce58b8945ca6a25e617114531fcfe15.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Please arrive by event start time as latecomers will not be admitted\\u00a0It's Pitchblack Playback, only it's a themed mixtape instead of an album. AND you can suggest tracks to feature in it!Expect the likes of Bj\\u00f6rk, Enya, Kate Bush, Ethel Cain, Tori Amos, Fever Ray and Bat For Lashes in this bespoke mixtape listening experience in the dark celebrating the music of ethereal and elemental Queens. You can also submit your suggestions for tracks via email to info@pitchblackplayback.com. The results will be mixed by Pitchblack Playback founder Ben Gomori in this bespoke mixtape - which will be available to listen to again on Mixcloud after the session.Hear it played loud, in the dark on our powerful Screen One sound system with no distractions, talking, singing or phones.\\u00a0\\\"This sounds great\\u201d \\u2014 Rick Rubin\\\"A fabulous idea\\\" \\u2014 Jay Kay, Jamiroquai<br. \\\"The optimal way to listen to an album\\\" \\u2014 Max Richter\\\"This might just be my favourite new thing to do\\\" \\u2014 Nihal, BBC Radio 5 Live\\u00a0Ticket includes Pitchblack Playback eye mask for extra darkness.\\u00a0As recommended by BBC 6Music, The Guardian, GQ and Time Out.\\u00a0Duration: 60 minutes\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/34601\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"113\"],\"search\":\"Pitchblack Mixtapes #40: Witchy Winter Pitchblack Mixtapes #40: Witchy Winter Music  <p><i><strong>Please arrive by event start time as latecomers will not be admitted<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>It's Pitchblack Playback, only it's a themed mixtape instead of an album. AND you can suggest tracks to feature in it!<\\/p><p>Expect the likes of Bj\\u00f6rk, Enya, Kate Bush, Ethel Cain, Tori Amos, Fever Ray and Bat For Lashes in this bespoke mixtape listening experience in the dark celebrating the music of ethereal and elemental Queens. You can also submit your suggestions for tracks via email to info@pitchblackplayback.com. The results will be mixed by Pitchblack Playback founder Ben Gomori in this bespoke mixtape - which will be available to listen to again on Mixcloud after the session.<\\/p><p>Hear it played loud, in the dark on our powerful Screen One sound system with no distractions, talking, singing or phones.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><blockquote><p>\\\"This sounds great\\u201d \\u2014 Rick Rubin<\\/p><p>\\\"A fabulous idea\\\" \\u2014 Jay Kay, Jamiroquai&lt;br. \\\"The optimal way to listen to an album\\\" \\u2014 Max Richter<\\/p><p>\\\"This might just be my favourite new thing to do\\\" \\u2014 Nihal, BBC Radio 5 Live<\\/p><\\/blockquote><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Ticket includes Pitchblack Playback eye mask for extra darkness.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>As recommended by BBC 6Music, The Guardian, GQ and Time Out.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Duration: 60 minutes<\\/strong><\\/p> Pitchblack Mixtapes #40: Witchy Winter  Please arrive by event start time as latecomers will not be admitted\\u00a0It's Pitchblack Playback, only it's a themed mixtape instead of an album. AND you can suggest tracks to feature in it!Expect the likes of Bj\\u00f6rk, Enya, Kate Bush, Ethel Cain, Tori Amos, Fever Ray and Bat For Lashes in this bespoke mixtape listening experience in the dark celebrating the music of ethereal and elemental Queens. You can also submit your suggestions for tracks via email to info@pitchblackplayback.com. The results will be mixed by Pitchblack Playback founder Ben Gomori in this bespoke mixtape - which will be available to listen to again on Mixcloud after the session.Hear it played loud, in the dark on our powerful Screen One sound system with no distractions, talking, singing or phones.\\u00a0\\\"This sounds great\\u201d \\u2014 Rick Rubin\\\"A fabulous idea\\\" \\u2014 Jay Kay, Jamiroquai<br. \\\"The optimal way to listen to an album\\\" \\u2014 Max Richter\\\"This might just be my favourite new thing to do\\\" \\u2014 Nihal, BBC Radio 5 Live\\u00a0Ticket includes Pitchblack Playback eye mask for extra darkness.\\u00a0As recommended by BBC 6Music, The Guardian, GQ and Time Out.\\u00a0Duration: 60 minutes Music\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/1B-introduction-to-puppetry-workshop\\/\",\"id\":\"587\",\"name\":\"Introduction to Puppetry Workshop\",\"title\":\"Introduction to Puppetry Workshop\",\"duration\":\"90 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Workshops & Classes\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1769040000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14886\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769104800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1769040000],\"start_date\":\"1769104800\",\"end_date\":\"1769104800\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"ZHZHUFRzZE1YTit4ZUtIWmxsSEtzdz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Thu 22 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"The Horgles are a puppetry duo consisting of Kyle Moss and Ceilb\\u00ed. They have worked with Oliver Award Winning Irish theatre company Fishamble and have&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1366\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1366\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1366\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1366\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1366\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1366\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1366\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1366\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1366\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1366\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"The Horgles are a puppetry duo consisting of Kyle Moss and Ceilb\\u00ed. They have worked with Oliver Award Winning Irish theatre company Fishamble and have collaborated with Theatre Deli, New Diorama, Theatre503 and Camden People\\u2019s Theatre.\\u00a0Ceilb\\u00ed is a queer trans non-binary puppetmaker, puppeteer, writer and director. Their show A Xerox of a Deer was a smash hit at Edinburgh Fringe in 2025, with Binge Fringe calling it one of the Top 25 shows to see!\\u00a0Kyle Moss is a puppeteer, writer, and performer. They were a BBC top 1% writer for 2025 and a Screen Ireland Finalist. They have studied puppetry at Little Angel Theatre under Oliver Hymans.\\u00a0\\u00a0In this workshop we will introduce you to the world of puppetry in relation to live theatrical performance. From Character, Voice, Movement and Breath work, we will start to understand what makes a puppet come to life.\\u00a0We perform with \\u2018Muppet-Style\\u2019 puppets, and will be teaching the basics of both rod arm and live hand.At the end of this Introduction to Puppetry workshop we will give you the tools to go out into the world and have the key fundamentals of puppetry performance in a theatrical set up.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14886\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"72\"],\"search\":\"Introduction to Puppetry Workshop Introduction to Puppetry Workshop Workshops & Classes  <p><strong>The Horgles<\\/strong> are a puppetry duo consisting of Kyle Moss and Ceilb\\u00ed. They have worked with <strong>Oliver Award Winning<\\/strong> Irish theatre company <strong>Fishamble <\\/strong>and have collaborated with <strong>Theatre Deli<\\/strong>, <strong>New Diorama<\\/strong>,<strong> Theatre503 <\\/strong>and <strong>Camden People\\u2019s Theatre<\\/strong>.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Ceilb\\u00ed is a queer trans non-binary puppetmaker, puppeteer, writer and director. Their show <i>A Xerox of a Deer<\\/i> was a smash hit at<strong> Edinburgh Fringe<\\/strong> in 2025, with Binge Fringe calling it one of the Top 25 shows to see!&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Kyle Moss is a puppeteer, writer, and performer. They were a <strong>BBC top 1% writer<\\/strong> for 2025 and a Screen Ireland Finalist. They have studied puppetry at Little Angel Theatre under Oliver Hymans.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>In this workshop we will introduce you to the world of puppetry in relation to live theatrical performance. From Character, Voice, Movement and Breath work, we will start to understand what makes a puppet come to life.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>We perform with \\u2018Muppet-Style\\u2019 puppets, and will be teaching the basics of both rod arm and live hand.<\\/p><p>At the end of this <strong>Introduction to Puppetry<\\/strong> workshop we will give you the tools to go out into the world and have the key fundamentals of puppetry performance in a theatrical set up.<\\/p> Introduction to Puppetry Workshop  The Horgles are a puppetry duo consisting of Kyle Moss and Ceilb\\u00ed. They have worked with Oliver Award Winning Irish theatre company Fishamble and have collaborated with Theatre Deli, New Diorama, Theatre503 and Camden People\\u2019s Theatre.\\u00a0Ceilb\\u00ed is a queer trans non-binary puppetmaker, puppeteer, writer and director. Their show A Xerox of a Deer was a smash hit at Edinburgh Fringe in 2025, with Binge Fringe calling it one of the Top 25 shows to see!\\u00a0Kyle Moss is a puppeteer, writer, and performer. They were a BBC top 1% writer for 2025 and a Screen Ireland Finalist. They have studied puppetry at Little Angel Theatre under Oliver Hymans.\\u00a0\\u00a0In this workshop we will introduce you to the world of puppetry in relation to live theatrical performance. From Character, Voice, Movement and Breath work, we will start to understand what makes a puppet come to life.\\u00a0We perform with \\u2018Muppet-Style\\u2019 puppets, and will be teaching the basics of both rod arm and live hand.At the end of this Introduction to Puppetry workshop we will give you the tools to go out into the world and have the key fundamentals of puppetry performance in a theatrical set up. Workshops & Classes\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/b9-national-theatre-live-hamlet\\/\",\"id\":\"634\",\"name\":\"National Theatre Live: Hamlet\",\"title\":\"National Theatre Live: Hamlet\",\"duration\":\"120 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Cinema\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1769040000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"101\",\"81004\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14896\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769108400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1769040000],\"start_date\":\"1769108400\",\"end_date\":\"1769108400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"tbc\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"U2hYcnMrdlJ2d1RNVFh1Q0hVQkR5dz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Thu 22 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"HamletBy William ShakespeareDirected by Robert Hastie&nbsp;Olivier Award-winner Hiran Abeysekera (Life of Pi) is Hamlet in this fearless, contemporary&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"HamletBy William ShakespeareDirected by Robert Hastie\\u00a0Olivier Award-winner Hiran Abeysekera (Life of Pi) is Hamlet in this fearless, contemporary take on Shakespeare\\u2019s famous tragedy.Trapped between duty and doubt, surrounded by power and privilege, young Prince Hamlet dares to ask the ultimate question \\u2013 you know the one.National Theatre Deputy Artistic Director, Robert Hastie (Standing at the Sky\\u2019s Edge, Operation Mincemeat) directs this sharp, stylish and darkly funny reimagining.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14896\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"101\"],\"event_age_ratings\":[\"81004\"],\"search\":\"National Theatre Live: Hamlet National Theatre Live: Hamlet Cinema  <p><strong>Hamlet<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>By William Shakespeare<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>Directed by Robert Hastie<\\/strong><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Olivier Award-winner <\\/strong>Hiran Abeysekera (<i>Life of Pi<\\/i>) is Hamlet in this fearless, contemporary take on Shakespeare\\u2019s famous tragedy.<\\/p><p>Trapped between duty and doubt, surrounded by power and privilege, young Prince Hamlet dares to ask the ultimate question \\u2013 you know the one.<\\/p><p>National Theatre Deputy Artistic Director, Robert Hastie (<i>Standing at the Sky\\u2019s Edge<\\/i>, <i>Operation Mincemeat<\\/i>) directs this sharp, stylish and darkly funny reimagining.<\\/p> National Theatre Live: Hamlet  HamletBy William ShakespeareDirected by Robert Hastie\\u00a0Olivier Award-winner Hiran Abeysekera (Life of Pi) is Hamlet in this fearless, contemporary take on Shakespeare\\u2019s famous tragedy.Trapped between duty and doubt, surrounded by power and privilege, young Prince Hamlet dares to ask the ultimate question \\u2013 you know the one.National Theatre Deputy Artistic Director, Robert Hastie (Standing at the Sky\\u2019s Edge, Operation Mincemeat) directs this sharp, stylish and darkly funny reimagining. Cinema TBC\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/9a-the-jolly-djembe-club\\/\",\"id\":\"917\",\"name\":\"The Jolly Djembe Club\",\"title\":\"The Jolly Djembe Club\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Workshops & Classes\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1769212800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/22603\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">11:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769252400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1769212800],\"start_date\":\"1769252400\",\"end_date\":\"1769259600\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"VTBjVnNlbmY0VktWc3RQTEE2Wk5hZz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 24 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Don't miss out on an unforgettable cultural adventure at Riverside Studios! Join Mangotree Kids as we bring the vibrant energy of Africa to life with&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1269\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1269\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1269\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1269\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1269\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1269\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1269\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1269\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1269\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1269\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Don't miss out on an unforgettable cultural adventure at Riverside Studios! Join Mangotree Kids as we bring the vibrant energy of Africa to life with our\\u00a0Jolly Djembe African Drumming\\u00a0session. Kids will embark on a thrilling journey to discover the rhythms of Africa, learning the art of African Djembe drumming, new songs, and infectious beats.\\u00a0But that's not all\\u2014young adventurers will also take part in an exciting mission to help us save our endangered mangoes before the rainy season arrives through our inactive storytelling. This is a celebration filled with music, fun, and cultural exploration.\\u00a0Book your spot now\\u00a0for a magical experience like no other!\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/22603\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"72\"],\"search\":\"The Jolly Djembe Club The Jolly Djembe Club Workshops & Classes  <p>Don't miss out on an unforgettable cultural adventure at Riverside Studios! Join Mangotree Kids as we bring the vibrant energy of Africa to life with our&nbsp;<strong>Jolly Djembe African Drumming<\\/strong>&nbsp;session. Kids will embark on a thrilling journey to discover the rhythms of Africa, learning the art of African Djembe drumming, new songs, and infectious beats.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>But that's not all\\u2014young adventurers will also take part in an exciting mission to help us save our endangered mangoes before the rainy season arrives through our inactive storytelling. This is a celebration filled with music, fun, and cultural exploration.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Book your spot now<\\/strong>&nbsp;for a magical experience like no other!<\\/p> The Jolly Djembe Club  Don't miss out on an unforgettable cultural adventure at Riverside Studios! Join Mangotree Kids as we bring the vibrant energy of Africa to life with our\\u00a0Jolly Djembe African Drumming\\u00a0session. Kids will embark on a thrilling journey to discover the rhythms of Africa, learning the art of African Djembe drumming, new songs, and infectious beats.\\u00a0But that's not all\\u2014young adventurers will also take part in an exciting mission to help us save our endangered mangoes before the rainy season arrives through our inactive storytelling. This is a celebration filled with music, fun, and cultural exploration.\\u00a0Book your spot now\\u00a0for a magical experience like no other! Workshops & Classes\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/9X-the-self-producing-artist\\/\",\"id\":\"919\",\"name\":\"The Self-Producing Artist\",\"title\":\"The Self-Producing Artist\",\"duration\":\"90 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Workshops & Classes\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1769299200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14942\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">13:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769346000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1769299200],\"start_date\":\"1769346000\",\"end_date\":\"1769346000\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"bDBIdnRyQ0xadkQ3TkJ0SlhpdkFoZz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sun 25 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Led by Arielle ZilkhaLed by Psychonaut\\u2019s Managing Director, Arielle Zilkha, this workshop is designed for artists at any level who want to step into the&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1466\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1466\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1466\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1466\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1466\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1466\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1466\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1466\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1466\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1466\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Led by Arielle ZilkhaLed by Psychonaut\\u2019s Managing Director, Arielle Zilkha, this workshop is designed for artists at any level who want to step into the role of producer and take strategic control of their work. The session will reframe your artistic practice through a producer\\u2019s lens, covering how to build a sustainable creative ecosystem around your work, whether you operate independently or as a company. You\\u2019ll gain practical insight into developing a clear artistic identity supported by a strong branding and production strategy.\\u00a0We\\u2019ll explore essential producing skills such as building strategic partnerships, carving out your niche, strengthening your project pipeline, and raising your profile through targeted marketing and PR. The workshop blends hands-on exercises, reflective tasks, and open discussions. By the end, you\\u2019ll walk away with actionable tools and strategies, and a clearer roadmap for developing a distinctive, professional presence within London\\u2019s cultural landscape.\\u00a0\\u00a0Arielle Zilkha is the Founder and Managing Director of Psychonaut Theatre, an international hub for performance artists, which she founded in 2021. She works as a multidisciplinary producer, theatre-maker, performer and composer across the London and international fringe scene, having trained on BA Acting and Performance at Wimbledon College of Arts and MA Advanced Theatre Practice at Royal Central School of Speech and Drama. She has produced and performed in Psychonaut productions in venues such as Tate Britain, The Koppel Project, Camden People\\u2019s Theatre and Riverside Studios.Her producing practice sees her bring international productions to London, working with organisations such as the Nordisk Teaterlaboratorium (Denmark). As the director of Psychonaut, she strives to create a space for international performance practices to be explored and for an alternative performance scene to thrive in the U.K.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14942\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"72\"],\"search\":\"The Self-Producing Artist The Self-Producing Artist Workshops & Classes  <p><i><strong>Led by Arielle Zilkha<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Led by Psychonaut\\u2019s <strong>Managing Director<\\/strong>, Arielle Zilkha, this workshop is designed for artists at any level who want to step into the role of producer and take strategic control of their work. The session will reframe your artistic practice through a producer\\u2019s lens, covering how to build a sustainable creative ecosystem around your work, whether you operate independently or as a company. You\\u2019ll gain practical insight into developing a clear artistic identity supported by a strong branding and production strategy.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>We\\u2019ll explore essential producing skills such as building strategic partnerships, carving out your niche, strengthening your project pipeline, and raising your profile through targeted marketing and PR. The workshop blends hands-on exercises, reflective tasks, and open discussions. By the end, you\\u2019ll walk away with actionable tools and strategies, and a clearer roadmap for developing a distinctive, professional presence within London\\u2019s cultural landscape.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Arielle Zilkha <\\/strong><\\/i>is the Founder and Managing Director of <strong>Psychonaut Theatre<\\/strong>, an international hub for performance artists, which she founded in 2021. She works as a multidisciplinary producer, theatre-maker, performer and composer across the London and international fringe scene, having trained on BA Acting and Performance at Wimbledon College of Arts and MA Advanced Theatre Practice at Royal Central School of Speech and Drama. She has produced and performed in Psychonaut productions in venues such as Tate Britain, The Koppel Project, Camden People\\u2019s Theatre and Riverside Studios.<\\/p><p>Her producing practice sees her bring international productions to London, working with organisations such as the Nordisk Teaterlaboratorium (Denmark). As the director of Psychonaut, she strives to create a space for international performance practices to be explored and for an alternative performance scene to thrive in the U.K.<\\/p> The Self-Producing Artist  Led by Arielle ZilkhaLed by Psychonaut\\u2019s Managing Director, Arielle Zilkha, this workshop is designed for artists at any level who want to step into the role of producer and take strategic control of their work. The session will reframe your artistic practice through a producer\\u2019s lens, covering how to build a sustainable creative ecosystem around your work, whether you operate independently or as a company. You\\u2019ll gain practical insight into developing a clear artistic identity supported by a strong branding and production strategy.\\u00a0We\\u2019ll explore essential producing skills such as building strategic partnerships, carving out your niche, strengthening your project pipeline, and raising your profile through targeted marketing and PR. The workshop blends hands-on exercises, reflective tasks, and open discussions. By the end, you\\u2019ll walk away with actionable tools and strategies, and a clearer roadmap for developing a distinctive, professional presence within London\\u2019s cultural landscape.\\u00a0\\u00a0Arielle Zilkha is the Founder and Managing Director of Psychonaut Theatre, an international hub for performance artists, which she founded in 2021. She works as a multidisciplinary producer, theatre-maker, performer and composer across the London and international fringe scene, having trained on BA Acting and Performance at Wimbledon College of Arts and MA Advanced Theatre Practice at Royal Central School of Speech and Drama. She has produced and performed in Psychonaut productions in venues such as Tate Britain, The Koppel Project, Camden People\\u2019s Theatre and Riverside Studios.Her producing practice sees her bring international productions to London, working with organisations such as the Nordisk Teaterlaboratorium (Denmark). As the director of Psychonaut, she strives to create a space for international performance practices to be explored and for an alternative performance scene to thrive in the U.K. Workshops & Classes\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/1u-beat-the-stress-djembe-drumming-for-adults\\/\",\"id\":\"559\",\"name\":\"Beat the Stress: Djembe Drumming for Adults\",\"title\":\"Beat the Stress: Djembe Drumming for Adults\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Wellness\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1769299200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\",\"59\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/23601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769349600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1769299200],\"start_date\":\"1769349600\",\"end_date\":\"1769353200\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"dzkvQnJnYUVLa081QWRCdm1FUFdzdz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sun 25 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"\\u201cEyes closed and listening to the rhythm of the drum\\u201dLife can feel overwhelming at times \\u2014 but stress doesn\\u2019t have to win. Beat the Stress is your chance&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/92\\/7d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx83\\/cy3\\/cw614\\/ch613\\/images\\/uploads\\/927d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771.jpeg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/92\\/7d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771\\/w750\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx83\\/cy3\\/cw614\\/ch613\\/images\\/uploads\\/927d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/92\\/7d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771\\/w750\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx83\\/cy3\\/cw614\\/ch613\\/images\\/uploads\\/927d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/92\\/7d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771\\/w750\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx83\\/cy3\\/cw614\\/ch613\\/images\\/uploads\\/927d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/92\\/7d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771\\/w750\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx83\\/cy3\\/cw614\\/ch613\\/images\\/uploads\\/927d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/92\\/7d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771\\/w750\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx83\\/cy3\\/cw614\\/ch613\\/images\\/uploads\\/927d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/92\\/7d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771\\/w750\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx83\\/cy3\\/cw614\\/ch613\\/images\\/uploads\\/927d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/92\\/7d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771\\/w750\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx83\\/cy3\\/cw614\\/ch613\\/images\\/uploads\\/927d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/92\\/7d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771\\/w750\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx83\\/cy3\\/cw614\\/ch613\\/images\\/uploads\\/927d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/92\\/7d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771\\/w750\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx83\\/cy3\\/cw614\\/ch613\\/images\\/uploads\\/927d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/92\\/7d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771\\/w750\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx83\\/cy3\\/cw614\\/ch613\\/images\\/uploads\\/927d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/92\\/7d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771\\/w750\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx83\\/cy3\\/cw614\\/ch613\\/images\\/uploads\\/927d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/92\\/7d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771\\/w750\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx83\\/cy3\\/cw614\\/ch613\\/images\\/uploads\\/927d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/92\\/7d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771\\/w750\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx83\\/cy3\\/cw614\\/ch613\\/images\\/uploads\\/927d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/92\\/7d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771\\/w750\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx83\\/cy3\\/cw614\\/ch613\\/images\\/uploads\\/927d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"\\u201cEyes closed and listening to the rhythm of the drum\\u201dLife can feel overwhelming at times \\u2014 but stress doesn\\u2019t have to win. Beat the Stress is your chance to let it all go through the powerful, uplifting energy of African Djembe drumming.Step into the ultimate drum circle, where every beat helps you release tension, spark creativity, and connect with the ancient rhythms of Africa. Discover the joy of learning new patterns, embrace Rhythm Meditation, and experience the deep calm and joy of Djembe.Be part of our Djembe Revolution!\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/23601\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"72\",\"59\"],\"search\":\"Beat the Stress: Djembe Drumming for Adults Beat the Stress: Djembe Drumming for Adults Wellness  <h3>\\u201cEyes closed and listening to the rhythm of the drum\\u201d<\\/h3><p>Life can feel overwhelming at times \\u2014 but stress doesn\\u2019t have to win. <strong>Beat the Stress <\\/strong>is your chance to let it all go through the powerful, uplifting energy of <strong>African Djembe drumming<\\/strong>.<\\/p><p>Step into the <strong>ultimate drum circle<\\/strong>, where every beat helps you release tension, spark creativity, and connect with the ancient rhythms of Africa. Discover the joy of learning new patterns, embrace Rhythm Meditation, and experience the deep calm and joy of Djembe.<\\/p><p><strong>Be part of our Djembe Revolution!<\\/strong><\\/p> Beat the Stress: Djembe Drumming for Adults  \\u201cEyes closed and listening to the rhythm of the drum\\u201dLife can feel overwhelming at times \\u2014 but stress doesn\\u2019t have to win. Beat the Stress is your chance to let it all go through the powerful, uplifting energy of African Djembe drumming.Step into the ultimate drum circle, where every beat helps you release tension, spark creativity, and connect with the ancient rhythms of Africa. Discover the joy of learning new patterns, embrace Rhythm Meditation, and experience the deep calm and joy of Djembe.Be part of our Djembe Revolution! Workshops & Classes Wellness\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/tD-disremember-qa\\/\",\"id\":\"1050\",\"name\":\"Disremember + Q&A\",\"title\":\"Disremember + Q&A\",\"duration\":\"84 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Cinema\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1769472000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"321\",\"101\",\"80811\",\"80998\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/34801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769537700\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1769472000],\"start_date\":\"1769537700\",\"end_date\":\"1769537700\",\"age_rating_class\":\"18\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"SEtkSWVpNFpIdmRVdm82NmhVbnIzZz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Tue 27 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"London Breeze is delighted to have an opportunity to bring the winner of its Best Feature Fiction award for 2025, taut psychological thriller, DISREMEMBER,&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/24\\/54d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx773\\/cw2165\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/2454d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/24\\/54d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx773\\/cw2165\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/2454d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/24\\/54d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx773\\/cw2165\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/2454d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/24\\/54d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx773\\/cw2165\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/2454d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/24\\/54d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx773\\/cw2165\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/2454d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/24\\/54d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx773\\/cw2165\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/2454d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/24\\/54d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx773\\/cw2165\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/2454d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/24\\/54d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx773\\/cw2165\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/2454d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/24\\/54d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx773\\/cw2165\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/2454d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/24\\/54d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx773\\/cw2165\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/2454d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/24\\/54d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx773\\/cw2165\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/2454d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/24\\/54d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx773\\/cw2165\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/2454d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/24\\/54d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx773\\/cw2165\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/2454d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/24\\/54d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx773\\/cw2165\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/2454d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/24\\/54d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx773\\/cw2165\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/2454d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03fb5c5c.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"London Breeze is delighted to have an opportunity to bring the winner of its Best Feature Fiction award for 2025, taut psychological thriller, DISREMEMBER, to the Riverside Studios. \\u00a0After learning his wife wants a divorce, a struggling alcoholic wakes up unexpectedly in his friend\\u2019s apartment with no memory of how he got there. As Rob tries to piece together what happened, the blackouts continue, leaving him in unfamiliar places with no recollection of how he got there. Determined to regain control, he installs CCTV cameras\\u2014only to discover something far more disturbing than he ever imagined. A truth his own mind refuses to remember.Writer, director and actor, Matthew Simpson, will join us after the film to talk about his extraordinary journey to making his multi award winning debut feature as a solo filmmaker. Come and be inspired.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/34801\\/\",\"event_age_ratings\":[\"80998\"],\"event_type\":[\"101\"],\"cinema\":[\"80811\",\"321\"],\"search\":\"Disremember + Q&A Disremember + Q&A Cinema  <p><strong>London Breeze<\\/strong> is delighted to have an opportunity to bring the winner of its Best Feature Fiction award for 2025, taut psychological thriller, DISREMEMBER, to the Riverside Studios. &nbsp;<\\/p><p>After learning his wife wants a divorce, a struggling alcoholic wakes up unexpectedly in his friend\\u2019s apartment with no memory of how he got there. As Rob tries to piece together what happened, the blackouts continue, leaving him in unfamiliar places with no recollection of how he got there. Determined to regain control, he installs CCTV cameras\\u2014only to discover something far more disturbing than he ever imagined. A truth his own mind refuses to remember.<\\/p><p>Writer, director and actor, Matthew Simpson, will join us after the film to talk about his extraordinary journey to making his multi award winning debut feature as a solo filmmaker. Come and be inspired.<\\/p> Disremember + Q&A  London Breeze is delighted to have an opportunity to bring the winner of its Best Feature Fiction award for 2025, taut psychological thriller, DISREMEMBER, to the Riverside Studios. \\u00a0After learning his wife wants a divorce, a struggling alcoholic wakes up unexpectedly in his friend\\u2019s apartment with no memory of how he got there. As Rob tries to piece together what happened, the blackouts continue, leaving him in unfamiliar places with no recollection of how he got there. Determined to regain control, he installs CCTV cameras\\u2014only to discover something far more disturbing than he ever imagined. A truth his own mind refuses to remember.Writer, director and actor, Matthew Simpson, will join us after the film to talk about his extraordinary journey to making his multi award winning debut feature as a solo filmmaker. Come and be inspired. 18 Cinema Q&A London Breeze Film Festival\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/b2-queer-poetry-open-mic-night\\/\",\"id\":\"670\",\"name\":\"Queer Poetry Open Mic Night\",\"title\":\"Queer Poetry Open Mic Night\",\"duration\":\"180 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Theatre\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1769472000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14982\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769540400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1769472000],\"start_date\":\"1769540400\",\"end_date\":\"1769540400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"VktQTFRCUlNRNEFlRllhNUgyUEdQZz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Tue 27 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Hey there! We are collaborating with S-BARS to bring you a Queer Poetry Open Mic night!&nbsp;Bring your poems and perform for a supportive and kind audience!&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/74\\/15253382a160490cb50937855cd909\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx54\\/cy200\\/cw1220\\/ch1220\\/images\\/uploads\\/7415253382a160490cb50937855cd909.jpeg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/74\\/15253382a160490cb50937855cd909\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx54\\/cy200\\/cw1220\\/ch1220\\/images\\/uploads\\/7415253382a160490cb50937855cd909.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/74\\/15253382a160490cb50937855cd909\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx54\\/cy200\\/cw1220\\/ch1220\\/images\\/uploads\\/7415253382a160490cb50937855cd909.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/74\\/15253382a160490cb50937855cd909\\/w1352\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx54\\/cy200\\/cw1220\\/ch1220\\/images\\/uploads\\/7415253382a160490cb50937855cd909.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/74\\/15253382a160490cb50937855cd909\\/w1352\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx54\\/cy200\\/cw1220\\/ch1220\\/images\\/uploads\\/7415253382a160490cb50937855cd909.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/74\\/15253382a160490cb50937855cd909\\/w1352\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx54\\/cy200\\/cw1220\\/ch1220\\/images\\/uploads\\/7415253382a160490cb50937855cd909.webp 