 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Hey there! We are collaborating with S-BARS to bring you a Queer Poetry Open Mic night!\\u00a0Bring your poems and perform for a supportive and kind audience! OR come along and listen to lots of wonderful poets sharing their art!\\u00a06:30pm: Doors7:00pm: Event starts10:00pm: Event finishes\\u00a0\\u00a0Please note there are open mic slots available for purchase\\u00a0online\\u00a0and there will be a limited amount of\\u00a0sign up spaces on the door!\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14982\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"3\"],\"search\":\"Queer Poetry Open Mic Night Queer Poetry Open Mic Night Theatre  <p>Hey there! We are collaborating with <strong>S-BARS <\\/strong>to bring you a <strong>Queer Poetry Open Mic night<\\/strong>!&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Bring your poems and perform for a supportive and kind audience! OR come along and listen to lots of wonderful poets sharing their art!<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>6:30pm: Doors<\\/p><p>7:00pm: Event starts<\\/p><p>10:00pm: Event finishes&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i>Please note there are open mic slots available for purchase<strong>&nbsp;online<\\/strong>&nbsp;and there will be a <strong>limited amount <\\/strong>of&nbsp;sign up spaces on the door!<\\/i><\\/p> Queer Poetry Open Mic Night  Hey there! We are collaborating with S-BARS to bring you a Queer Poetry Open Mic night!\\u00a0Bring your poems and perform for a supportive and kind audience! OR come along and listen to lots of wonderful poets sharing their art!\\u00a06:30pm: Doors7:00pm: Event starts10:00pm: Event finishes\\u00a0\\u00a0Please note there are open mic slots available for purchase\\u00a0online\\u00a0and there will be a limited amount of\\u00a0sign up spaces on the door! Theatre\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/g0-london-short-film-festival-showcase-palestine-looks-back\\/\",\"id\":\"974\",\"name\":\"London Short Film Festival Showcase: Palestine Looks Back\",\"tit