cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1600\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1600\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1600\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1600\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1600\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1600\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1600\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Palestinian voices who dared to go beyond what was asked, turning their gaze back on the West - its inaction, border regimes, colonial history, but also its solidarity and environment.This programme is curated by Theo Panagopoulos.\\u00a0The Goodness Regime, dir. Jumana Manna and Sille Storihle, Norway \\/ Palestine 2013, 20minsIt's a long way from Amphioxus, dir. Kamal Aljafari, Germany 2019, 16minsNachbarn (Neighbours), dir. Pary El-Qalqili and Christiane Schmidt, Germany 2018, 26 minsElefsina Notre Amour, dir. Mahdi Fleifel, Greece 2023, 9minsThey Live in Forests, They are Extremely Shy, dir. Saeed Taji Farouky, UK 2016, 4minsWe began by measuring distance, dir. Basma Alsharif, Egypt 2009, 19mins\\u00a0Contains themes of death and injury.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/31401\\/\",\"event_age_ratings\":[\"80998\"],\"event_type\":[\"101\"],\"search\":\"London Short Film Festival Showcase: Palestine Looks Back London Short Film Festival Showcase: Palestine Looks Back Cinema  <p><i>Palestinian voices who dared to go beyond what was asked, turning their gaze back on the West - its inaction, border regimes, colonial history, but also its solidarity and environment.<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>This programme is curated by Theo Panagopoulos.<\\/i><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>The Goodness Regime, dir. Jumana Manna and Sille Storihle, Norway \\/ Palestine 2013, 20mins<\\/p><p>It's a long way from Amphioxus, dir. Kamal Aljafari, Germany 2019, 16mins<\\/p><p>Nachbarn (Neighbours), dir. Pary El-Qalqili and Christiane Schmidt, Germany 2018, 26 mins<\\/p><p>Elefsina Notre Amour, dir. Mahdi Fleifel, Greece 2023, 9mins<\\/p><p>They Live in Forests, They are Extremely Shy, dir. Saeed Taji Farouky, UK 2016, 4mins<\\/p><p>We began by measuring distance, dir. Basma Alsharif, Egypt 2009, 19mins<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Contains themes of death and injury.<\\/p> London Short Film Festival Showcase: Palestine Looks Back  Palestinian voices who dared to go beyond what was asked, turning their gaze back on the West - its inaction, border regimes, colonial history, but also its solidarity and environment.This programme is curated by Theo Panagopoulos.\\u00a0The Goodness Regime, dir. Jumana Manna and Sille Storihle, Norway \\/ Palestine 2013, 20minsIt's a long way from Amphioxus, dir. Kamal Aljafari, Germany 2019, 16minsNachbarn (Neighbours), dir. Pary El-Qalqili and Christiane Schmidt, Germany 2018, 26 minsElefsina Notre Amour, dir. Mahdi Fleifel, Greece 2023, 9minsThey Live in Forests, They are Extremely Shy, dir. Saeed Taji Farouky, UK 2016, 4minsWe began by measuring distance, dir. Basma Alsharif, Egypt 2009, 19mins\\u00a0Contains themes of death and injury. 18 Cinema\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/b1-mime-principles\\/\",\"id\":\"629\",\"name\":\"Mime Principles\",\"title\":\"Mime Principles\",\"duration\":\"90 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Workshops & Classes\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1769817600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"72\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/15052\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">13:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769864400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1769817600],\"start_date\":\"1769864400\",\"end_date\":\"1769864400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"L0JDbUQwbjE5MWVFcjJIWldOaDFxdz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 31 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Led by Francesca Fatichenti and Tom PerryThis workshop is a close look at mime, an important element of physical theatre. We will look at manipulation,&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.jpeg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Led by Francesca Fatichenti and Tom PerryThis workshop is a close look at mime, an important element of physical theatre. We will look at manipulation, fix point, character change, storytelling techniques, the 20 Lecoq elements, walks and other essential elements to compose a mime sequence.\\u00a0All levels are welcome, whether you are an experienced physical actor looking to refresh your tools, or you just want to try something completely new. We will aim to reconnect you with your body, and expand your ability to narrate a story through it.\\u00a0Francesca Fatichenti is an actress who trained extensively in physical theatre and Commedia dell\\u2019Arte, clowning, Lecoq and Decroux technique. She has worked with renowned masters including Philippe Gaulier and Carlo Boso. Her credits in physical theatre include Retrogusto Pop (Italy, 2025), The Green Bird (Edinburgh, 2023), Le Songe d\\u2019une Nuit d\\u2019\\u00c9t\\u00e9 (Italy\\u2013France, 2023), and La Folie d\\u2019Isabella (Avignon, 2022). She has also performed at the National Theatre of Italy, Tate Britain and National Theatre of Romania. She is the Artistic Director of Psychonaut Theatre.\\u00a0Tom Parry is the founder and co-principle of the mime company \\u2018Partners in Mime\\u2019 - a group that specialises in the provision of engaging interactive entertainment. Tom is trained in the methods belonging to the national circus academy of Ukraine by internationally acclaimed mime artist Anetta Anisimova. In addition to his work in entertainment, Tom is also active in the cabaret and alternative comedy circuit. This includes \\u2018A brief foray into online dating\\u2019 in collaboration with Francesca Fatichenti.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/15052\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"72\"],\"search\":\"Mime Principles Mime Principles Workshops & Classes  <p><i><strong>Led by Francesca Fatichenti and Tom Perry<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>This workshop is a close look at mime, an important element of physical theatre. We will look at manipulation, fix point, character change, storytelling techniques, the 20 Lecoq elements, walks and other essential elements to compose a mime sequence.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>All levels are welcome, whether you are an experienced physical actor looking to refresh your tools, or you just want to try something completely new. We will aim to reconnect you with your body, and expand your ability to narrate a story through it.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Francesca Fatichenti<\\/strong> is an actress who trained extensively in physical theatre and Commedia dell\\u2019Arte, clowning, Lecoq and Decroux technique. She has worked with renowned masters including Philippe Gaulier and Carlo Boso. Her credits in physical theatre include Retrogusto Pop (Italy, 2025), The Green Bird (Edinburgh, 2023), Le Songe d\\u2019une Nuit d\\u2019\\u00c9t\\u00e9 (Italy\\u2013France, 2023), and La Folie d\\u2019Isabella (Avignon, 2022). She has also performed at the National Theatre of Italy, Tate Britain and National Theatre of Romania. She is the <strong>Artistic Director of Psychonaut Theatre<\\/strong>.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Tom Parry<\\/strong> is the founder and co-principle of the mime company \\u2018Partners in Mime\\u2019 - a group that specialises in the provision of engaging interactive entertainment. Tom is trained in the methods belonging to the national circus academy of Ukraine by internationally acclaimed mime artist Anetta Anisimova. In addition to his work in entertainment, Tom is also active in the cabaret and alternative comedy circuit. This includes \\u2018A brief foray into online dating\\u2019 in collaboration with Francesca Fatichenti.<\\/p> Mime Principles  Led by Francesca Fatichenti and Tom PerryThis workshop is a close look at mime, an important element of physical theatre. We will look at manipulation, fix point, character change, storytelling techniques, the 20 Lecoq elements, walks and other essential elements to compose a mime sequence.\\u00a0All levels are welcome, whether you are an experienced physical actor looking to refresh your tools, or you just want to try something completely new. We will aim to reconnect you with your body, and expand your ability to narrate a story through it.\\u00a0Francesca Fatichenti is an actress who trained extensively in physical theatre and Commedia dell\\u2019Arte, clowning, Lecoq and Decroux technique. She has worked with renowned masters including Philippe Gaulier and Carlo Boso. Her credits in physical theatre include Retrogusto Pop (Italy, 2025), The Green Bird (Edinburgh, 2023), Le Songe d\\u2019une Nuit d\\u2019\\u00c9t\\u00e9 (Italy\\u2013France, 2023), and La Folie d\\u2019Isabella (Avignon, 2022). She has also performed at the National Theatre of Italy, Tate Britain and National Theatre of Romania. She is the Artistic Director of Psychonaut Theatre.\\u00a0Tom Parry is the founder and co-principle of the mime company \\u2018Partners in Mime\\u2019 - a group that specialises in the provision of engaging interactive entertainment. Tom is trained in the methods belonging to the national circus academy of Ukraine by internationally acclaimed mime artist Anetta Anisimova. In addition to his work in entertainment, Tom is also active in the cabaret and alternative comedy circuit. This includes \\u2018A brief foray into online dating\\u2019 in collaboration with Francesca Fatichenti. Workshops & Classes\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/1J-hancock-xi\\/\",\"id\":\"582\",\"name\":\"Hancock XI\",\"title\":\"Hancock XI\",\"duration\":\"150 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Cinema\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1769817600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"101\",\"81002\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/15060\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769868000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1769817600],\"start_date\":\"1769868000\",\"end_date\":\"1769868000\",\"age_rating_class\":\"pg\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"RStJVzNTZWF2eklMMXlycHFqNGkwQT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 31 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Proudly presented as part of our MADE AT RIVERSIDE TV strand; celebrating the long history of film and TV production at Riverside Studios. Here we continue&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/