w332\\/ch332\\/images\\/uploads\\/c8c5479e7188f6018cf9e34dbc0e3315.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/c8\\/c5479e7188f6018cf9e34dbc0e3315\\/w546\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx214\\/cy11\\/cw332\\/ch332\\/images\\/uploads\\/c8c5479e7188f6018cf9e34dbc0e3315.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Mad Jacks Theatre presents the hot and horny return of their sell-out scratch night: SEX SELLS!Themed around sex, kink and intimacy, you're in for eight jaw-droppingly raunchy and sensually multidisciplinary work-in-progress performances spanning cabaret, comedy, new writing and music.Following the raucous success of WE FACE A SHINING FUTURE and BRIGHT, BRIGHT, this promises to be the half-mental, half-magic event of the year.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/37201\\/\",\"event_type\":[\"3\"],\"search\":\"SEX SELLS! SEX SELLS! Theatre  <p><strong>Mad Jacks Theatre<\\/strong> presents the hot and horny return of their sell-out scratch night: <strong>SEX SELLS!<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Themed around sex, kink and intimacy, you're in for eight jaw-droppingly raunchy and sensually multidisciplinary work-in-progress performances spanning cabaret, comedy, new writing and music.<\\/p><p>Following the raucous success of <i>WE FACE A SHINING FUTURE <\\/i>and <i>BRIGHT, BRIGHT<\\/i>, this promises to be the half-mental, half-magic event of the year.<\\/p> SEX SELLS!  Mad Jacks Theatre presents the hot and horny return of their sell-out scratch night: SEX SELLS!Themed around sex, kink and intimacy, you're in for eight jaw-droppingly raunchy and sensually multidisciplinary work-in-progress performances spanning cabaret, comedy, new writing and music.Following the raucous success of WE FACE A SHINING FUTURE and BRIGHT, BRIGHT, this promises to be the half-mental, half-magic event of the year. Theatre\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/by-riverscribes-introduction-to-screenwriting\\/\",\"id\":\"676\",\"