k\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Have you ever watched a bad film and thought \\u2018I can do better than that?\\u2019 The chances are you can!Join Netflix screenwriter Henry Fitzherbert for a series of workshops that strip away the mystique of writing for the screen in a fun and collaborative environment.It\\u2019s Henry\\u2019s firm belief that anyone, armed with the right tools, can write a screenplay and you\\u2019ll explore all the essentials of the craft - from what makes a compelling character - to theme, structure and story world.Bring your own idea or draft screenplay to discuss with the group, or simply come to be inspired with like-minded creatives.The sessions are open to complete beginners, or more experienced writers looking for inspiration.Don\\u2019t just dream. Do it!\\u00a0About Henry Fitzherbert:Henry is a screenwriter for film and television and will bring a wealth of experience and insights from working with Hollywood studios, streamers, A-list actors and directors and numerous British and American production companies.He co-wrote the hit Netflix series WYATT EARP & THE COWBOY WAR (2024), which reached Number 3 globally and was a top ten hit in 47 countries. Narrated by Ed Harris, the series explores the legend of Wild West lawman Wyatt Earp and the untold true story behind the most famous shoot-out in American history, The Gunfight At The O.K. Corral. It received rave reviews.Previously, Henry wrote BORN A KING (2019), a $21 million historical drama and coming-of-age story which broke box office records across the Gulf and Middle East, opening at Number 1. Directed by Goya winner Agust\\u00ed Villaronga, it won Best Film at the Inward Eye Film Festival, Lake District.He co-wrote SLAUGHTERHOUSE RULEZ (2018), a comedy-horror set in a British boarding school with an all star cast, including Asa Butterfield, Simon Pegg, Nick Frost, Michael Sheen, Finn Cole and Margot Robbie.A former journalist, Henry is a Visiting Lecturer at the London Film School and has taught at numerous film schools and writers\\u2019 workshops.Website: henryfitzherbert.com\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"72\"],\"search\":\"Riverscribes: Introduction to Screenwriting Riverscribes: Introduction to Screenwriting Workshops & Classes  <p>Have you ever watched a bad film and thought \\u2018I can do better than that?\\u2019 The chances are you can!<\\/p><p>Join Netflix screenwriter Henry Fitzherbert for a series of workshops that strip away the mystique of writing for the screen in a fun and collaborative environment.<\\/p><p>It\\u2019s Henry\\u2019s firm belief that anyone, armed with the right tools, can write a screenplay and you\\u2019ll explore all the essentials of the craft - from what makes a compelling character - to theme, structure and story world.<\\/p><p>Bring your own idea or draft screenplay to discuss with the group, or simply come to be inspired with like-minded creatives.<\\/p><p>The sessions are open to complete beginners, or more experienced writers looking for inspiration.<\\/p><p>Don\\u2019t just dream. Do it!<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>About Henry Fitzherbert:<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Henry is a screenwriter for film and television and will bring a wealth of experience and insights from working with Hollywood studios, streamers, A-list actors and directors and numerous British and American production companies.<\\/p><p>He co-wrote the hit Netflix series <i>WYATT EARP &amp; THE COWBOY WAR<\\/i> (2024), which reached Number 3 globally and was a top ten hit in 47 countries. Narrated by Ed Harris, the series explores the legend of Wild West lawman Wyatt Earp and the untold true story behind the most famous shoot-out in American history, The Gunfight At The O.K. Corral. It received rave reviews.<\\/p><p>Previously, Henry wrote <i>BORN A KING<\\/i> (2019), a $21 million historical drama and coming-of-age story which broke box office records across the Gulf and Middle East, opening at Number 1. Directed by Goya winner Agust\\u00ed Villaronga, it won Best Film at the Inward Eye Film Festival, Lake District.<\\/p><p>He co-wrote<i> SLAUGHTERHOUSE RULEZ <\\/i>(2018), a comedy-horror set in a British boarding school with an all star cast, including Asa Butterfield, Simon Pegg, Nick Frost, Michael Sheen, Finn Cole and Margot Robbie.<\\/p><p>A former journalist, Henry is a Visiting Lecturer at the <strong>London Film School<\\/strong> and has taught at numerous film schools and writers\\u2019 workshops.<\\/p><p>Website: henryfitzherbert.com<\\/p> Riverscribes: Introduction to Screenwriting  Have you ever watched a bad film and thought \\u2018I can do better than that?\\u2019 The chances are you can!Join Netflix screenwriter Henry Fitzherbert for a series of workshops that strip away the mystique of writing for the screen in a fun and collaborative environment.It\\u2019s Henry\\u2019s firm belief that anyone, armed with the right tools, can write a screenplay and you\\u2019ll explore all the essentials of the craft - from what makes a compelling character - to theme, structure and story world.Bring your own idea or draft screenplay to discuss with the group, or simply come to be inspired with like-minded creatives.The sessions are open to complete beginners, or more experienced writers looking for inspiration.Don\\u2019t just dream. Do it!\\u00a0About Henry Fitzherbert:Henry is a screenwriter for film and television and will bring a wealth of experience and insights from working with Hollywood studios, streamers, A-list actors and directors and numerous British and American production companies.He co-wrote the hit Netflix series WYATT EARP & THE COWBOY WAR (2024), which reached Number 3 globally and was a top ten hit in 47 countries. Narrated by Ed Harris, the series explores the legend of Wild West lawman Wyatt Earp and the untold true story behind the most famous shoot-out in American history, The Gunfight At The O.K. Corral. It received rave reviews.Previously, Henry wrote BORN A KING (2019), a $21 million historical drama and coming-of-age story which broke box office records across the Gulf and Middle East, opening at Number 1. Directed by Goya winner Agust\\u00ed Villaronga, it won Best Film at the Inward Eye Film Festival, Lake District.He co-wrote SLAUGHTERHOUSE RULEZ (2018), a comedy-horror set in a British boarding school with an all star cast, including Asa Butterfield, Simon Pegg, Nick Frost, Michael Sheen, Finn Cole and Margot Robbie.A former journalist, Henry is a Visiting Lecturer at the London Film School and has taught at numerous film schools and writers\\u2019 workshops.Website: henryfitzherbert.com Workshops & Classes\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/gH-her-and-the-voice-in-her-head\\/\",\"id\":\"982\",\"name\":\"Her and the Voice in Her Head\",\"title\":\"Her and the Voice in Her Head\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Theatre\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1770681600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/32401\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1770751800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1770768000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"3\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/32601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1770838200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1770681600,1770768000],\"start_date\":\"1770751800\",\"end_date\":\"1770838200\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"cTNXdy8rTDdoT0R2NVowT3Y1VVZkZz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Tue 10 - Wed 11 Feb 2026\",\"text\":\"Her and the Voice in Her Head follows a woman in her mid-20s \\u2013 known only as Her \\u2013 as she navigates the emotional comedown of a recently ended situationship.&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/95\\/7c49f4b59a4ae47aed8f62dbefeace\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx66\\/cy28\\/cw1956\\/ch1952\\/images\\/uploads\\/957c49f4b59a4ae47aed8f62dbefeace.jpeg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/95\\/7c49f4b59a4ae47aed8f62dbefeace\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx66\\/cy28\\/cw1956\\/ch1952\\/images\\/uploads\\/957c49f4b59a4ae47aed8f62dbefeace.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/95\\/7c49f4b59a4ae47aed8f62dbefeace\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx66\\/cy28\\/cw1956\\/ch1952\\/images\\/uploads\\/957c49f4b59a4ae47aed8f62dbefeace.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/95\\/7c49f4b59a4ae47aed8f62dbefeace\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx66\\/cy28\\/cw1956\\/ch1952\\/images\\/uploads\\/957c49f4b59a4ae47aed8f62dbefeace.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/95\\/7c49f4b59a4ae47aed8f62dbefeace\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx66\\/cy28\\/cw1956\\/ch1952\\/images\\/uploads\\/957c49f4b59a4ae47aed8f62dbefeace.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/95\\/7c49f4b59a4ae47aed8f62dbefeace\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx66\\/cy28\\/cw1956\\/ch1952\\/images\\/uploads\\/957c49f4b59a4ae47aed8f62d