\\/wpojpg\\/cx625\\/cy62\\/cw1038\\/ch1036\\/images\\/uploads\\/5bdfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5b\\/dfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx625\\/cy62\\/cw1038\\/ch1036\\/images\\/uploads\\/5bdfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5b\\/dfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx625\\/cy62\\/cw1038\\/ch1036\\/images\\/uploads\\/5bdfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5b\\/dfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx625\\/cy62\\/cw1038\\/ch1036\\/images\\/uploads\\/5bdfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5b\\/dfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx625\\/cy62\\/cw1038\\/ch1036\\/images\\/uploads\\/5bdfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5b\\/dfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx625\\/cy62\\/cw1038\\/ch1036\\/images\\/uploads\\/5bdfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5b\\/dfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx625\\/cy62\\/cw1038\\/ch1036\\/images\\/uploads\\/5bdfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5b\\/dfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx625\\/cy62\\/cw1038\\/ch1036\\/images\\/uploads\\/5bdfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5b\\/dfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx625\\/cy62\\/cw1038\\/ch1036\\/images\\/uploads\\/5bdfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5b\\/dfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx625\\/cy62\\/cw1038\\/ch1036\\/images\\/uploads\\/5bdfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Written and performed by Lisa RoseNorth London actress and writer\\u00a0Lisa Rose\\u00a0brings her powerful and darkly funny solo show\\u00a0Too Small to\\u00a0Tellto the stage \\u2014 a deeply personal story inspired by her experiences working for a now-notorious film mogul in the 1990s.Blending humour and heartbreak, Rose explores power, silence, and survival in an industry built on secrets. Following\\u00a0sold-out performances at Park Theatre\\u00a0and\\u00a0packed houses at Upstairs at the Gatehouse, the play was\\u00a0shortlisted for Best New Play at Brighton Fringe 2025.Directed by\\u00a0Elizabeth Ranken\\u00a0and co-created with\\u00a0Paula B. Stanic, *Too Small to\\u00a0Tell\\u00a0is a timely and gripping exploration of resilience, sisterhood, and speaking truth to power.\\\"Truthful, touching, timely, terrific!\\\"\\\"A story that should never stop being told.\\\"\\u00a0@toosmalltotell |\\u00a0facebook.com\\/toosmalltotell\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"3\"],\"age_rating\":[\"80929\"],\"search\":\"Too Small to Tell Too Small to Tell Theatre  <p><strong>Written and performed by Lisa Rose<\\/strong><\\/p><p>North London actress and writer&nbsp;<strong>Lisa Rose<\\/strong>&nbsp;brings her powerful and darkly funny solo show&nbsp;<i><strong>Too Small to&nbsp;Tell<\\/strong><\\/i>to the stage \\u2014 a deeply personal story inspired by her experiences working for a now-notorious film mogul in the 1990s.<\\/p><p>Blending humour and heartbreak, Rose explores power, silence, and survival in an industry built on secrets. Following&nbsp;<strong>sold-out performances at Park Theatre<\\/strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>packed houses at Upstairs at the Gatehouse<\\/strong>, the play was&nbsp;<strong>shortlisted for Best New Play at Brighton Fringe 2025<\\/strong>.<\\/p><p>Directed by&nbsp;<strong>Elizabeth Ranken<\\/strong>&nbsp;and co-created with&nbsp;<strong>Paula B. Stanic<\\/strong>, *<i>Too Small to&nbsp;Tell<\\/i>&nbsp;is a timely and gripping exploration of resilience, sisterhood, and speaking truth to power.<\\/p><blockquote><p><i>\\\"Truthful, touching, timely, terrific!\\\"<\\/i><br><i>\\\"A story that should never stop being told.\\\"<\\/i><\\/p><\\/blockquote><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>@toosmalltotell |&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/toosmalltotell\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">facebook.com\\/toosmalltotell<\\/a><\\/p> Too Small to Tell  Written and performed by Lisa RoseNorth London actress and writer\\u00a0Lisa Rose\\u00a0brings her powerful and darkly funny solo show\\u00a0Too Small to\\u00a0Tellto the stage \\u2014 a deeply personal story inspired by her experiences working for a now-notorious film mogul in the 1990s.Blending humour and heartbreak, Rose explores power, silence, and survival in an industry built on secrets. Following\\u00a0sold-out performances at Park Theatre\\u00a0and\\u00a0packed houses at Upstairs at the Gatehouse, the play was\\u00a0shortlisted for Best New Play at Brighton Fringe 2025.Directed by\\u00a0Elizabeth Ranken\\u00a0and co-created with\\u00a0Paula B. Stanic, *Too Small to\\u00a0Tell\\u00a0is a timely and gripping exploration of resilience, sisterhood, and speaking truth to power.\\\"Truthful, touching, timely, terrific!\\\"\\\"A story that should never stop being told.\\\"\\u00a0@toosmalltotell |\\u00a0facebook.com\\/toosmalltotell Theatre Recommended 16+\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/Zt-national-theatre-live-the-audience\\/\",\"id\":\"1070\",\"name\":\"National Theatre Live: The Audience\",\"title\":\"National Theatre Live: The Audience\",\"duration\":\"180 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Cinema\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1772064000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"101\",\"81001\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/