e80736\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx824\\/cy71\\/cw416\\/ch416\\/images\\/uploads\\/82a91fc4423ef2810d1285b601e80736.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/82\\/a91fc4423ef2810d1285b601e80736\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx824\\/cy71\\/cw416\\/ch416\\/images\\/uploads\\/82a91fc4423ef2810d1285b601e80736.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Returning to cinemas for the first time in over a decade, Helen Mirren plays Queen Elizabeth II in the Olivier and Tony Award\\u00ae -winning hit production, directed by Stephen Daldry. \\u00a0\\u00a0For 60 years, Queen Elizabeth II met with each of her 12 prime ministers in a private weekly meeting. This meeting is known as The Audience. From Winston Churchill to Margaret Thatcher and David Cameron, the Queen advised her prime ministers on matters both public and personal. Through these private audiences, we see glimpses of the woman behind the crown and witness the moments that shaped a monarch.\\u00a0Peter Morgan\\u2019s Netflix phenomenon The Crown was based on this hit play that was captured live from London\\u2019s West End in 2013 and went on to become one of the most-watched NT Live productions.\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"101\"],\"event_age_ratings\":[\"81001\"],\"search\":\"National Theatre Live: The Audience National Theatre Live: The Audience Cinema  <p>Returning to cinemas for the first time in over a decade, Helen Mirren plays Queen Elizabeth II in the <strong>Olivier <\\/strong>and <strong>Tony Award\\u00ae -winning<\\/strong> hit production, directed by Stephen Daldry. &nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>For 60 years, Queen Elizabeth II met with each of her 12 prime ministers in a private weekly meeting. This meeting is known as<strong> The Audience<\\/strong>. From Winston Churchill to Margaret Thatcher and David Cameron, the Queen advised her prime ministers on matters both public and personal. Through these private audiences, we see glimpses of the woman behind the crown and witness the moments that shaped a monarch.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Peter Morgan\\u2019s Netflix phenomenon<i> The Crown<\\/i> was based on this hit play that was captured <strong>live from London\\u2019s West End<\\/strong> in 2013 and went on to become one of the most-watched NT Live productions.<\\/p> National Theatre Live: The Audience  Returning to cinemas for the first time in over a decade, Helen Mirren plays Queen Elizabeth II in the Olivier and Tony Award\\u00ae -winning hit production, directed by Stephen Daldry. \\u00a0\\u00a0For 60 years, Queen Elizabeth II met with each of her 12 prime ministers in a private weekly meeting. This meeting is known as The Audience. From Winston Churchill to Margaret Thatcher and David Cameron, the Queen advised her prime ministers on matters both public and personal. Through these private audiences, we see glimpses of the woman behind the crown and witness the moments that shaped a monarch.\\u00a0Peter Morgan\\u2019s Netflix phenomenon The Crown was based on this hit play that was captured live from London\\u2019s West End in 2013 and went on to become one of the most-watched NT Live productions. Cinema 12A\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/Zj-othello\\/\",\"id\":\"1075\",\"name\":\"Othello\",\"title\":\"Othello\",\"duration\":\"165 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"Cinema\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1772582400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"101\",\"81000\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/38201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1772652600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1772841600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[\"101\",\"81000\"],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/38401\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\