31\\/ch2528\\/images\\/uploads\\/4a1fb3c1a0730ae92365c52f788701f5.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/4a\\/1fb3c1a0730ae92365c52f788701f5\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx699\\/cw2531\\/ch2528\\/images\\/uploads\\/4a1fb3c1a0730ae92365c52f788701f5.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/4a\\/1fb3c1a0730ae92365c52f788701f5\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx699\\/cw2531\\/ch2528\\/images\\/uploads\\/4a1fb3c1a0730ae92365c52f788701f5.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/4a\\/1fb3c1a0730ae92365c52f788701f5\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx699\\/cw2531\\/ch2528\\/images\\/uploads\\/4a1fb3c1a0730ae92365c52f788701f5.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/4a\\/1fb3c1a0730ae92365c52f788701f5\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx699\\/cw2531\\/ch2528\\/images\\/uploads\\/4a1fb3c1a0730ae92365c52f788701f5.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/4a\\/1fb3c1a0730ae92365c52f788701f5\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx699\\/cw2531\\/ch2528\\/images\\/uploads\\/4a1fb3c1a0730ae92365c52f788701f5.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/4a\\/1fb3c1a0730ae92365c52f788701f5\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx699\\/cw2531\\/ch2528\\/images\\/uploads\\/4a1fb3c1a0730ae92365c52f788701f5.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/4a\\/1fb3c1a0730ae92365c52f788701f5\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx699\\/cw2531\\/ch2528\\/images\\/uploads\\/4a1fb3c1a0730ae92365c52f788701f5.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/4a\\/1fb3c1a0730ae92365c52f788701f5\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx699\\/cw2531\\/ch2528\\/images\\/uploads\\/4a1fb3c1a0730ae92365c52f788701f5.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"\\\" Y'all here for the sweet sounds?You're in the right place!\\u00a0Riverside Folk & Blues Nights presentEvol Creation\\u2019s\\u00a0SWEET SOUNDS OF THE SOUTH\\u00a0Hosted by Actor\\/Producer Olivier SubletIt\\u2019s all about songs and songwriters!\\u00a0\\u00a0Riversides Studios' Folk & Blues music nights return in 2026 with monthly recurrence!Celebrating the singersongwriters with covers and originals, songs\\u00a0you'll love and songs you already\\u00a0love, by London's emerging performers lead by Tom Scammel\\u00a0who's igniting the internet with 22 million views across social media, like an English John Mayer with a pop sensibility, a unique soloing and rhythmic comping style with a soulful voice. Tom's with us every month soloing his biggest TikTok hits like Sultans of Swing, Wish You Were Here by Pink Floyd and previewing his self-penned singles he's releasing after the gigs, what will it be this month? \\u00a0Stay tuned for our exciting 2026 line up, coming soon!Y'all here for the sweet sounds?You're in the right place!NEXT GIGS7th\\u00a0March4th\\u00a0April16th\\u00a0MayEvol Creation is an interdisciplinary arts company focusing on reintroducing ritual into modern theater and exploring the grey area of morality through performance, visual art, movement, and music. Without an audience, there is no show; we immerse our audience in a world where they and the performers work together and create a place where people come, not to escape, but to be part of the story.\\\"\",\"book_link\":false,\"event_type\":[\"113\"],\"search\":\"Sweet Sounds Of The South Sweet Sounds Of The South Music  <h3>\\\" <strong>Y'all here for the sweet sounds?<\\/strong><\\/h3><h3><strong>You're in the right place!<\\/strong><\\/h3><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Riverside Folk &amp; Blues Nights present<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>Evol Creation\\u2019s&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>SWEET SOUNDS OF THE SOUTH<\\/strong><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Hosted by Actor\\/Producer Olivier Sublet<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>It\\u2019s all about songs and songwriters!&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Riversides Studios' Folk &amp; Blues music nights return in 2026 with monthly recurrence!<\\/strong><\\/p><p><br>Celebrating the singersongwriters with covers and originals, songs&nbsp;you'll love and songs you already&nbsp;love, by London's emerging performers lead by <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/drive.google.com\\/file\\/d\\/1sGb7Mwkm7TRa8HmxXD-c4tI7fJsgMoT3\\/view?usp=drive_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Tom Scammel<\\/a>&nbsp;who's igniting the internet with 22 million views across social media, like an English John Mayer with a pop sensibility, a unique soloing and rhythmic comping style with a soulful voice. Tom's with us every month soloing his biggest TikTok hits like Sultans of Swing, Wish You Were Here by Pink Floyd and previewing his self-penned singles he's releasing after the gigs, what will it be this month? &nbsp;<\\/p><p>Stay tuned for our exciting 2026 line up, coming soon!<\\/p><p>Y'all here for the sweet sounds?<br>You're in the right place!<\\/p><p><strong>NEXT GIGS<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>7th&nbsp;March<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>4th&nbsp;April<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>16th&nbsp;May<\\/strong><\\/p><p><i><strong>Evol Creation is an interdisciplinary arts company focusing on reintroducing ritual into modern theater and exploring the grey area of morality through performance, visual art, movement, and music. Without an audience, there is no show; we immerse our audience in a world where they and the performers work together and create a place where people come, not to escape, but to be part of the story.\\\"<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p> Sweet Sounds Of The South  \\\" Y'all here for the sweet sounds?You're in the right place!\\u00a0Riverside Folk & Blues Nights presentEvol Creation\\u2019s\\u00a0SWEET SOUNDS OF THE SOUTH\\u00a0Hosted by Actor\\/Producer Olivier SubletIt\\u2019s all about songs and songwriters!\\u00a0\\u00a0Riversides Studios' Folk & Blues music nights return in 2026 with monthly recurrence!Celebrating the singersongwriters with covers and originals, songs\\u00a0you'll love and songs you already\\u00a0love, by London's emerging performers lead by Tom Scammel\\u00a0who's igniting the internet with 22 million views across social media, like an English John Mayer with a pop sensibility, a unique soloing and rhythmic comping style with a soulful voice. Tom's with us every month soloing his biggest TikTok hits like Sultans of Swing, Wish You Were Here by Pink Floyd and previewing his self-penned singles he's releasing after the gigs, what will it be this month? \\u00a0Stay tuned for our exciting 2026 line up, coming soon!Y'all here for the sweet sounds?You're in the right place!NEXT GIGS7th\\u00a0March4th\\u00a0April16th\\u00a0MayEvol Creation is an interdisciplinary arts company focusing on reintroducing ritual into modern theater and exploring the grey area of morality through performance, visual art, movement, and music. Without an audience, there is no show; we immerse our audience in a world where they and the performers work together and create a place where people come, not to escape, but to be part of the story.\\\" Music\"}]",
