roperty=\"og:url\" content=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/whats-on/LF-wake-up-dead-man-a-knives-out-mystery/\">\n                  <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/uploads/7b516980e1faf31056b69bb23d8e0738.JPG\">\n                  <meta property=\"og:image:secure_url\" content=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/uploads/7b516980e1faf31056b69bb23d8e0738.JPG\">\n                  <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"“Whodunnit threequel is murderously good fun” - Guardian ★★★★Benoit Blanc (Daniel Craig) returns for his most dangerous case yet in the third and darkest chapter of Rian Johnson’s murder mystery opus. Starring Daniel Craig, Josh O’Connor, \">\n                  <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Riverside Studios\">\n                  <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"EN_GB\">\n                  <meta property=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n                  <meta property=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@RiversideLondon\">\n                  <meta property=\"twitter:creator\" content=\"@RiversideLondon\">\n                  <meta property=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery - Riverside Studios\">\n                  <meta property=\"twitter:description\" content=\"“Whodunnit threequel is murderously good fun” - Guardian ★★★★Benoit Blanc (Daniel Craig) returns for his most dangerous case yet in the third and darkest chapter of Rian Johnson’s murder mystery opus. Starring Daniel Craig, Josh O’Connor, \">\n                  <meta property=\"twitter:image:src\" content=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/uploads/7b516980e1faf31056b69bb23d8e0738.JPG\">\n                  <meta property=\"twitter:image:alt\" content=\"Riverside Studios\">\n                  <meta property=\"twitter:domain\" content=\"riversidestudios.co.uk\">\n            \n\n\n\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/favicon