   <div class=\"template-left   \">\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <blockquote><p>\"Ethan Hawke is terrific in Richard Linklater’s bitter Broadway breakup drama\" - Guardian ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️</p></blockquote><p>Richard Linklater (<i>Boyhood</i>, <i>The Before Trilogy</i>) re-teams once more with Ethan Hawke for this acclaimed look at the twilight years of one of the world's great song maestros.</p><p>On the evening of March 31, 1943, legendary lyricist Lorenz Hart confronts his shattered self-confidence in Sardi’s bar as his former collaborator Richard Rodgers celebrates the opening night of his ground-breaking hit musical “<i>Oklahoma</i>!”.</p></div>            \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n         </div>\r\n\r\n           <aside class=\"template-right\">\r\n               <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n                \r\n                  <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                      <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Duration:  </div>\r\n                      <span class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\">100 minutes</span>\r\n                    </div>                  \r\n                    \r\n                  \r\n                  \r\n                                  <div id=\"event-performances\" class=\"performance_details\"></div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n               </div>\r\n\r\n           </aside>\r\n       \r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n</div>\r\n  </main>\n\r\n<footer class=\"footer\">\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"container-wide desktop-only-break-1024\">\r\n    <div class=\"footer-inner\">\r\n\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"footer-navs\">\r\n\r\n\r\n                  <div class=\"footer-section\">\r\n\r\n                            <h5 class=\"footer-nav-title font-xxsmall font-title font-uppercase font-white\">See Also</h5>\r\n                            <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-tex