\r\n      </div>\r\n      \r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n      <div class=\"template-bottom\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"template-bottom-inner \">\r\n            <div class=\"template-left   \">\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <h3><strong>For our Quentin Tarantino Weekender on 10-11 January you can enjoy 20% off the adult price if you buy a ticket for ONE UPON A TIME IN HOLLYWOOD + Q&amp;A on 10 Jan and a ticket to one of the KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR screenings on the same weekend!</strong></h3><p>Get ready to return to the grindhouse — Lionsgate is bringing Quentin Tarantino’s legendary revenge saga back to the big screen with <i><strong>KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR</strong></i>.</p><p>For the first time, experience <strong>Volumes 1 &amp; 2 </strong>seamlessly united in one epic cinematic event — featuring a never-before-seen scene that makes this the ultimate Tarantino cut.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>Includes a 15 minute intermission.</strong></i></p></div>            \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n         </div>\r\n\r\n           <aside class=\"template-right\">\r\n               <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n                \r\n                  <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                      <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Duration:  </div>\r\n                      <span class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\">241 minutes</span>\r\n                    </div>                  \r\n                    \r\n                  \r\n                  \r\n                                  <div id=\"event-performances\" class=\"performance_details\"></div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n               </div>\r\n\r\n           </aside>\r\n       \r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      <