            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Disremember + Q&A | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"London Breeze is delighted to have an opportunity to bring the winner of its Best Feature Fiction award for 2025, taut psychological thriller, DISREMEMBER, to the Riverside Studios. After learning his wife wants a divorce, a struggling alcoholic wakes up \">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Disremember + Q&A\",\"description\":\"London Breeze is delighted to have an opportunity to bring the winner of its Best Feature Fiction award for 2025, taut psychological thriller, DISREMEMBER, to the Riverside Studios. &nbsp;After learning his wife wants a divorce, a struggling alcoholic wakes up unexpectedly in his friend\\u2019s apartment with no memory of how he got there. As Rob tries to piece together what happened, the blackouts continue, leaving him in unfamiliar places with no recollection of how he got there. Determined to regain control, he installs CCTV cameras\\u2014only to discover something far more disturbing than he ever imagined. A truth his own mind refuses to remember.Writer, director and actor, Matthew Simpson, will join us after the film to talk about his extraordinary journey to making his multi award winning debut feature as a solo filmmaker. Come and be inspired.\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/2454d8f8c70435d09d7b10df03