g/images/uploads/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 880w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/0c/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970/w1210/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 1210w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/0c/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970/w1470/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 1470w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/0c/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970/w1600/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/0c/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970/w1600/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/0c/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970/w1600/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/0c/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970/w1600/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 2880w\">\r\n                                <img fetchpriority=\"high\" sizes=\"100vw\"  style=\"object-position: 51.8% 49.8% \" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/0c/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970/w880/q80/images/uploads/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.jpg\"  data-custom=\"{&quot;img_src&quot;:&quot;images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.jpg&quot;,&quot;fx&quot;:&quot;51.8&quot;,&quot;fy&quot;:&quot;49.8&quot;,&quot;original&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:&quot;1600&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:&quot;900&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;landscape&quot;}}\"  srcset=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/0c/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970/w880/q80/images/uploads/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.jpg 880w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/0c/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970/w1210/q80/images/uploads/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.jpg 1210w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/0c/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970/w1470/q80/images/uploads/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.jpg 1470w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/0c/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970/w1600/q80/images/uploads/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.jpg 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/0c/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970/w1600/q80/images/uploads/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.jpg 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/0c/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970/w1600/q80/images/uploads/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.jpg 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/0c/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970/w1600/q80/images/uploads/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.jpg 2880w\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                </picture>\r\n                \r\n                            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"template-content-outer\">\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"template-content\">\r\n            <div class=\"container \">\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"template-content-inner \">\r\n\r\n                   \r\n                  <div class=\"template-surtitle font-yellow font-uppercase font-tag font-title\">Cinema</div>  \r\n                                                        <div class=\"template-title-top\">\r\n                    <h1 class=\"template-title font-title font-xlarge font-uppercase \">\r\n                       <span>London Short Film Festival Showcase: Palestine Looks Back</span>\r\n              \r\n                     </h1>\r\n                                                <div class=\"age-rating r-18\" title=\"18\"></div>\r\n                                              <div class=\"template-tag\"></div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                    \r\n                  <div class=\"template-content-top\">\r\n                     <div class=\"template-date performance-date-range  font-uppercase font-tag font-title\"><span>Fri 30 Jan 2026 20:30</span></div>\r\n\r\n                  </div>\r\n                                    \r\n               \r\n\r\n           <div class=\"booking-info\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"booking-info-inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"cta-bar \" id=\"event-info\" data-hash=\"WjVuWm5uZHVqeERyUE1WSGhuQU5BUT09\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      \r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n      <div class=\"template-bottom\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"template-bottom-inner \">\r\n            <div class=\"template-left   \">\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <p><i>Palestinian voices who dared to go beyond what was asked, turning their gaze back on the West - its inaction, border regimes, colonial history, but also its solidarity and environment.</i></p><p><i>This programme is curated by Theo Panagopoulos.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Goodness Regime, dir. Jumana Manna and Sille Storihle, Norway / Palestine 2013, 20mins</p><p>It's a long way from Amphioxus, dir. Kamal Aljafari, Germany 2019, 16mins</p><p>Nachbarn (Neighbours), dir. Pary El-Qalqili and Christiane Schmidt, Germany 2018, 26 mins</p><p>Elefsina Notre Amour, dir. Mahdi Fleifel, Greece 2023, 9mins</p><p>They Live in Forests, They are Extremely Shy, dir. Saeed Taji Farouky, UK 2016, 4mins</p><p>We began by measuring distance, dir. Basma Alsharif, Egypt 2009, 19mins</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Contains themes of death and injury.</p></div>            \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n         </div>\r\n\r\n           <aside class=\"template-right\">\r\n               <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n                \r\n                  <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                      <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Duration:  </div>\r\n                      <span class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\">104 minutes</span>\r\n                    </div>                  \r\n                    \r\n                  \r\n                  \r\n                                  <div id=\"event-performances\" class=\"performance_details\"></div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n               </div>\r\n\r\n           </aside>\r\n       \r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n</div>\r\n  </main>\n\r\n<footer class=\"footer\">\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"container-wide desktop-only-break-1024\">\r\n    <div class=\"footer-inner\">\r\n\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"footer-navs\">\r\n\r\n\r\n                  <div class=\"footer-section\">\r\n\r\n                            <h5 class=\"footer-nav-title font-xxsmall font-title font-uppercase font-white\">See Also</h5>\r\n                            <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/vacancies/\">Vacancies</a>\r\n                          <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/policies/\">Policies</a>\r\n                        <div id=\"member-login\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n                  <div class=\"footer-section\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"footer-nav-top\">\r\n                                <h5 class=\"footer-nav-title font-xxsmall font-title font-uppercase font-white\">Our Website</h5>\r\n                                <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/privacy-and-cookies/\">Privacy and Cookies</a>\r\n                              <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/website-accessibility/\">Website Accessibility</a>\r\n                              <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/newsletter-signup/\">Newsletter signup</a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n        \r\n        \r\n              </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n 