            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Hancock XI | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Proudly presented as part of our MADE AT RIVERSIDE TV strand; celebrating the long history of film and TV production at Riverside Studios. Here we continue our longstanding celebration of the inimitable Tony Hancock, with a further three episodes of Hanco\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Hancock XI\",\"description\":\"Proudly presented as part of our MADE AT RIVERSIDE TV strand; celebrating the long history of film and TV production at Riverside Studios. Here we continue our longstanding celebration of the inimitable Tony Hancock, with a further three episodes of Hancock's classic work. The Tony Hancock Appreciation Society will introduce and discuss the episode afterwards as usual.&nbsp;Episodes:Hancock's Half Hour: The New Nose (Made at Riverside)Hancock (1963 ATV Series): The Eye WitnessHancock: The Bedsitter&nbsp;With thanks to our collaborators on this event, the Tony Hancock Appreciation Society, the estates of writers Ray Galton and Alan Simpson, the estate of Tony Hancock, and the British Film Institute.\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/635e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9.JPG\"],\"startDate\":\"2026-01-31T14:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-01-31T14:00:00+00:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>